ull},"nl":{"name":"Brussels Museum van de Molen en de Voeding","address_street_name":"Windmolenstraat","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"mbma-bmmv@evere.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.molenevere.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 37 79","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Windmolenstraat, 21","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":"Het Brussels Museum van de Molen en de Voeding is gelegen in de oude molen van Evere. Als unieke getuige van het industrieel erfgoed van Brussel, heeft dit beschermde monumentale gebouw alle technische ontwikkelingen van de negentiende en twintigste eeuw gekend. De permanente collecties illustreren de wereld en de geschiedenis van de molen van Evere. Elk jaar in september wordt de selectie van tentoongestelde voorwerpen compleet vernieuwd wat toelaat zich telkens opnieuw in een nieuw voedingsthema te verdiepen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Brussels Museum of the Mill and Food","address_street_name":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"mbma-bmmv@evere.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.moulindevere.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 37 79","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent, 21","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":"Based in a former windmill, the Brussels Museum of the Mill and Food is located in an extensive island of greenery. Since its opening in 2008, the museum has explored numerous topics related to food in temporary exhibitions.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Bruxellois du Moulin et de l'Alimentation","address_street_name":"Rue du Moulin \u00e0 Vent","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"mbma-bmmv@evere.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.moulindevere.be