e}},"translations":{"fr":["lundi et dimanche: ferm\u00e9","mardi, mercredi, jeudi et vendredi: \u00e0 partir de 20:30","samedi: \u00e0 partir de 19:00"],"nl":["maandag en zondag: gesloten","dinsdag, woensdag, donderdag en vrijdag: van 20:30","zaterdag: van 19:00"],"en":["monday and sunday: closed","tuesday, wednesday, thursday and friday: from 20:30","saturday: from 19:00"]},"date_start":"2022-05-11","date_end":"2022-06-25","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"date_exceptions":[{"day":"2022-06-19","start":"17:00:00","end":null}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":26},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Senior"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Senior"}},"value":23},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"},"en":{"name":"Young"}},"value":9},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Demandeurs d'emploi"},"nl":{"name":"Werkzoekenden"},"en":{"name":"Jobseekers"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T01:35:27+02:00","published_at":"2021-06-07T16:50:52+02:00","backoffice_id":232748,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.50714382231151},{"id":533840,"date_start":"2021-12-21","date_end":"2022-06-12","date_next":"2022-05-18","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,47],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Bande dessin\u00e9e"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Stripverhaal"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Comicstrip"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"George van Raemdonck, pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique","shortdescr":"En Belgique, la bande dessin\u00e9e telle qu\u2019on la d\u00e9finit officiellement appara\u00eet d\u00e8s 1929 avec Herg\u00e9, mais, avant cette date, un dessinateur anversois a mis en sc\u00e8ne les aventures de deux h\u00e9ros singuliers, contribuant ainsi \u00e0 \u00e9crire les premi\u00e8res lignes de l\u2019histoire de la bande dessin\u00e9e belge\u2026","longdescr":"N\u00e9 \u00e0 Anvers en 1888, George van Raemdonck a fait du dessin son mode de vie et d\u2019expression. \u00c0 la fois dessinateur de bande dessin\u00e9e, caricaturiste, illustrateur de livres et peintre, l\u2019artiste belge a multipli\u00e9 les supports et techniques pour mettre en images ses convictions et ce qui l\u2019entourait. Fuyant la guerre, il s\u2019installe aux Pays-Bas et s\u2019engage dans un travail de caricaturiste politique o\u00f9 il saisit l\u2019actualit\u00e9 jusque dans ses heures les plus sombres. Il devient c\u00e9l\u00e8bre dans le pays avec la s\u00e9rie de bande dessin\u00e9e \u00ab Fil de Fer et Boule de Gomme \u00bb, dont les textes sont sign\u00e9s A.M. de Jong, un ami et collaborateur pr\u00e9cieux. Sous son trait, les deux personnages embl\u00e9matiques vont \u00e9voluer au cours de nombreuses aventures aux quatre coins du monde. Cr\u00e9atif, l\u2019artiste varie les compositions, alterne les vues et les styles, passant d\u2019un dessin vif et simplifi\u00e9 \u00e0 un autre plus r\u00e9aliste et d\u00e9taill\u00e9. \r\n\r\nEn retra\u00e7ant le parcours de George van Raemdonck, l\u2019exposition propose de (re)d\u00e9couvrir l\u2019\u0153uvre d\u2019un pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique et d\u2019un dessinateur prolifique et talentueux, dont la s\u00e9rie majeure f\u00eatera ses 100 ans de cr\u00e9ation en 2022\u2026\r\n\r\nUne exposition produite par le Centre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e\r\nAvec le soutien de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cbbd.be\/fr\/expositions\/les-grandes-expositions-temporaires\/george-van-raemdonck","email":"visit@cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 219 19 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533840.html"},"nl":{"name":"George van Raemdonck, pionier van het Belgische Stripverhaal","shortdescr":"In Belgi\u00eb verschijnen de eerste stripverhalen, zoals we die nu officieel kennen, vanaf 1929 bij niemand minder dan Herg\u00e9. Er is echter een Antwerpse tekenaar die al net iets vroeger de avonturen van twee bijzondere helden op papier zette en zo mee de eerste bladzijde schrijft van de geschiedenis van het Belgische stripverhaal...","longdescr":"George van Raemdonck wordt in 1888 geboren in Antwerpen en maakt van tekenen al snel zijn leven, zijn manier om zich uit te drukken. De Belgische artiest gaat aan de slag als striptekenaar, karikaturist, illustrator van boeken en schilder en maakt zo gebruik van verschillende media en technieken om zijn idee\u00ebn en de wereld rondom hem vorm te geven. Wanneer de oorlog uitbreekt, vlucht hij naar Nederland. Daar tekent hij politieke karikaturen en ontleedt hij de actualiteit tot in de donkerste uren. Wanneer hij de stripreeks 'Bulletje en Boonestaak' uitbrengt, groeit hij al snel uit tot een bekend tekenaar in Nederland. De teksten van deze reeks worden geschreven door zijn dierbare vriend en collega A.M. de Jong. De twee iconische personages, de vrucht van van Raemdoncks potlood, veranderen overigens regelmatig van vorm terwijl ze de hele wereld rondreizen op zoek naar avontuur. De artiest laat zijn creativiteit de vrije loop en experimenteert met verschillende composities, invalshoeken en stijlen, van strakke, eenvoudige tekeningen tot meer realistische en gedetailleerde uitvoeringen. \r\n\r\nTijdens deze tentoonstelling volgt u het levenspad van George van Raemdonck en (her)ontdekt u het werk van een pionier van de Belgische stripkunst. U wordt meegenomen door het leven van een veelzijdige en getalenteerde tekenaar, wiens populairste reeks 100 jaar oud wordt in 2022 ...\r\n\r\nEen tentoonstelling van het Belgisch Stripcentrum\r\nMet de steun van het Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.stripmuseum.be\/nl\/tentoonstellingen\/tijdelijke-tentoonstellingen\/george-van-raemdonck","email":"visit@cbbd.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533840.html"},"en":{"name":"George van Raemdonck, pioneer of Belgian Comic Strip Art","shortdescr":"In Belgium, it was Herg\u00e9 who first introduced comic strip art as we know it in 1929. However, prior to this, an Antwerp-born comic strip artist had already dreamed up the adventures of two special characters, which helped to shape the early beginnings of the history of the Belgian comic strip art\u2026","longdescr":"For George van Raemdonck, who was born in Antwerp in 1888, drawing was just a way of life and his means of expression. Besides being a comic strip artist, this Belgian artist was also a caricaturist, a book illustrator and painter, and used a whole host of media and techniques to depict his beliefs and his surroundings. To escape the war, he settled in the Netherlands and started work as a political caricaturist, reporting the latest news even in the darkest of hours. He gained fame there with a comic strip series entitled Bulletje en Bonestaak [Beanstalk and Gumdrop] based on a script written by A.M. de Jong, who was a much-loved friend and colleague. By his skilful hand, these two emblematic characters evolved over the course of numerous adventures in the far-flung corners of the world. Being a highly creative artist, he varied his layouts, changed the backgrounds and styles, and switched from a bright and simplified style of drawing to one that was more realistic and detailed. \r\n\r\nBy retracing the steps of George van Raemdonck, the exhibition helps the general public to (re)discover the body of work of a pioneer of Belgian comic strip art and of a prolific and highly talented graphic artist, whose major series will be celebrating its centenary in 2022\u2026\r\n\r\nAn exhibition organised by the Belgian Comic Strip Center \r\nWith the Support of the Brussels-Capital Region","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/exhibitions\/the-great-temporary-exhibitions\/george-van-raemdonck","email":"visit@cbbd.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533840.html"},"de":{"name":"George van Raemdonck, pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533840.html"},"it":{"name":"George van Raemdonck, pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533840.html"},"sp":{"name":"George van Raemdonck, pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533840.html"},"pt":{"name":"George van Raemdonck, pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533840.html"},"cn":{"name":"George van Raemdonck, pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533840.html"}},"place":{"id":202864,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Attraction incontournable situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le mus\u00e9e de la BD met \u00e0 l'honneur depuis plus de 25 ans auteurs et h\u00e9ros du 9\u00e8me Art. \r\n\r\nLes expositions permanentes r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement renouvel\u00e9es et un vaste programme d'expositions temporaires am\u00e8nent les visiteurs \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir les innombrables facettes de la bande dessin\u00e9e. Tintin et les Schtroumpfs ouvrent la voie vers d'autres aventures, \u00e0 la rencontre d'un monde dont la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 n'a aucune limite. \r\n\r\nMagnifi\u00e9 par un exceptionnel cadre Art Nouveau con\u00e7u par Victor Horta, le Mus\u00e9e de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e est tout autant un hommage aux pionniers qu'un regard sur la BD actuelle.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Stripmuseum","address_street_name":"Zandstraat","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@stripmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.stripmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zandstraat, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Stripmuseum is voor al wie Brussel bezoekt een \u2018must\u2019 in het hartje van de stad. Al meer dan 25 jaar richt het museum de spots op de auteurs en de helden van de Negende Kunst. \r\n\r\nAan de hand van permanente tentoonstellingen \u2013 die regelmatig vernieuwd worden \u2013 en een afwisselend programma van tijdelijke exposities kan je er als bezoeker kennismaken met de talrijke facetten van het stripverhaal. Kuifje en de Smurfen nemen je mee naar avonturenland, een wereld waar de creativiteit geen grenzen kent. \r\n\r\nHet uitzonderlijke art nouveau-gebouw van Victor Horta geeft een bezoek nog een extra dimensie. Het Stripmuseum is tegelijk een hommage aan de pioniers van het medium als een blik op het hedendaagse stripverhaal.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"The Belgian Comic Strip Center","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"http:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"An accomplished attraction located in the heart of Brussels, the Belgian Comic Strip Center has been honouring the creators and heroes of the 9th Art for more than 25 years.\r\n\r\nThe regularly renewed permanent exhibitions and a diversified programme of temporary exhibitions enable visitors to discover the countless aspects of comics art. Tintin and the Smurfs lead the way towards further adventures, an encounter with a world where creativity has no limits. \r\n\r\nEnhanced by an exceptional Art Nouveau home designed by Victor Horta, the Belgian Comic Strip Center is just as much a tribute to the pioneers as a glimpse of contemporary comics art.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Comic-Museum - Centre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Br\u00fcssel als Comic-Hauptstadt g\u00f6nnt sich den Luxus eines eigenen Comic-Museums - das \u201eCentre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e\u201c. In einem eindrucksvollen Jugendstil-Bau aus der Feder von Victor Horta wird belgische und internationale Comic-Kunst pr\u00e4sentiert. Willkommen im Reich der Schl\u00fcmpfe, bei Tim und Struppi, Lucky Luke, Spirou, Gaston Lagaffe und all den anderen Comic-Helden!\r\n\r\nComic-Kunst und Jugendstilarchitektur: Der ber\u00fchmte Jugendstilarchitekt Victor Horta entwarf 1903, auf dem H\u00f6hepunkt seines Schaffens, Pl\u00e4ne f\u00fcr ein weitl\u00e4ufiges Bauwerk in Br\u00fcssel. Nach der Renovierung 1989 lie\u00df sich in den R\u00e4umen, die in allen Bereichen durch Jugendstilelemente gepr\u00e4gt sind, das \u201eCentre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e\", das Belgische Comiczentrum nieder, bei dem sich auf einer Fl\u00e4che von mehr als 4000 m\u00b2 - von den Urspr\u00fcngen bis hin zu avantgardistischen Werken - alles um Comics dreht.\r\n\r\nBelgische Comic-Kunst in all ihren Formen: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Kreativ-Workshops, Veranstaltungen, eine eigene Comic-Bibliothek mit Dokumentationszentrum sowie eine gut sortierte Buchhandlung bilden ein vielseitiges und buntes Comicangebot. Zentrale Themen der Dauerausstellung sind die Erfindung der Comic-Kunst, die Formen und die Entwicklung der Comic-Kunst sowie verschiedene Schwerpunkt auf belgische Comic-K\u00fcnstler von Peyo, dem Vater der Schl\u00fcmpfe bis Herg\u00e9, dem Erfinder von Tim & Struppi.\r\n\r\nComic-Fans auf zum Br\u00fcsseler Comic-Mekka!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo del Fumetto","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Il Museo del Fumetto CBBD, situato nel cuore storico di Bruxelles, riunisce su pi\u00f9 di 4.000 m\u00b2 tutto ci\u00f2 che riguarda il fumetto. Ospitato in un edificio tempio dell'Art Nouveau disegnato da Victor Horta, il museo \u00e8 il regno di celebri eroi dei fumetti belgi: Tintin, i Puffi, Lucky Luke, Gaston Lagaffe, Blake et Mortimer, Marsupilami... Le esposizioni organizzate, la biblioteca e il centro di documentazione, non solo rendono il museo vivo e dinamico, ma sono veri e propri centri di documentazione sul fumetto il cuicatalogo \u00e8 accessibile on-line. Il centro belga del fumetto organizza conferenze, laboratori creativi ed animazioni, ecc.\r\n\r\n\r\nAperto i giorni festivi eccetto il 25\/12 e 01\/01. Il Centro Belga del Fumetto diverse formule di visita: la visita guidata del museo, quella del Percorso del Fumetto o quella del museo Marc Sleen. Il museo, anzi il centro belga del fumetto-CBBD ospita anche una brasserie dove potete respirare l'inconfondibile atmosfera di Bruxelles.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Centro belga del c\u00f3mic (CBBD)","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ubicado en el centro de Bruselas, en un edificio Art Nouveau construido por Victor Horta en 1906, el CBBD abri\u00f3 sus puertas el 6 de octubre de 1989. \r\n\r\nEn pocos a\u00f1os, este museo se ha convertido en una de las principales atracciones de Bruselas. \r\n\r\nCada a\u00f1o, m\u00e1s de 200.000 visitantes recorren las exposiciones permanentes y temporales que se celebran en m\u00e1s de 4.000 m 2. \r\n\r\nAunque las exposiciones contribuyen a convertir este templo en un lugar viviente, din\u00e1mico y atrayente, esta herramienta al servicio de la promoci\u00f3n del c\u00f3mic constituye un centro de documentaci\u00f3n moderno, con un cat\u00e1logo accesible online. \r\n\r\nTambi\u00e9n se llevan a cabo conferencias y talleres creativos.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"O Centro Belga da Banda Desenhada","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Atra\u00e7\u00e3o incontorn\u00e1vel situada no centro de Bruxelas, o museu da BD comemora mais de 25 anos de autores e her\u00f3is da 9.\u00aa arte.\r\nAs exposi\u00e7\u00f5es permanentes regularmente renovadas e um vasto programa de exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias levam os visitantes a descobrir as in\u00fameras facetas da banda desenhada. Tintim e os Estrumpfes abrem a porta a outras aventuras, ao encontro de um mundo onde a criatividade n\u00e3o tem limites. \r\nAmpliado por uma moldura invulgar Arte Nouveau concebida por Victor Horta, o Museu da Banda Desenhada \u00e9 tanto uma homenagem aos pioneiros que um olhar sobre a BD atual.\r\nAberto todos os dias das 10 \u00e0s 18 horas.\r\nEntrada gratuita apenas com o Brussels Card \u201c100masters\u201d","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"The Belgian Comic Strip Center","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":405,"location":{"lat":50.85107181,"lon":4.36006874},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T01:35:59+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:30+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":202864,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Attraction incontournable situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le mus\u00e9e de la BD met \u00e0 l'honneur depuis plus de 25 ans auteurs et h\u00e9ros du 9\u00e8me Art. \r\n\r\nLes expositions permanentes r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement renouvel\u00e9es et un vaste programme d'expositions temporaires am\u00e8nent les visiteurs \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir les innombrables facettes de la bande dessin\u00e9e. Tintin et les Schtroumpfs ouvrent la voie vers d'autres aventures, \u00e0 la rencontre d'un monde dont la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 n'a aucune limite. \r\n\r\nMagnifi\u00e9 par un exceptionnel cadre Art Nouveau con\u00e7u par Victor Horta, le Mus\u00e9e de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e est tout autant un hommage aux pionniers qu'un regard sur la BD actuelle.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Stripmuseum","address_street_name":"Zandstraat","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@stripmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.stripmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zandstraat, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Stripmuseum is voor al wie Brussel bezoekt een \u2018must\u2019 in het hartje van de stad. Al meer dan 25 jaar richt het museum de spots op de auteurs en de helden van de Negende Kunst. \r\n\r\nAan de hand van permanente tentoonstellingen \u2013 die regelmatig vernieuwd worden \u2013 en een afwisselend programma van tijdelijke exposities kan je er als bezoeker kennismaken met de talrijke facetten van het stripverhaal. Kuifje en de Smurfen nemen je mee naar avonturenland, een wereld waar de creativiteit geen grenzen kent. \r\n\r\nHet uitzonderlijke art nouveau-gebouw van Victor Horta geeft een bezoek nog een extra dimensie. Het Stripmuseum is tegelijk een hommage aan de pioniers van het medium als een blik op het hedendaagse stripverhaal.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"The Belgian Comic Strip Center","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"http:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"An accomplished attraction located in the heart of Brussels, the Belgian Comic Strip Center has been honouring the creators and heroes of the 9th Art for more than 25 years.\r\n\r\nThe regularly renewed permanent exhibitions and a diversified programme of temporary exhibitions enable visitors to discover the countless aspects of comics art. Tintin and the Smurfs lead the way towards further adventures, an encounter with a world where creativity has no limits. \r\n\r\nEnhanced by an exceptional Art Nouveau home designed by Victor Horta, the Belgian Comic Strip Center is just as much a tribute to the pioneers as a glimpse of contemporary comics art.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Comic-Museum - Centre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Br\u00fcssel als Comic-Hauptstadt g\u00f6nnt sich den Luxus eines eigenen Comic-Museums - das \u201eCentre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e\u201c. In einem eindrucksvollen Jugendstil-Bau aus der Feder von Victor Horta wird belgische und internationale Comic-Kunst pr\u00e4sentiert. Willkommen im Reich der Schl\u00fcmpfe, bei Tim und Struppi, Lucky Luke, Spirou, Gaston Lagaffe und all den anderen Comic-Helden!\r\n\r\nComic-Kunst und Jugendstilarchitektur: Der ber\u00fchmte Jugendstilarchitekt Victor Horta entwarf 1903, auf dem H\u00f6hepunkt seines Schaffens, Pl\u00e4ne f\u00fcr ein weitl\u00e4ufiges Bauwerk in Br\u00fcssel. Nach der Renovierung 1989 lie\u00df sich in den R\u00e4umen, die in allen Bereichen durch Jugendstilelemente gepr\u00e4gt sind, das \u201eCentre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e\", das Belgische Comiczentrum nieder, bei dem sich auf einer Fl\u00e4che von mehr als 4000 m\u00b2 - von den Urspr\u00fcngen bis hin zu avantgardistischen Werken - alles um Comics dreht.\r\n\r\nBelgische Comic-Kunst in all ihren Formen: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Kreativ-Workshops, Veranstaltungen, eine eigene Comic-Bibliothek mit Dokumentationszentrum sowie eine gut sortierte Buchhandlung bilden ein vielseitiges und buntes Comicangebot. Zentrale Themen der Dauerausstellung sind die Erfindung der Comic-Kunst, die Formen und die Entwicklung der Comic-Kunst sowie verschiedene Schwerpunkt auf belgische Comic-K\u00fcnstler von Peyo, dem Vater der Schl\u00fcmpfe bis Herg\u00e9, dem Erfinder von Tim & Struppi.\r\n\r\nComic-Fans auf zum Br\u00fcsseler Comic-Mekka!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo del Fumetto","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Il Museo del Fumetto CBBD, situato nel cuore storico di Bruxelles, riunisce su pi\u00f9 di 4.000 m\u00b2 tutto ci\u00f2 che riguarda il fumetto. Ospitato in un edificio tempio dell'Art Nouveau disegnato da Victor Horta, il museo \u00e8 il regno di celebri eroi dei fumetti belgi: Tintin, i Puffi, Lucky Luke, Gaston Lagaffe, Blake et Mortimer, Marsupilami... Le esposizioni organizzate, la biblioteca e il centro di documentazione, non solo rendono il museo vivo e dinamico, ma sono veri e propri centri di documentazione sul fumetto il cuicatalogo \u00e8 accessibile on-line. Il centro belga del fumetto organizza conferenze, laboratori creativi ed animazioni, ecc.\r\n\r\n\r\nAperto i giorni festivi eccetto il 25\/12 e 01\/01. Il Centro Belga del Fumetto diverse formule di visita: la visita guidata del museo, quella del Percorso del Fumetto o quella del museo Marc Sleen. Il museo, anzi il centro belga del fumetto-CBBD ospita anche una brasserie dove potete respirare l'inconfondibile atmosfera di Bruxelles.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Centro belga del c\u00f3mic (CBBD)","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ubicado en el centro de Bruselas, en un edificio Art Nouveau construido por Victor Horta en 1906, el CBBD abri\u00f3 sus puertas el 6 de octubre de 1989. \r\n\r\nEn pocos a\u00f1os, este museo se ha convertido en una de las principales atracciones de Bruselas. \r\n\r\nCada a\u00f1o, m\u00e1s de 200.000 visitantes recorren las exposiciones permanentes y temporales que se celebran en m\u00e1s de 4.000 m 2. \r\n\r\nAunque las exposiciones contribuyen a convertir este templo en un lugar viviente, din\u00e1mico y atrayente, esta herramienta al servicio de la promoci\u00f3n del c\u00f3mic constituye un centro de documentaci\u00f3n moderno, con un cat\u00e1logo accesible online. \r\n\r\nTambi\u00e9n se llevan a cabo conferencias y talleres creativos.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"O Centro Belga da Banda Desenhada","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Atra\u00e7\u00e3o incontorn\u00e1vel situada no centro de Bruxelas, o museu da BD comemora mais de 25 anos de autores e her\u00f3is da 9.\u00aa arte.\r\nAs exposi\u00e7\u00f5es permanentes regularmente renovadas e um vasto programa de exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias levam os visitantes a descobrir as in\u00fameras facetas da banda desenhada. Tintim e os Estrumpfes abrem a porta a outras aventuras, ao encontro de um mundo onde a criatividade n\u00e3o tem limites. \r\nAmpliado por uma moldura invulgar Arte Nouveau concebida por Victor Horta, o Museu da Banda Desenhada \u00e9 tanto uma homenagem aos pioneiros que um olhar sobre a BD atual.\r\nAberto todos os dias das 10 \u00e0s 18 horas.\r\nEntrada gratuita apenas com o Brussels Card \u201c100masters\u201d","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"The Belgian Comic Strip Center","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":405,"location":{"lat":50.85107181,"lon":4.36006874},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T01:35:59+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:30+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/4e7d26d9f8865b60ef200ad2f44738b2a2afd4e4.jpg","width":1768,"height":2500,"ratio":0.71,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"George van Raemdonck, pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"George van Raemdonck, pionnier de la bande dessin\u00e9e en Belgique","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"George 