},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,261,263,266],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T01:36:15+02:00","published_at":"2022-02-03T10:35:20+01:00","backoffice_id":246799,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.30571070873288},{"id":525316,"date_start":"2022-02-18","date_end":"2022-05-22","date_next":"2022-05-18","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,40],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Arts graphiques"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Grafische kunst, vormgeving"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Graphic art"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"RHoK's Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression","shortdescr":"Les mus\u00e9es Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme & B\u00e9guinage accueillent la RHoK Academie pour leur nouvelle exposition temporaire.","longdescr":"Quel est l\u2019impact de l\u2019image en 2022 par rapport \u00e0 celui des premi\u00e8res illustrations imprim\u00e9es de la Renaissance ?\r\n\r\nC\u2019est ce que la Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme et les \u00e9tudiants de l\u2019atelier \u00ab Vrije Grafiek \u00bb de la RHoK Academie d\u2019Etterbeek vous proposent de d\u00e9couvrir \u00e0 travers une s\u00e9lection dynamique d\u2019\u0153uvres contemporaines qui interpellent visuellement les collections permanentes du mus\u00e9e.\r\nLes artistes pr\u00e9sentent un dialogue artistique sur le processus de cr\u00e9ation de l\u2019image. Des \u0153uvres \u00e0 support papier (gravure sur bois, lithographie, s\u00e9rigraphie, etc.) ou num\u00e9riques d\u00e9fient les collections permanentes de la Maison \u00c9rasme.\r\nCe chass\u00e9-crois\u00e9 entre \u00e9poques et repr\u00e9sentations \u00e9claire aussi la diffusion des id\u00e9es au XVIe si\u00e8cle, ch\u00e8re \u00e0 \u00c9rasme, et la met en perspective avec la prolif\u00e9ration virale des images dans les m\u00e9dias actuels.\r\n\r\nRHoK\u2019s Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression, une incursion dans le monde pass\u00e9 des images par des artistes d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui \u2013 quand l\u2019\u0153il et la vision deviennent lumi\u00e8re, couleur, cr\u00e9ation.\r\n\r\nArtistes:\r\nMajo Aerts, Dani\u00e8le Aron, Gabriel Barbatei, Ariane de Briey, Inke Coolen, Virginie Cornet, Mikke Decru, Charlotte Dorn, Francine Dugue, Anne-Marie Fiquet, Noelia Garcia Sanchez, V\u00e9ronique Goossens, Nicole d\u2019Herbais de Thun, Concetta Lanuziello, Gw\u00e9na\u00ebl Lebee, Marie Lebrun, Claire Le Clef, Alberte Lef\u00e8vre, Friedl Lesage, Sylvie Malfait Carakehian, Jean-Yves Mangnay, Marie-Luce Martin, Jessie Mayne, Lotte Pollaris, Marie-Yvonne Pr\u00e9vot, Amina Sa\u00e4di, S\u00e9bastien Sanfilippo, Bart Sibiel, Rosetta de Stefano, Olivier Stoupy, Marie-Anne Truffino, Marion Vander Meulen, Line Vangrunderbeeck, Alexandre Van Leemput, Annelies Van de Perre, Sander De Wilde, Pi-Chung Wu \u2026\r\n\r\nA propos de la RHoK Academie :\r\nLa RHoK Academie Beeldende & Audio-visuele Kunsten d\u2019Etterbeek est install\u00e9e dans les anciens b\u00e2timents de l\u2019imprimerie Phobel, joyau du patrimoine industriel bruxellois. L\u2019atelier \u00ab Vrije Grafiek\/Image imprim\u00e9e\/Printmaking \u00bb propose une formation pour adultes orient\u00e9e vers l\u2019expression libre et les techniques d\u2019impression. L\u2019atelier est en recherche constante de lieux inspirants et atypiques pour offrir \u00e0 ses \u00e9tudiants l\u2019opportunit\u00e9 de se renouveler, de penser et de cr\u00e9er des \u0153uvres dans des univers diff\u00e9rents, comme la Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme. Ainsi, la RHok Academie a d\u00e9j\u00e0 collabor\u00e9 avec, entre autres, le Mus\u00e9e Plantin-Moretus (Anvers) en 2011 (\u00ab Grafische kamers, RhoK interventie in Museum Plantin-Moretus \/ Prentenkabinet \u00bb) et les Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire (Bruxelles) en 2017 \u00e0 l\u2019occasion de l\u2019exposition \u00ab Ukiyo-e \u201cRhoKL-e\u201d \u00bb.\r\n\r\nEn collaboration avec visit.brussels.","performers":"RHoK Academie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/2022\/01\/18-0222-05-exposition-rhoks-eye-impression-expression\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/525316.html"},"nl":{"name":"RHoK's Eye \u2013 Indrukken \/ Afdrukken","shortdescr":"De tentoonstelling\u00a0biedt u de mogelijkheid om de permanente collecties van het museum vanuit een andere invalshoek te bekijken. Deze hedendaagse dialoog in samenwerking met hedendaagse kunstenaars van een kunstacademie maakt het mogelijk de kijker uit te dagen in een museum waar het verleden een centrale plaats inneemt.","longdescr":"Het atelier \"Vrije Grafiek\" van de RHoK Academie in Etterbeek gaat in dialoog met het artistieke creatieproces van het beeld. Werken op papier (houtsnede, lithografie, zeefdruk, enz.) of digitale werken worden gepresenteerd in relatie tot de permanente collecties van het Erasmushuis.\r\n\r\nDeze kruising tussen periodes en voorstellingen belicht ook de verspreiding van idee\u00ebn in de 16e eeuw, die Erasmus zo dierbaar was, en plaatst ze in perspectief met de virale proliferatie van beelden in de media van vandaag.\r\n\r\nRHoK's Eye \u2013 Indrukken \/ Afdrukken, de wereld van beelden uit het verleden gezien door de blik van hedendaagse kunstenaars \u2013 wanneer het menselijk oog in al zijn complexiteit licht, kleur en creatie wordt.\r\n\r\nKunstenaars \/ Kunstenaressen:\r\nMajo Aerts, Dani\u00e8le Aron, Gabriel Barbatei, Ariane de Briey, Inke Coolen, Virginie Cornet, Mikke Decru, Charlotte Dorn, Francine Dugue, Anne-Marie Fiquet, Noelia Garcia Sanchez, V\u00e9ronique Goossens, Nicole d\u2019Herbais de Thun, Concetta Lanuziello, Gw\u00e9na\u00ebl Lebee, Marie Lebrun, Claire Le Clef, Alberte Lef\u00e8vre, Friedl Lesage, Sylvie Malfait Carakehian, Jean-Yves Mangnay, Marie-Luce Martin, Jessie Mayne, Lotte Pollaris, Marie-Yvonne Pr\u00e9vot, Amina Sa\u00e4di, S\u00e9bastien Sanfilippo, Bart Sibiel, Rosetta de Stefano, Olivier Stoupy, Marie-Anne Truffino, Marion Vander Meulen, Line Vangrunderbeeck, Alexandre Van Leemput, Annelies Van de Perre, Sander De Wilde, Pi-Chung Wu \u2026\r\n\r\nOver de RhoK Academie:\r\nDe RHoK Academie in Etterbeek - Beeldende & Audiovisuele Kunsten (atelier Vrije Grafiek) is een school die voortdurend op zoek is naar inspirerende en atypische locaties om haar studenten de mogelijkheid te bieden zich te vernieuwen, na te denken en werken te cre\u00ebren in verschillende omgevingen. Een twintigtal studenten dompelden zich gedurende enkele maanden onder in het Erasmushuis en maakten kennis met de architectuur en de werken van deze plaats vol geschiedenis.\r\n\r\nIn samenwerking met visit.brussels.","performers":"RHoK Academie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/nl\/2022\/01\/18-0222-05-tentoonstelling-rhoks-eye-indrukken-afdrukken\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/525316.html"},"en":{"name":"RHoK's Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression","shortdescr":"The exhibition gives visitors the possibility of seeing the museums\u2019 permanent collections through another prism. A contemporary dialogue with contemporary artists from an art academy challenges one\u2019s gaze in a museum where the past plays a central role. Approaching our heritage through the eyes of these artists lets us open up to another age, to another world.","longdescr":"RHoK Academie\u2019s \"Vrije Grafiek\" (\u201cFree Graphics\u201d) workshop offers an artistic dialogue about the process of creating images. The works of art, be they on paper (woodcuts, lithographs, silk screen prints, etc.) or digital challenge the permanent collections of the Erasmus House.\r\n\r\nThis back-and-forth between eras and representations also sheds light on the dissemination of ideas in the 16th century \u2013 something dear to Erasmus\u2019s heart \u2013 and puts it in perspective with the viral spread of images in today\u2019s media. \r\n\r\nRHoK's Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression: images of bygone days seen through the eyes of today\u2019s artists, or when the eye and vision become light, colour, and creation. \r\n\r\nArtists:\r\nMajo Aerts, Dani\u00e8le Aron, Gabriel Barbatei, Ariane de Briey, Inke Coolen, Virginie Cornet, Mikke Decru, Charlotte Dorn, Francine Dugue, Anne-Marie Fiquet, Noelia Garcia Sanchez, V\u00e9ronique Goossens, Nicole d\u2019Herbais de Thun, Concetta Lanuziello, Gw\u00e9na\u00ebl Lebee, Marie Lebrun, Claire Le Clef, Alberte Lef\u00e8vre, Friedl Lesage, Sylvie Malfait Carakehian, Jean-Yves Mangnay, Marie-Luce Martin, Jessie Mayne, Lotte Pollaris, Marie-Yvonne Pr\u00e9vot, Amina Sa\u00e4di, S\u00e9bastien Sanfilippo, Bart Sibiel, Rosetta de Stefano, Olivier Stoupy, Marie-Anne Truffino, Marion Vander Meulen, Line Vangrunderbeeck, Alexandre Van Leemput, Annelies Van de Perre, Sander De Wilde, Pi-Chung Wu \u2026\r\n\r\nAbout RhoK Academie:\r\nThe Etterbeek-based art school RhoK Academie - Beeldende & Audiovisuele Kunsten (\"Vrije Grafiek\" workshop) is known for the quality of its work and is constantly searching for inspiring and atypical venues to give its students a chance to renew themselves, to think, and to create works of art in different worlds. A score of its students spent several months immersed in the Erasmus House museum familiarising themselves with the history-filled place, its architecture, and its holdings. \r\n\r\nIn collaboration with visit.brussels","performers":"RHoK Academie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum\/en\/2022\/01\/18-0222-05-exhibition-rhoks-eye-impression-expression\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/525316.html"},"de":{"name":"RHoK's Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/525316.html"},"it":{"name":"RHoK's Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/525316.html"},"sp":{"name":"RHoK's Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/525316.html"},"pt":{"name":"RHoK's Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/525316.html"},"cn":{"name":"RHoK's Eye \u2013 Impression \/ Expression","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/525316.html"}},"place":{"id":8600,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"\u00c9rasme a s\u00e9journ\u00e9 en 1521 dans cette maison gothique (1450-1515) qui rassemble \u00e0\r\nla fois une collection de peintures, gravures et scuptures (Albrecht Du\u0308rer, Joos Van\r\nCleve, Pieter Huys, Cornelis Metsys, Frans Francken le Jeune \u2026), une biblioth\u00e8que\r\nsp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans les \u00e9ditions princeps, c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire les premi\u00e8res \u00e9ditions d\u2019une \u0153uvre\r\nchez diff\u00e9rents imprimeurs, un Jardin philosophique et un Jardin de plantes\r\nm\u00e9dicinales. Le mus\u00e9e publie des livres et organise des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts,\r\ndes expositions d\u2019art contemporain et historiques, des activit\u00e9s p\u00e9dagogiques, des\r\nvisites guid\u00e9es pour groupes.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Erasmushuis","address_street_name":"Formanoirstraat","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Formanoirstraat, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"In 1521 verbleef Erasmus in dit gotische huis (1450-1515) waar zich niet alleen een collectie bevindt van schilderijen, prenten en beeldhouwwerken (Albrecht Du\u0308rer, Joos\r\nVan Cleve, Pieter Huys, Cornelis Metsys, Frans Francken de Jongere\u2026), maar ook een\r\nbibliotheek gespecialiseerd in \u2018editiones principes\u2019, dat wil zeggen de eerste uitgaven\r\nvan een werk bij verschillende drukkers. Verder bevindt zich buiten nog een Filosofische\r\ntuin en een tuin met Geneeskrachtige planten.\r\nDaarnaast publiceert het museum boeken en organiseert voordrachten, concerten,\r\ntentoonstellingen met een historisch thema en tentoonstellingen Hedendaagse kunst,\r\npedagogische activiteiten en rondleidingen voor groepen.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Erasmus House","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"For several years, this house, which looks like a cloister, was home to the brilliant 16th-century humanist. Works of art, engravings, books, and archives bear witness to life in that era. End your visit in the philosophical and medicinal garden.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Museum des Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Das \u201eMaison d\u2019Erasme\u201c in der Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinde Anderlecht wurde Ende des 15. Jahrhunderts im Auftrag eines Stiftsherrn der nahegelegenen Stiftskirche St. Peter und St. Guido  im sp\u00e4tgotischen Stil errichtet.\r\n\r\nDas Haus beherbergte im Jahr 1521 den bedeutenden niederl\u00e4ndischen Gelehrten des Renaissance-Humanismus Erasmus von Rotterdam, der hier, fernab von den gro\u00dfen Machtzentren und den dort herrschenden Religionskriegen, die Ruhe und Abgeschiedenheit der Natur suchte.\r\n\r\nDas im Maison d\u2019Erasme untergebrachte Museum zeigt sowohl eine Gem\u00e4ldesammlung mit Werken von Holbein, Bosch und Metsys als auch eine reich mit alten B\u00fccherausgaben best\u00fcckte Bibliothek. Der umliegende Garten besteht aus einem \u201eJardin des Maladies\u201c \u2013 dem \u201eGarten der Krankheiten\u201c mit zahlreichen Heilpflanzen \u2013 und einem \u201eJardin philosophique\u201c \u2013 dem \u201ePhilosophischen Garten\u201c.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Casa di Erasmo","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"La Casa di Erasmo deve il suo nome e la sua fama ad Erasmo da Rotterdam, che vi soggiorn\u00f2 nel 1521. Divenuta un museo dedicato al grande umanista rinascimentale, \u00e8 luogo di esposizione di una collezione unica composta da opere d'arte - sculture e dipinti di maestri fiamminghi -, mobili e libri antichi, molti dei quali scritti dallo stesso Erasmo. Se la Casa di Erasmo \u00e8 una delle pi\u00f9 antiche di Bruxelles - costruita in tre fasi nel corso dei secoli XV e XVI -, nel 1932 \u00e8 stata oggetto di un restauro completo voluto, nello spirito del pi\u00f9 puro storicismo, da Daniel Van Damme, fondatore del museo, con l'aiuto dell'architetto Charles Van Elst, che costru\u00ec anche la casa di Maurice Car\u00eame.  Gli spazi interni sono stati poi riconvertiti in sale del museo. Queste sono state decorate (una stanza con le pareti completamente rivestite di sontuose pelli di Cordoba) ed arredate con mobili provenienti dall'antica collezione del Ministro Vandenpeereboom. Gli interni sono quindi ricostruzioni con lo scopo di dare ai visitatori un'idea di quello che poteva essere una residenza rinascimentale. Le ricostruzioni sono in parte basate su documenti storici (lo studio di Erasmo che d\u00e0 sul giardino) ed in parte su ritrovamenti archeologici quali lo splendido fregio affrescato del primo piano. Nella parte posteriore della casa, un ampio giardino ombreggiato da grandi alberi conserva alcuni resti archeologici dell'antico castello di Anderlecht, poeticamente abbinati a diverse installazioni di artisti contemporanei. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Casa de Erasmo","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"La Casa de Erasmo debe su nombre y prestigio a la temporada que pas\u00f3 en ella Erasmo de R\u00f3terdam en 1521. Convertida en un museo dedicado a este gran humanista del Renacimiento, es el envoltorio de una colecci\u00f3n \u00fanica compuesta por obras de arte (esculturas y pinturas de maestros flamencos), muebles y libros antiguos, entre ellos numerosas ediciones erasmianas. Si la Casa de Erasmo es una de las m\u00e1s antiguas de Bruselas (construida en tres fases a lo largo de los siglos XV y XVI), a partir de 1932 fue objeto de una restauraci\u00f3n completa llevada a cabo, en el m\u00e1s puro historicismo, por Daniel Van Damme, fundador del museo, con la ayuda del arquitecto Charles Van Elst, que tambi\u00e9n construy\u00f3 la casa de Maurice Car\u00eame. Los espacios interiores se reorganizaron entonces en salas de museo que fueron decoradas (entre ellas, una sala con las paredes totalmente cubiertas por suntuosas pieles de C\u00f3rdoba) y amuebladas con mobiliario procedente de la antigua colecci\u00f3n del ministro Vandenpeereboom. El interior es, por tanto, una reproducci\u00f3n cuyo fin es dar a los visitantes la idea de lo que podr\u00eda haber sido una residencia en el Renacimiento, basada en parte en documentos hist\u00f3ricos (despacho de Erasmo frente al jard\u00edn) y en hallazgos arqueol\u00f3gicos como el maravilloso friso pintado al fresco del primer piso. Detr\u00e1s de la casa, un vasto jard\u00edn con grandes \u00e1rboles que le dan sombra conserva algunos restos arqueol\u00f3gicos del antiguo castillo de Anderlecht, los cuales se encuentran, po\u00e9ticamente, cerca de varias instalaciones de artistas contempor\u00e1neos. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Maison d'Erasme","address_street_name":"Rue de Formanoir","address_street_number":"31","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","website":"http:\/\/www.erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Formanoir, 31","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"dis