:null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature Estrangin Gallery","address_street_name":"Jules Besmestraat","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Jules Besmestraat, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"Aboriginal Signature Estrangin is een van Europa's meest toonaangevende hedendaagse Aboriginal kunstgalerijen. De aanpak is uniek: er worden 7 tentoonstellingen per jaar gecureerd in de 250m2 grote galerie (gelegen in de buurt van de Basiliek van Koekelberg). Ze vertegenwoordigt meer dan 100 autochtone kunstenaars, zowel gevestigd als opkomend talent, in een ethisch  partnerschap met hen en de 35 kunstcentra en gemeenschappen in de meest afgelegen van het Australisch continent. Elk jaar reist de directeur van de galerie naar de Aboriginalgebieden om samen met de kunstenaars tentoonstellingen voor te bereiden en ter plaatse werken te selecteren. Deze artistieke beweging, die rond 1971 in Papunya ontstond, maakt deel uit van een eeuwenoude dynamiek van kennisoverdracht en viering van heilige plaatsen, met een picturale expressie die traditie en vernieuwing combineert. Een beweging die aan belang wint in de kunstwereld, bij particuliere verzamelaars en in prestigieuze collecties van de grootste instellingen in Europa, de VS en Australi\u00eb.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature Estrangin Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"The Aboriginal Signature Estrangin gallery is one of the most important contemporary Aboriginal art galleries in Europe, whose approach is unique with 7 curatorial exhibitions per year in Brussels in its 250 m2 space, located in the basilica district of Koekelberg. The gallery represents more than 100 of Australia's most significant indigenous artists to the younger generation, and is committed to an ethical approach of partnership with them and the 35 art centers and artistic communities in the most remote deserts from the north to the south of this continent. Each year, the director of the gallery goes to the aboriginal territories to prepare the exhibitions with the artists and to select the works in situ. This artistic movement launched around 1971 in Papunya is part of a millennial dynamic of transmission of knowledge, of celebration of sacred places, with a pictorial expression between tradition and innovation. It is becoming increasingly important in the art world, with private collectors and prestigious collections from the largest institutions in Europe, the USA and Australia. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id