\nMARQUES ET MAGASINS PARTICIPANTS\r\n\r\nMipinta \u2014 Christoph Hefti \u2014 Farrah Floyd \u2014 Caroline du Chastel Jewellery \u2014 Annemie Verbeke \u2014 Catalina J \u2014 Slip Belge \u2014 Raffaelien Studio \u2014 Les Vraies Filles \u2014 Valerie Bourgoin \u2014 Sarah de Saint Hubert \u2014 Flore de Sermet \u2014 Doriane van Overeem \u2014 Charlotte Thomas \u2014 Val\u00e9rie Berckmans \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 An Buermans \u2014 Komono \u2014 Vimpelova \u2014 Jessie Lecomte \u2014 ORIIReUp \u2014 Els Mommaerts \u2014 Just in Case \u2014 Miono \u2014Max & Lola @ Kat en muis \u2014 Julie Menuge \u2014 Audrey Ickx \u2014 n.d.c. made by hand \u2014 Maison\u00c9lise \u2014 Janue \u2014 Atelier Margo \u2014 Debora Velasquez \u2014 Erratum Fashion \u2014 Stijl men & Women \u2014 Stijl Women \u2014 CYCLUP \u2014 Anna Tanaka","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533238.html"},"nl":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":"MAD Brussels, Knack Weekend en Le Vif Weekend presenteren - The Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales!","longdescr":"Steun lokale Brusselse designers en merken tijdens de Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales op 19, 20 en 21 mei. 30 deelnemende designers verkopen hun stock van vorige jaren aan verminderde prijzen. HET moment om een kledingstuk, accessoire of object van jouw Brusselse lievelingsdesinger op de kop te tikken.\r\n\r\nDe voorjaarseditie van 2022 wil gevestigde Brusselse mode- & designmerken herenigen met jonge, opkomende ontwerpers. Brussels design op zijn best!\r\n\r\nDEELNEMENDE MERKEN & SHOPS\r\n\r\nMipinta \u2014 Christoph Hefti \u2014 Farrah Floyd \u2014 Caroline du Chastel Jewellery \u2014 Annemie Verbeke \u2014 Catalina J \u2014 Slip Belge \u2014 Raffaelien Studio \u2014 Les Vraies Filles \u2014 Valerie Bourgoin \u2014 Sarah de Saint Hubert \u2014 Flore de Sermet \u2014 Doriane van Overeem \u2014 Charlotte Thomas \u2014 Val\u00e9rie Berckmans \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 An Buermans \u2014 Komono \u2014 Vimpelova \u2014 Jessie Lecomte \u2014 ORIIReUp \u2014 Els Mommaerts \u2014 Just in Case \u2014 Miono \u2014Max & Lola @ Kat en muis \u2014 Julie Menuge \u2014 Audrey Ickx \u2014 n.d.c. made by hand \u2014 Maison\u00c9lise \u2014 Janue \u2014 Atelier Margo \u2014 Debora Velasquez \u2014 Erratum Fashion \u2014 Stijl men & Women \u2014 Stijl Women \u2014 CYCLUP \u2014 Anna Tanaka","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/brussels-fashion-designers-sales","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533238.html"},"en":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":"MAD Brussels, Knack Weekend and Le Vif Weekend present - The Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales!","longdescr":"Support your local Brussels designer or brand during the Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales! About 30 participating designers sell their stock of previous years at reduced prices. THE moment to get yourself a piece of clothing, accessory or object from your favourite Brussels designer!\r\n\r\nThe summer-spring edition of 2022 is all about reuniting established Brussels fashion & design brands with young, upcoming designers. Brussels design at its best! \r\n\r\nPARTICIPATING BRANDS & SHOPS\r\n\r\nMipinta \u2014 Christoph Hefti \u2014 Farrah Floyd \u2014 Caroline du Chastel Jewellery \u2014 Annemie Verbeke \u2014 Catalina J \u2014 Slip Belge \u2014 Raffaelien Studio \u2014 Les Vraies Filles \u2014 Valerie Bourgoin \u2014 Sarah de Saint Hubert \u2014 Flore de Sermet \u2014 Doriane van Overeem \u2014 Charlotte Thomas \u2014 Val\u00e9rie Berckmans \u2014 Conni Kaminski \u2014 An Buermans \u2014 Komono \u2014 Vimpelova \u2014 Jessie Lecomte \u2014 ORIIReUp \u2014 Els Mommaerts \u2014 Just in Case \u2014 Miono \u2014Max & Lola @ Kat en muis \u2014 Julie Menuge \u2014 Audrey Ickx \u2014 n.d.c. made by hand \u2014 Maison\u00c9lise \u2014 Janue \u2014 Atelier Margo \u2014 Debora Velasquez \u2014 Erratum Fashion \u2014 Stijl men & Women \u2014 Stijl Women \u2014 CYCLUP \u2014 Anna Tanaka","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533238.html"},"de":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533238.html"},"it":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533238.html"},"sp":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533238.html"},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533238.html"},"cn":{"name":"Brussels Fashion & Designers Sales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533238.html"}},"place":{"id":250516,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD \u2013 Home of Creators","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"e