"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533474.html"},"en":{"name":"Savia","shortdescr":"A\u00a0unique exhibition\u00a0of 18 Artists of The Neo-Amazonian school of Art of the rainforest town of Pucallpa in Per\u00fa.","longdescr":"The Picaflores foundation,\u00a0the Embassy of Per\u00fa\u00a0in Belgium and NooN ConsultinG Art Gallery are\u00a0pleased to presents you the solidarity exhibition of \"Savia\"\u00a0in favour of indigenous communities who protect THE AMAZONIA. All benefits of the exhibition will go to COSHICOX sustainability projects of the Shipibo-Conibo and Xetebo tribes of Peru.\r\n\r\nAbout USKO-Ayar art School and Pablo Amaringo legacy.\r\nUSKO-Ayar was an institution devoted to the rescue and preservation of the knowledge and the traditions of the indigenous people of the Peruvian Amazon. Their art is a documentation of the flora, fauna, and culture of the Amazon, and it promotes and preserves the traditional knowledge of medicinal and other plants of this region.\r\n\r\nThe Usko-Ayar Amazonian School of Painting was created in 1988 through a collaboration of Peruvian painter and Shaman, Pablo Amaringo, and the Colombian anthropologist Luis Eduardo Luna and his wife, Sirpa Rasanen. More than 700 children had been educated until the death of Pablo Amaringo in 2009.\r\nCurrently the legacy artistic, human and philosophic of the Master Pablo Amaringo is transmitted to the new Amazonian generations through his former disciples.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533474.html"},"de":{"name":"Savia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533474.html"},"it":{"name":"Savia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533474.html"},"sp":{"name":"Savia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533474.html"},"pt":{"name":"Savia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533474.html"},"cn":{"name":"Savia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533474.html"}},"place":{"id":275244,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"NooN ConsultinG Art","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain","address_street_number":"803","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.noonconsulting.art\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain, 803","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"NooN ConsultinG Art","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain","address_street_number":"803","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.noonconsulting.art\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain, 803","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"NooN ConsultinG Art","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain","addres