l to comics, taste all the flavors of the local culture (known as \u00ab belgitude \u00bb).\r\n\r\n-  In Brussels for the first time?  in a few hours, by bus or on foot, we will show you the highlights and let you sample the spirit of the town\r\n- You believe you already know the city? Let us surprise you with our thematic tours and  neighborhoods\u2019 discovery (more than a hundred!)\r\n- Organizing a private or business trip or event? Your groups will love our guided tours, tastings and walking dinners ... and you too because we aim to exceed your expectations and take care of everything !\r\nSince 1983: talkative, experienced and enthusiastic.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Rue des Thuyas, 12","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Bruxelles Bavard","address_street_name":"Rue des Thuyas","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"