00f4tel de ville de Saint-Gilles, lieu de vie, d\u2019art et de m\u00e9moire","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-05-21","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"12:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":12}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-03-29T04:05:26+02:00","published_at":"2022-03-29T03:30:12+02:00","backoffice_id":250399,"import_origin":"explore","sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":531835,"date_start":"2022-05-19","date_end":"2022-05-21","date_next":"2022-05-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":118,"translations":{"fr":"Festival","nl":"Festival","en":"Festival"}},"others":{"list":[121],"translations":{"fr":["Classique"],"nl":["Klassiek"],"en":["Classical  "]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ekho#4","shortdescr":"Exposition internationale de violons, altos, violoncelles et archets contemporains \u00e0 essayer librement pendant les demi-finales du Concours Reine Elisabteh, session violoncelle 2022","longdescr":"Pour cette quatri\u00e8me \u00e9dition, Ekho propose une grande exposition de lutherie contemporaine pendant les demi-finales du Concours Elisabeth (CRE), session violoncelle.\r\nL\u2019exposition qui se d\u00e9roulera \u00e0 la Maison Malibran rassemblera les violons, altos, violoncelles et archets d\u2019une soixantaine de fabricant.es venant de toute l\u2019Europe et d\u2019Am\u00e9rique.\r\nAfin de nourrir les liens entre artisan.es et musicien.nes, tous ces instruments et archets pourront \u00eatre librement essay\u00e9s et compar\u00e9s. \r\nCette ann\u00e9e, Ekho a d\u00e9sir\u00e9 mettre sur le devant de la sc\u00e8ne les productions \u00ab au f\u00e9minin \u00bb, de luthi\u00e8res et archeti\u00e8res talentueuses. Andrea Frandsen, luthi\u00e8re danoise install\u00e9e \u00e0 Angers, r\u00e9compens\u00e9e du titre de Chevalier de la L\u00e9gion d\u2019Honneur pour son influence dans la lutherie du 21e si\u00e8cle, sera la Marraine luthi\u00e8re de cette exposition. \r\nCertains instruments et archets seront s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s par les musicien.nes du quatuor Am\u00f4n pour \u00eatre test\u00e9s au sein de leur quatuor lors d\u2019un workshop le 19 mai \u00e0 17H.","performers":"50 luhtier.es et archetier.es du monde entier","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ekho4.com\/","email":"info@ateliercatherinejanssens.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 77 81 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/531835.html"},"nl":{"name":"Ekho#4","shortdescr":"Internationale tentoonstelling van hedendaagse violen, altviolen, cello's en strijkstokken om vrij uit te proberen tijdens de halve finales van de Koningin Elisabteh-wedstrijd, cello sessie 2022","longdescr":"Voor deze 4de editie presenteert Ekho een grote tentoonstelling van hedendaagse vioolbouw tijdens de halve finales van de Elisabethwedstrijd (CRE), cello sessie.\r\nDe tentoonstelling, die plaatsvindt in het Maison Malibran, brengt de violen, altviolen, cello's en strijkstokken van zo'n 50 makers uit heel Europa en Amerika samen.\r\nOm de banden tussen ambachtslieden en musici aan te halen, zullen al deze instrumenten en strijkstokken vrij beschikbaar zijn om te worden getest en vergeleken. \r\nDit jaar wilde Ekho de schijnwerpers richten op de producties van getalenteerde vrouwelijke viool- en strijkstokmakers. Andrea Frandsen, een Deense vioolbouwer uit Angers, die de titel van Chevalier de la L\u00e9gion d'Honneur kreeg voor haar invloed op de vioolbouw van de 21e eeuw, zal een van de \"matrons\" van deze tentoonstelling zijn. \r\nSommige instrumenten en strijkstokken zullen door de musici van het Am\u00f4n-kwartet worden uitgekozen om binnen hun kwartet te worden getest tijdens een workshop op 19 mei om 17 uur.","performers":"50 viool- en strijkstokbouwers uit de hele wereld","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/531835.html"},"en":{"name":"Ekho#4","shortdescr":"International exhibition of contemporary violins, violas, cellos and bows to be tried freely during the semi-finals of the Queen Elisabteh Competition, cello session 2022","longdescr":"For this fourth edition, Ekho presents a large exhibition of contemporary violin making during the semi-finals of the Elisabeth Competition (CRE), cello session.\r\nThe exhibition, which will take place at the Maison Malibran, will bring together the violins, violas, cellos and bows of some 50 makers from all over Europe and America.\r\nIn order to foster links between craftsmen and musicians, all these instruments and bows will be freely available for testing and comparison. \r\nThis year, Ekho wanted to put the spotlight on the productions of talented women luthiers and bow makers. Andrea Frandsen, a Danish luthier based in Angers, awarded the title of Chevalier de la L\u00e9gion d'Honneur for her influence on 21st century violin making, will be of the \"matrons\" of this exhibition. \r\nSome instruments and bows will be selected by the musicians of the Am\u00f4n quartet to be tested within their quartet during a workshop on 19 May at 5 pm.","performers":"50 violin and bow makers from all over the world","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/531835.html"},"de":{"name":"Ekho#4","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performer