4 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA est un muse\u0301e, un centre d'archives, une bibliothe\u0300que et un lieu de rencontre pour les amateurs d'architecture, d'architecture paysage\u0300re, d'e\u0301cosyste\u0300mes urbains et d'histoire a\u0300 Bruxelles. Tout au long de l'anne\u0301e, vous pouvez vous y rendre pour des expositions temporaires, des confe\u0301rences, des de\u0301bats, des visites guide\u0301es, des lancements de livres et des activite\u0301s pour les enfants. Les activite\u0301s se trouvent a\u0300 Ixelles, pre\u0300s de la Place Flagey et au centre de Bruxelles, a\u0300 KANAL - Centre Pompidou.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Kluisstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kluisstraat","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"CIVA is een museum, een archiefcentrum, een bibliotheek en een ontmoetingsplek voor liefhebbers van architectuur, landschapsarchitectuur, stadsecosystemen en geschiedenis in Brussel. Het hele jaar door kan je er terecht voor tijdelijke tentoonstellingen, lezingen, debatten, rondleidingen, book launches en kinderactiviteiten. De activiteiten vind je in Elsene, vlakbij het Flageyplein en in Brussel-centrum, in KANAL \u2013 Centre Pompidou.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA is a museum, an archive center, a library and a meeting place for lovers of architecture, landscape architecture, urban ecosystems and history in Brussels. Throughout the year, CIVA organizes temporary exhibitions, lectures, debates, guided tours, book launches and activities for children. The activities are organized in Ixelles, near Place Flagey and in the center of Brussels, in KANAL - Centre Pompidou.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Architekturzentrum CIVA, das 2016 auf Betreiben der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt ins Leben gerufen wurde, vereint in einer einzigen Struktur Ressourcen, Wissen und Know-how verschiedener Br\u00fcsseler Vereine aus dem Bereich Kultur, Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Landschaftsarchitektur und Forschungen zum \u00d6kosystem: die Archive f\u00fcr moderne Architektur, die Bibliothek Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, der Architekturfonds und das Centre Paul Duvigneaud.\r\nMit ihrem kulturellen Projekt tr\u00e4gt die Fondation CIA zur Entwicklung einer architektonischen, landschaftsarchitektonischen und st\u00e4dteplanerischen Kultur bei, die sich mit den Herausforderungen der Gegenwart auseinandersetzt. Schwerpunkt ist Br\u00fcssel. \r\n\r\nDie Fondation CIVA bietet eine ganze Reihe von Aktivit\u00e4ten und Angeboten: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Orte des Austauschs und der Debatten, p\u00e4dagogische Aktivit\u00e4ten, Archiveinblicke und Bibliotheken mit knapp 40.000 Werken und Zeitschriften zu den Themen Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Stadtgeschichte, Landschaften, G\u00e4rten und urbane \u00d6kosysteme.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Creado en 2016 por iniciativa de la Regi\u00f3n Bruselas-Capital, el CIVA re\u00fane una \u00fanica estructura de recursos, conocimiento y aprendizaje de varias asociaciones culturales activas en Bruselas en los campos de la arquitectura, urbanismo, paisajes y el estudio de ecosistemas: los Archivos de Arquitectura Moderna, la Biblioteca Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, los Fondos para la arquitectura, el Centro Paul Duvigneaud y el CIVA asbl, ahora disuelto.\r\nA trav\u00e9s de este proyecto cultural, la Fundaci\u00f3n CIVA contribuye al desarrollo del paisaje arquitect\u00f3nico y la cultura urbana como base para afrontar desaf\u00edos contempor\u00e1neos, poniendo especial \u00e9nfasis en Bruselas.\r\nSiempre tiene \u00e9xito a la hora de cumplir sus objetivos y tratar con un p\u00fablico amplio (adultos y ni\u00f1os, estudiantes, investigadores, arquitectos, paisajistas, amantes de la naturaleza, pol\u00edticos, etc), la fundaci\u00f3n CIVA organiza numerosos eventos y actividades en diferentes lugares, incluyendo exhibiciones permanentes y temporales, conferencias, debates y actividades educativas. Tambi\u00e9n dispone archivos excepcionales abiertos para todos los p\u00fablicos (documentos de arquitectos y paisajistas: planos, bocetos, modelos, muebles, etc.) y librer\u00edas que contienen casi 40.000 obras y peri\u00f3dicos de arquitectura, urbanismo, la historia de los pueblos y ciudades, paisajes, jardines y ecolog\u00eda urbana.\r\nEstas actividades y materiales est\u00e1n dise\u00f1ados para despertar la curiosidad y el inter\u00e9s de todo nuestro entorno, ya sea un hecho hist\u00f3rico o una construcci\u00f3n.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1436,"location":{"lat":50.82873218,"lon":4.36569034},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T13:05:13+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:20+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/693449f418129e758ae2e1727c9057fa032211cf.jpg","width":800,"height":600,"ratio":1.33,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Garden Tales \u2013 Du champ \u00e0 l'assiette","copyright":"Smala"},"nl":{"title":"Garden Tales \u2013 Du champ \u00e0 l'assiette","copyright":"Smala"},"en":{"title":"Garden Tales \u2013 Du champ \u00e0 l'assiette","copyright":"Smala"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-05-21","doors":null,"start":"15:00:00","end":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[328],"translations":{"fr":["Vert & Durable"],"nl":["Groen"],"en":["Green"]}},"tags":["exterior"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T13:05:13+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-18T12:52:21+02:00","backoffice_id":254015,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":531992,"date_start":"2022-05-21","date_end":"2022-05-22","date_next":"2022-05-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Weekend festif au Logis-Flor\u00e9al: Th\u00e9atre 'Julie et Clovis'","shortdescr":"Le Logis-Flor\u00e9al c\u00e9l\u00e8bre ses cent ans ! Un week-end entier d'activit\u00e9s aura lieu dans les cit\u00e9s-jardins.","longdescr":"L'acad\u00e9mie de Boitsfort vous pr\u00e9sente 'Julie et Clovis', un pi\u00e8ce de th\u00e9atre qui se d\u00e9roule... au Logis-Flor\u00e9al. \r\n\r\nAmandine, responsable des logements au Logis-Flor\u00e9al, marie sa fille demain. Elle peste car sa fille a d\u00e9nich\u00e9 le petit-fils de sa pire ennemie, Christine ! La r\u00e2leuse professionnelle qui vient tous les jours se plaindre que ses ch\u00e2ssis ferment mal ou que sa chasse d\u2019eau est en panne\u2026 \r\nMais la situation s\u2019aggrave lorsqu\u2019Amandine d\u00e9couvre que son p\u00e8re verse r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement de l\u2019argent \u00e0 la dite Christine ! Auraient-ils eu une aventure ensemble dans le pass\u00e9 ? Mais alors se pourrait-il que les deux fianc\u00e9s soient des cousins ? Ou des fr\u00e8res et s\u0153urs ? Amandine s\u2019affole : faut-il annuler le mariage ? Elle interroge en secret son petit monde : Leila la voyante, Charlotte la divine cuisini\u00e8re et sa s\u0153ur Jacqueline. Sans oser affronter la perle du Logis, la ch\u00e8re ch\u00e8re Christine\u2026","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lelogisfloreal.be\/","email":"100ans@lelogisfloreal.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/531992.html"},"nl":{"name":"Feestweekend in Le Logis-Flor\u00e9al: toneelstuk 'Julie et Clovis'","shortdescr":"Le Logis-Flor\u00e9al bestaat 100 jaar en dat mag gevierd worden. Een heel weekend lang vinden er in de tuinwijken heel wat activiteiten plaats.","longdescr":"De Academie van Boitsfort presenteert 'Julie en Clovis', een toneelstuk dat zich afspeelt... in Logis-Flor\u00e9al. \r\n\r\nAmandine, verantwoordelijk voor huisvesting in Logis-Flor\u00e9al, is woedend! Morgen trouwt haar dochter met de kleinzoon van haar ergste vijand: Christine! De professionele zeurpiet die elke dag komt klagen dat haar ramen niet goed sluiten of dat de spoeling van haar toilet stuk is... \r\nMaar de situatie wordt nog erger wanneer Amandine ontdekt dat haar vader regelmatig geld betaalt aan Christine! Zouden ze in het verleden samen een affaire hebben gehad? Zijn de twee verloofden dan neef en nicht ? Of broer en zus? Amandine raakt in paniek: moet de bruiloft afgelast worden? Ze stelt de vraag in het geheim aan haar naasten: Leila de waarzegster, Charlotte de goddelijke kokkin en haar zus Jacqueline. Zonder de confrontatie aan te durven met de parel van de Logis, de lieve Christine...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lelogisfloreal.be\/","email":"100ans@lelogisfloreal.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/531992.html"},"en":{"name":"Weekend festif au Logis-Flor\u00e9al: Th\u00e9atre 'Julie et Clovis'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/531992.html"},"de":{"name":"Weekend festif au Logis-Flor\u00e9al: Th\u00e9atre 'Julie et Clovis'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/531992.html"},"it":{"name":"Weekend festif au Logis-Flor\u00e9al: Th\u00e9atre 'Julie et Clovis'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/531992.html"},"sp":{"name":"Weekend festif au Logis-Flor\u00e9al: Th\u00e9atre 'Julie et Clovis'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/531992.html"},"pt":{"name":"Weekend festif au Logis-Flor\u00e9al: Th\u00e9atre 'Julie et Clovis'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels