2:00 > 14:00: Pr\u00e9sentation de l\u2019\u0153uvre \u00abL\u2019inventaire de Moortebeek\u00bb avec cr\u00eapes party au pavillon du parc Effort\r\n\r\n14:00 > 16:00: Exposition \u00abLa vie \u00e0 Moortebeek\u00bb de la Fondation Lombaerts et animations sportives des Sports4You au Chalet de Moortebeek\r\n+ \u266b Wakanda Concert, a musical walk","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.anderlecht.be","email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 51","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 65","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/528888.html"},"nl":{"name":"100 jaar tuinwijken   : Moortebeek","shortdescr":"Festiviteiten in Moortebeek","longdescr":"In mei vieren we het honderdjarig bestaan van de Brusselse tuinwijken. In Anderlecht worden de drie tuinwijken tijdens het weekend van 21 en 22 mei gevierd met dit programma van de Dienst Toerisme en de Nederlandstalige Cultuurdienst van de Gemeente van Anderlecht\r\n\r\n\r\nProgramma 21.05 - Moortebeek - Paviljoen Effortpark & Chalet:\r\n\r\n10:30 > 12:00 : Rondleiding door de tuinwijk . Meer info? toerisme@anderlecht.brussels\r\n\r\n12:00 > 14:00: voorstelling van \u201cDe inventaris van Moortebeek\u201d met pannenkoekenfeest in het paviljoen van het Effortpark\r\n\r\n14:00 > 16:00: tentoonstelling \u201cLeven in Moortebeek\u201d door de Lombaerts Stichting en sportanimaties van Sports4you in de Chalet van Moortebeek\r\n+ \u266b Wakanda Concert, a musical walk","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"toerisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/528888.html"},"en":{"name":"100th anniversary of the Garden Cities : Moortebeek","shortdescr":"Festivities in Moortebeek","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/528888.html"},"de":{"name":"Centenaire des cit\u00e9s-jardins  : programme \u00e0 Moortebeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/528888.html"},"it":{"name":"Centenaire des cit\u00e9s-jardins  : programme \u00e0 Moortebeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/528888.html"},"sp":{"name":"Centenaire des cit\u00e9s-jardins  : programme \u00e0 Moortebeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/528888.html"},"pt":{"name":"Centenaire des cit\u00e9s-jardins  : programme \u00e0 Moortebeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/528888.html"},"cn":{"name":"Centenaire des cit\u00e9s-jardins  : programme \u00e0 Moortebeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/528888.html"}},"place":{"id":277730,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cit\u00e9-jardin de Moortebeek","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9-jardin de Moortebeek","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"En 1921, plusieurs centaines de coop\u00e9rateurs\u202f\u2014 en majorit\u00e9 des ouvriers habitants des quartiers populaires du centre de Bruxelles\u202f\u2014 unissent leur \u00e9nergie pour fonder la Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 coop\u00e9rative \u201cles Foyers collectifs\u201d, avec l\u2019intention d\u2019\u00e9difier une cit\u00e9-jardin \u00e0 Moortebeek. Elle se compose de 330 maisons et 124 appartements offrant un toit \u00e0 plus d\u2019un millier de personnes. Ces habitations sont con\u00e7ues par 7 architectes dont Joseph Diongre, Fernand Brunfaut et Jean-Fran\u00e7ois Hoeben. \r\n\r\nSur place, vous d\u00e9couvrirez que la plupart des logements sont reconnaissables \u00e0 la dualit\u00e9 de leurs couleurs : cr\u00e8me-jaune tr\u00e8s clair et rouge orang\u00e9. Toutes les rues portent des noms d'\u00e9crivains c\u00e9l\u00e8bres. \r\n\r\nLorsque les premiers habitants-coop\u00e9rateurs s\u2019installent dans leur maison, les travaux ne sont pas du tout termin\u00e9s\u202f! Pas de portes int\u00e9rieures dans les habitations, pas de raccordement \u00e0 l\u2019eau, \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 et aux \u00e9gouts, rues non am\u00e9nag\u00e9es qui s\u2019apparentent \u00e0 des chemins boueux, etc. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Tuinwijk Moortebeek","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Tuinwijk Moortebeek","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"In 1921 verenigden enkele honderden co\u00f6peratieleden \u2014 meestal arbeiders uit de volkswijken in het centrum van Brussel \u2014 zich in de co\u00f6peratieve vereniging 'de Collectieve Haarden', met de bedoeling in Moortebeek een tuinwijk te bouwen. Deze wijk telt 330 huizen en 124 appartementen die onderdak bieden aan meer dan duizend mensen. Deze huizen werden ontworpen door zeven architecten waaronder Joseph Diongre, Fernand Brunfaut en Jean-Fran\u00e7ois Hoeben.\r\nTer plaatse zul je zien dat de meeste woningen herkenbaar zijn aan hun twee kleuren: licht cr\u00e8megeel en oranjerood. Alle straten zijn genoemd naar beroemde schrijvers.\r\nWanneer de eerste co\u00f6peratieleden hun intrek nemen in hun huizen, zijn de werken nog niet af! Zo zijn er nog geen binnendeuren en geen water, elektriciteit of riolering. Ook de straten zijn nog niet ingericht en veranderen soms in modderwegen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Moortebeek Garden City","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Moortebeek Garden City","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"In 1921, several hundred cooperative members \u2014 mainly workers residing in popular neighbourhoods in the centre of Brussels \u2014 pooled their efforts to found the \u2018Foyers collectifs\u2019 cooperative society, with the aim of building a garden city in Moortebeek. It now has 330 houses and 124 apartments providing a roof over the heads of over a thousand people. These properties were designed by 7 architects including Joseph Diongre, Fernand Brunfaut and Jean-Fran\u00e7ois Hoeben. \r\n\r\nOn site, you'll discover that most of the properties can be recognised from their two-tone appearance: very pale yellow-cream and red-orange.\u202fAll the streets bear the names of famous writers. \r\n\r\nWhen the first cooperative member-residents moved into their houses, the works were far from being completed! No internal doors in the homes, no water or electricity supply or drain connections, unpaved streets like muddy paths, etc.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cit\u00e9-jardin de Moortebeek","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"ph