 le gouvernement bruxellois faire pour am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l'air au niveau r\u00e9gional ? Comment le faire de mani\u00e8re sociale ?","longdescr":"Maintenant que les r\u00e9sultats de CurieuzenAir sont connus, il est temps de prendre le pouls. La prime BruxselAir, la LEZ, la zone 30, ... Le gouvernement fait d\u00e9j\u00e0 beaucoup pour am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de l'air \u00e0 Bruxelles, certainement en comparaison avec les ann\u00e9es du tout-\u00e0-la-voiture. Mais que peut-elle faire de plus ? Qu'est-ce qui pourrait \u00eatre am\u00e9lior\u00e9 ? \r\n\r\nD\u00e9battez avec les ministres Alain Maron et Elke Van den Brandt le 23 mai au KVS \u00e0 Bruxelles. En collaboration avec BRUZZ et UAntwerpen. Avec Client Earth, le BRAL et Filter Caf\u00e9 Filtr\u00e9.\r\n\r\nCurieuzenAir est une initiative de l'Universit\u00e9 d'Anvers, du mouvement urbain BRAL et de l'Universit\u00e9 Libre de Bruxelles, en \u00e9troite collaboration avec Bloomberg Philanthropies, Leefmilieu Brussel, De Standaard, Le Soir, BRUZZ et DPD.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533630.html"},"nl":{"name":"Politiek debat - CurieuzenAir: En nu?","shortdescr":"Ga op 23 mei om 20u in gesprek met ministers Alain Maron en Elke Van den Brandt. Wat kan de Brusselse regering doen om de luchtkwaliteit te verbeteren op gewestelijk niveau? Hoe doen we dat op een sociale manier?","longdescr":"Nu de CurieuzenAir-resultaten bekend zijn, is het tijd voor een vinger aan de pols. De BruxselAirpremie, de LEZ, zone 30, ... De regering doet al heel wat om de Brusselse luchtkwaliteit te verbeteren, zeker in vergelijking met de jaren waarin Koning Auto alleenheerser was. Maar wat kan ze nog doen? Wat kan er volgens jou nog beter?\r\n\r\nGa met ministers Alain Maron en Elke Van den Brandt in dialoog op 23 mei om 20u in de KVS in Brussel. Met Filter Caf\u00e9 Filtr\u00e9, BRAL en Client Earth in het panel.\r\n\r\nCurieuzenAir een initiatief van de Universiteit Antwerpen, stadsbeweging BRAL en Universit\u00e9 Libre de Bruxelles, in nauwe samenwerking met Bloomberg Philanthropies, Leefmilieu Brussel, De Standaard, Le Soir, BRUZZ en DPD.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bral.brussels\/curieuzenairdebat","email":"info@bral.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 56 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533630.html"},"en":{"name":"Politiek debat - CurieuzenAir: En nu?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533630.html"},"de":{"name":"Politiek debat - CurieuzenAir: En nu?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533630.html"},"it":{"name":"Politiek debat - CurieuzenAir: En nu?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533630.html"},"sp":{"name":"Politiek debat - CurieuzenAir: En nu?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533630.html"},"pt":{"name":"Politiek debat - CurieuzenAir: En nu?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533630.html"},"cn":{"name":"Politiek debat - CurieuzenAir: En nu?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533630.html"}},"place":{"id":941,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"KVS","address_street_name":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kvs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kvs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 11 12","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 11 12","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ancien arsenal d\u2019armes de style renaissance n\u00e9o-flamand converti en salle de th\u00e9\u00e2tre par l\u2019architecte Jean Baes, le KVS a fait l\u2019objet d\u2019une remarquable restauration et d\u2019une prodigieuse modernisation de sa salle. C\u2019est actuellement l\u2019institution culturelle flamande de Bruxelles la mieux dot\u00e9e en mati\u00e8re d\u2019infrastructures.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"KVS","address_street_name":"Arduinkaai","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kvs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kvs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 11 12","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 11 12","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Arduinkaai, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Dit Brusselse stadstheater beschikt over 3 speelplekken: de bol - een gerestaureerde zaal in de schouwburg aan de Lakensestraat - , de top - een polyvalente ruimte onder het glazen dak van de schouwburg - en tenslotte de box, een 'black box' met een wegneembare tribune in het nieuwe gebouw aan de Arduinkaai. De Koninklijke Vlaamse Schouwburg brengt een aanbod van vernieuwend theater, dans, literatuur, tentoonstellingen, fuiven,... De programmatie is divers, kwaliteitsvol, dynamisch en laagdrempelig.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"KVS","address_street_name":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kvs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kvs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 11 12","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 11 12","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"KVS has hi-tech infrastructure at the beautifully restaured site on Lakensestraat\/Rue de Laeken (the renovated auditorium called KVS_BOL, and the Top), and in the new building at Arduinkaai\/Quai aux Pierres de Taille (the  'black box' ). KVS's programme is as diverse, colourful and exciting as Brussels itself with a variety of new KVS productions, revivals of past successes, local and international guest performances, theatre, dance, music, film, literature, stand-up comedy, debates, parties, etc. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"KVS","address_street_name":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kvs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kvs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 11 12","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 11 12","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das ehemalige Waffenlager im neo-fl\u00e4mischen Renaissance-Stil wurde von dem Architekten Jean Baes in ein Theater umfunktioniert und restauriert: Pr\u00e4chtiges Ergebnis ist die Koninklijke Vlaamse Schouwburg (KVS) - die K\u00f6niglich fl\u00e4mische Schaub\u00fchne.\r\nDas Programm des KVS ist vielf\u00e4ltig, bunt und spannend wie Br\u00fcssel selbst: Eigenproduktionen, Wiederaufnahmen vergangener Erfolge, belgische und internationale Auftritte, Theater, Tanz, Musik, Filme, Literatur, Debatte, Partys...","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"KVS","address_street_name":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kvs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kvs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 11 12","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 11 12","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Il KVS, ex arsenale in stile rinascimentale neo-fiammingo trasformato in teatro dall'architetto Jean Baesha ha subito un notevole restauro ed un'incredibile ammodernamento del suo salone. Questa \u00e8 attualmente l'istituzione culturale fiamminga di Bruxelles pi\u00f9 attrezzata in termini di infrastrutture.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"KVS","address_street_name":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kvs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kvs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 11 12","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 11 12","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Antiguo arsenal armament\u00edstico de estilo renacentista neoflamenco convertido en sala de teatro por el arquitecto Jean Baes, el KVS ha sido sido objeto de una restauraci\u00f3n extraordinaria y su sala ha sido modernizada de forma asombrosa. En la actualidad es la instituci\u00f3n cultural flamenca de Bruselas mejor dotada en materia de infraestructura.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"KVS","address_street_name":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kvs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kvs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 11 12","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 11 12","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai aux Pierres de Taille, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_