tions":{"fr":"Ouvert les deuxi\u00e8me et quatri\u00e8me mercredis du mois de 20:30 \u00e0 22:30","nl":"Open op de tweede en vierde woensdags van de maand van 20:30 tot 22:30","en":"Open the second and fourth wednesdays of the month from 20:30 to 22:30"}}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":5}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-12T01:36:53+02:00","published_at":"2022-02-09T12:05:03+01:00","backoffice_id":247163,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.20745663334156},{"id":533887,"date_start":"2022-05-26","date_end":"2022-05-28","date_next":"2022-05-26","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre"}},"others":{"list":[55],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de marionnettes"],"nl":["Poppentheater"],"en":["Puppet show"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["it","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ubu","shortdescr":"Ubu, le plus connu des personnages grotesques! D'apr\u00e8s Alfred Jarry \r\nAccompagn\u00e9 d'un bandon\u00e9on qui rythme les aventures du fameux tyran de Pologne! Teatro de carton!!!","longdescr":"Le p\u00e8re Ubu assassine le roi Venceslas de Pologne et il prend le pouvoir ; il fait tuer les nobles \u2013 \u00ab J'ai l'honneur de vous annoncer que pour enrichir le royaume je vais faire p\u00e9rir tous les Nobles et prendre leurs biens \u00bb \u2013 puis ceux qui l\u2019ont aid\u00e9 \u00e0 faire son coup d\u2019\u00c9tat. Cependant, Ubu Roi doit faire attention au fils du roi d\u00e9chu Venceslas, le prince Bougrelas. P\u00e8re Ubu est tout au long de l\u2019\u0153uvre men\u00e9 en bateau par sa femme, qui va lui voler son argent, l\u2019obligeant \u00e0 la fin de la pi\u00e8ce \u00e0 fuir le pays avec ses g\u00e9n\u00e9raux.\r\n\r\nSpectacle en Italien, accompagn\u00e9 d'un bandon\u00e9on. A partir de 5-6 ans. Teatro du cartone! Th\u00e9\u00e2tre en carton! \r\nDans le cadre du JEM festival de marionnettes au Peruchet","performers":"Maurizio Gioco et le Teatro Giochetta di Verona (Italie)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/theatreperuchet.be\/home\/festival-2022\/","email":"info@theatreperuchet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 87 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 673 87 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533887.html"},"nl":{"name":"Ubu","shortdescr":"Ubu, het beroemdste groteske personage! Gebaseerd op Alfred Jarry \r\nBegeleid door een bandoneon die ritme geeft aan de avonturen van de beroemde tiran van Polen! Kartonnen theater!!!","longdescr":"Vader Ubu vermoordt koning Wenceslas van Polen en grijpt de macht; hij laat de edelen vermoorden - \"Ik heb de eer aan te kondigen dat ik, om het koninkrijk te verrijken, alle edelen zal vernietigen en hun bezittingen zal afnemen\" - en vervolgens degenen die hem bij zijn staatsgreep hebben geholpen. Ubu Roi moet echter oppassen voor de zoon van de afgezette koning Wenceslas, prins Bougrelas. Gedurende het hele stuk wordt Vader Ubu op een dwaalspoor gebracht door zijn vrouw, die zijn geld steelt en hem aan het eind dwingt het land te ontvluchten met zijn generaals.\r\n\r\nUitvoering in het Italiaans, begeleid door een bandoneon. Van 5-6 jaar oud. Teatro di cartone! Kartonnen theater! \r\nAls onderdeel van het JEM marionetten festival in Peruchet","performers":"Maurizio Gioco en Teatro Giochetta di Verona (Itali\u00ebn)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533887.html"},"en":{"name":"Ubu","shortdescr":"Ubu, the most famous grotesque character! Based on Alfred Jarry \r\nAccompanied by a bandoneon that gives rhythm to the adventures of the famous tyrant of Poland! Cardboard theatre!!!","longdescr":"Father Ubu assassinates King Wenceslas of Poland and takes power; he has the nobles killed - \"I have the honour to announce that in order to enrich the kingdom I will destroy all the nobles and take their property\" - and then those who helped him in his coup. However, Ubu Roi has to watch out for the son of the deposed King Wenceslas, Prince Bougrelas. Throughout the play, Father Ubu is led astray by his wife, who steals his money, forcing him to flee the country with his generals at the end.\r\n\r\nPerformance in Italian, accompanied by a bandoneon. From 5-6 years old. Teatro di cartone! Cardboard theatre! \r\nAs part of the JEM puppet festival in Peruchet","performers":"Maurizio Gioco and Teatro Giochetta di verona (Italy)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533887.html"},"de":{"name":"Ubu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533887.html"},"it":{"name":"Ubu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533887.html"},"sp":{"name":"Ubu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533887.html"},"pt":{"name":"Ubu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533887.html"},"cn":{"name":"Ubu","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533887.html"}},"place":{"id":241472,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal du Peruchet","address_street_name":"Avenue de la For\u00eat","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatreperuchet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatreperuchet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 87 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue de la For\u00eat, 50","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Fond\u00e9 en 1929 par Carlo Speder, le P\u00e9ruchet est un th\u00e9\u00e2tre de marionnettes \u00e0 fils qui propose un r\u00e9pertoire unique de contes traditionnels (Andersen, les fr\u00e8res Grimm, Charles Perrault, Daudet, Lafontaine, Kipling, Hoffman...) pour les petits et les grands enfants. Il est situ\u00e9 \u00e0 Ixelles depuis 1968, dans une fermette du 19\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. La l\u00e9gende raconte qu'elle aurait abrit\u00e9 Charles Decoster, l'auteur de Till Ulenspiegel. En 1983, le th\u00e9\u00e2tre s'est dot\u00e9 d'un lieu pour son Mus\u00e9e International de la Marionnette (fond\u00e9 en 1938 et accessible au public jusqu'en 1968), qui poss\u00e8de une collection des plus vari\u00e9es et des plus riches parmi les Mus\u00e9es europ\u00e9ens de la Marionnette. Les spectacles s'adressent aux enfants \u00e0 partir de 3 ans et vous pouvez visiter le mus\u00e9e pendant l'entracte des spectacles.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal du Peruchet","address_street_name":"Woudlaan","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatreperuchet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatreperuchet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 87 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Woudlaan, 50","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Het marionettentheater werd in 1929 opgericht in Brussel door Carlo Speder. Le P\u00e9ruchet speelt een uniek repertoire van traditionele sprookjes (Andersen, de gebroeders Grimm, Charles Perrault, Daudet, Lafontaine, Kipling, Hoffman...) voor kinderen... en voor hen die hun kinderhart hebben weten te bewaren. Het theater is sinds 1968 gevestigd in de gemeente Elsene, in een 19e-eeuwse boerderij waar volgens de legende Charles Decoster heeft gewoond (de schrijver van Tijl Ulenspiegel!). In 1983 vond het theater P\u00e9ruchet de middelen om zijn internationaal poppenmuseum in te richten, een van de rijkste en meest gevarieerde collecties in Europa. Je kan het museum bezoeken tijdens de pauzes van de voorstellingen. De voorstellingen zijn geschikt voor kinderen vanaf 3 jaar. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal du Peruchet","address_street_name":"Avenue de la For\u00eat","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatreperuchet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatreperuchet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 87 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue de la For\u00eat, 50","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal du Peruchet","address_street_name":"Avenue de la For\u00eat","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatreperuchet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatreperuchet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 87 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue de la For\u00eat, 50","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"",