u00e9e","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvre la bande dessin\u00e9e en joggant \u00e0 ton aise !","longdescr":"Qui dit Belgique, dit chocolat, bi\u00e8re, mais aussi\u2026 bande dessin\u00e9e !\r\nAccompagnez-nous pour un tour de 9km reliant de superbes fresques qui font honneur \u00e0 la BD Belge et d\u00e9couvrez le centre ville sous un angle original.\r\nIl ne faut pas \u00eatre un grand sportif pour participer. Accessible aussi aux \"start to runners\".\r\nLe parcours peut \u00eatre adapt\u00e9 selon vos souhaits si ceux-ci restent r\u00e9alisable.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cityruns.net","email":"info@cityruns.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/514635.html"},"nl":{"name":"City Run Stripverhalen","shortdescr":"Ontdek het stripverhaal terwijl je op je gemak jogt!","longdescr":"Wie over Belgi\u00eb spreekt, denkt aan chocolade, bier, maar ook\u2026 stripverhalen!\r\nKom met ons mee op een parcours van 9 km langs prachtige fresco\u2019s die de Belgische stripverhalen eren en ontdek het stadscentrum op een originele manier.\r\nOm deel te nemen, moet u geen getrainde sportieveling zijn.  Ook geschikt voor \"start to runners\".\r\nWaar mogelijk kan de route volgens uw wensen aangepast worden.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/514635.html"},"en":{"name":"City Run Comics art","shortdescr":"Discover the comic strip while jogging at your ease!","longdescr":"Belgium is famous for chocolate, beer, but also\u2026 comics art!\r\nJoin us on a 9 km tour to discover magnificent murals that honor Belgium\u2019s comics art and explore the city center in a new way.\r\nYou do not have to be a great athlete to participate: this run is accessible for \u00ab start to runners \u00bb as well.\r\nThe route may be adapted to your wishes.","performers":null,"boxoff