],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T01:06:59+02:00","published_at":"2022-04-25T13:04:37+02:00","backoffice_id":252480,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.18779081679257},{"id":512747,"date_start":"2022-05-03","date_end":"2022-06-25","date_next":"2022-05-18","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Clair de femme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u00ab Je suis oblig\u00e9e de te quitter. Je te serai une autre femme. Va vers elle, trouve-l\u00e0, donne-lui ce que je te laisse, il faut que cela demeure. La plus cruelle fa\u00e7on d\u2019oublier ce serait de ne plus m\u2019aimer. \u00bb\r\n\r\nEn sortant d\u2019un taxi, un homme, \u00e9perdu de la mort prochaine de sa compagne, tombe sur une femme, emprisonn\u00e9e elle aussi dans une indicible douleur. Ces deux \u00eatres, d\u00e9chir\u00e9s par les \u00e9v\u00e9nements, se rencontrent et d\u00e9cident de se donner la main, de s\u2019aider mutuellement \u00e0 traverser la nuit, comme un enfant aide un aveugle \u00e0 traverser la route. Ils vont chaotiquement tenter de se rapprocher, chacun dans leur perception de la vie, ils vont se comprendre, s\u2019affronter, se confondre, dans un mouvement de balancier.\r\n\r\nClair de Femme est le roman d\u2019une nuit folle, de la rencontre et du couple, le roman des corps apr\u00e8s l\u2019\u00e9puisement, de l\u2019aurore apr\u00e8s les t\u00e9n\u00e8bres. si La Promesse de l\u2019Aube \u00e9tait le roman de la naissance de l\u2019amour, Clair de Femme est celui de l\u2019\u00e9ternit\u00e9 de Gary par-del\u00e0 la mort, le roman de l\u2019amour malgr\u00e9 la vie qui a donn\u00e9 trop de coups, de l\u2019amour malgr\u00e9 tout.\r\n\r\nUne production du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Le Public. Avec le soutien du Tax Shelter de L\u2019\u00c9tat F\u00e9d\u00e9ral Belge via Belga Films Fund et de la Communaut\u00e9 Fran\u00e7aise. D'apr\u00e8s \u00ab Clair de femme \u00bb de Romain Gary \u00a9 \u00c9ditions Gallimard.","performers":"De Romain Gary | Adaptation Itsik Elbaz | Mise en sc\u00e8ne Michel Kacenelenbogen | Avec Anne-Marie Cappeliez, Anne-Pascale Clairembourg, Laurence D\u2019Amelio, Itsik Elbaz, Jean-Fran\u00e7ois Rossion | Assistante \u00e0 la mise en sc\u00e8ne Anne Sylvain | Sc\u00e9nographie Sophie Hazebrouck | Costumes B\u00e9a Pendesini | Lumi\u00e8re Laurent Kaye | Musique originale Pascal Charpentier","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 80 09 44 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/512747.html"},"nl":{"name":"Clair de femme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/512747.html"},"en":{"name":"Clair de femme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/512747.html"},"de":{"name":"Clair de femme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/512747.html"},"it":{"name":"Clair de femme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/512747.html"},"sp":{"name":"Clair de femme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/512747.html"},"pt":{"name":"Clair de femme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/512747.html"},"cn":{"name":"Clair de femme","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/512747.html"}},"place":{"id":224476,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Le Public","address_street_name":"Rue Braemt","address_street_number":"64 70","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":"+32 80 09 44 44","phone_booking":"+32 80 09 44 44","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Braemt, 64 70","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Install\u00e9 dans les anciennes brasseries Aerts de Saint-Josse depuis 1994, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Le Public a la volont\u00e9 de proposer un th\u00e9\u00e2tre de qualit\u00e9 en pr\u00e9sentant des \u0153uvres contemporaines autant que les grands textes du r\u00e9pertoire. Une large place est faite aux auteu