se d'Evere","shortdescr":"Kermesse d'Evere - Cimeti\u00e8re de Bruxelles","longdescr":"Rendez-vous vendredi 13 mai pour de notre kermesse annuelle ! \r\nJusqu'au 22 mai, de 12h \u00e0 22h, venez vous amuser sur le parvis du cimeti\u00e8re de Bruxelles. \r\nUne activit\u00e9 id\u00e9ale pour toute la famille : Friterie\/croustillons - p\u00eache aux canards - carrousel seront au rendez-vous.\r\nLes attractions ouvrent \u00e0 partir de 15h00.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"promeco@evere.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 247 63 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/530648.html"},"nl":{"name":"Everse kermis","shortdescr":"Everse kermis - Kerkhof van Brussel","longdescr":"Afspraak op vrijdag 13 mei voor onze jaarlijkse kermis! \r\nKom je amuseren tem. 22 mei\r\nvan 12u tot 22u op het plein voor het Kerkhof van Brussel. \r\nDe ideale activiteit voor de hele familie : Frietjes\/smoutebollen - eendjes - molen zullen er staan.\r\nDe attracties zijn open vanaf 15u.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.evere.brussels","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/530648.html"},"en":{"name":"Kermesse d'Evere","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/530648.html"},"de":{"name":"Kermesse d'Evere","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/530648.html"},"it":{"name":"Kermesse d'Evere","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/530648.html"},"sp":{"