00e9e tout en faisant votre jogging \u00e0 votre aise ? Accompagnez-nous pour cette balade d'environs 8,5 km !\r\nJe suis certain que vous apprendrez au moins quelque chose sur Bruxelles ou l'Europe !\r\nEt il ne faut pas \u00eatre un grand sportif pour participer. Accessible aussi aux \"start to runners\".\r\nLe parcours peut \u00eatre adapt\u00e9 selon vos souhaits si ceux-ci restent r\u00e9alisable.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cityruns.net","email":"info@cityruns.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/514634.html"},"nl":{"name":"City Run Europa","shortdescr":"Ontdek de Europese wijk terwijl u op uw gemak jogt!","longdescr":"Hebt u zin om de Europese wijk van Brussel en de Art Nouveau squares te (her)ontdekken via een geleid bezoek terwijl u rustig jogt?\r\nVergezel ons op deze route van ongeveer 8,5 km! Ik ben er zeker van dat u iets zult bijleren over Brussel of over Europa!\r\nOm deel te nemen, moet u geen getrainde sportieveling zijn.  Ook geschikt voor \u00ab start to runners \u00bb.\r\nWaar mogelijk kan de route volgens uw wensen aangepast worden.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/514634.html"},"en":{"name":"City Run Europe","shortdescr":"Discover the European quarter while jogging at your ease!","longdescr":"Do you want to (re)discover the European quarter of Brussels and the Art Nouveau squares, while jogging at a leisurely pace ?\r\nJoin us for this tour of around 8,5 km ! I am convinced you will learn something new about Brussels or Europe !\r\nYou do not have to be a great athlete to participate : this rus is accesible for \u00ab start to runners \u00bb as well.\r\nThe route may be adapted to your wishes.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_ur