"],"nl":["maandag, dinsdag, woensdag, donderdag en vrijdag: van 09:30 tot 17:00","zaterdag en zondag: gesloten"],"en":["monday, tuesday, wednesday, thursday and friday: from 09:30 to 17:00","saturday and sunday: closed"]},"date_start":"2022-01-03","date_end":"2026-12-31","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":75},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Groupe"},"nl":{"name":"Groepen"},"en":{"name":"Group"}},"value":85}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[5],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 9-12 ans"],"nl":["Kinderen 9-12 j."],"en":["Children 9-12 yr."]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T01:05:31+02:00","published_at":"2022-04-04T12:13:23+02:00","backoffice_id":250835,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.10311813598464},{"id":531124,"date_start":"2022-01-01","date_end":"2025-01-01","date_next":"2022-05-18","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations"}},"others":{"list":[99],"translations":{"fr":["Gastronomie"],"nl":["Gastronomie"],"en":["Gastronomy"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Table \u00e0 bord du Tram Experience","shortdescr":"Une exp\u00e9rience unique et originale \u00e0 travers Bruxelles : r\u00e9servez votre table pour 2 personnes !","longdescr":"Apr\u00e8s une cure de jouvence bien m\u00e9rit\u00e9e, le Tram Experience, enti\u00e8rement relook\u00e9, vous propose une toute nouvelle aventure autour de la gastronomie belge contemporaine.\r\n\r\nOriginalit\u00e9, patrimoine et plaisir des papilles sont au menu !\r\n\r\nCette nouvelle saison, la cuisine belge est r\u00e9invent\u00e9e par nos grands chefs, issus des trois r\u00e9gions du pays. Venez (re)d\u00e9couvrir la gastronomie belge dans l\u2019atmosph\u00e8re unique et chaleureuse d\u2019un tram circulant \u00e0 travers Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nLe chef Lionel Rigolet** nous fait, une fois encore, l\u2019honneur d\u2019\u00eatre le parrain du Tram Experience ! Sa rigueur et son expertise de chef, \u00e0 la t\u00eate du prestigieux Comme chez Soi, nous permettent de proposer des menus \u00e0 l\u2019ex\u00e9cution parfaite.\r\n\r\nLes plats sont r\u00e9alis\u00e9s \u00e0 bord par notre chef traiteur Thibault Granville (Taste Great).\r\n\r\nEn voiture !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.tramexperience.be","email":"tramexperience@visit.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 513 89 40","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 89 40","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/531124.html"},"nl":{"name":"Tafel aan boord van de Tram Experience","shortdescr":"Een unieke & culinaire ontdekkingsreis door Brussel : bestel u tafel voor 2 personen !","longdescr":"Na een verfrissende verjongingskuur staat de Tram Experience weer klaar om je in vervoering te brengen langs de Brusselse straten. Trakteer jezelf op een gastronomische rondrit, en proef van het beste wat de hedendaagse, Belgische keuken te bieden heeft.\r\nOp het menu staan originaliteit, erfgoed en culinaire verwennerij.\r\n\r\nTijdens dit nieuwe tramseizoen wordt de Belgische keuken nieuw leven ingeblazen door grote chef-koks uit de drie gewesten van het land. Laat je rijden, en krijg de smaak van de Belgische gastronomie te pakken in een unieke, warme en Brusselse sfeer.\r\n\r\nChef Lionel Rigolet** doet ons opnieuw de eer aan om de peetvader van de Tram Experience te zijn! Zijn nauwgezetheid en expertise als chef, aan het hoofd van de prestigieuze Comme chez Soi, stellen ons in staat om telkens weer perfect uitgevoerde menu's aan te bieden.\r\n\r\nDe instructies van de chef-koks worden vervolgens uitgevoerd door onze chef-kok-traiteur Thibault Granville (Taste Great), die de recepten aan boord confectioneert en afwerkt.\r\nIedereen aan boord!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/531124.html"},"en":{"name":"Table on board the Tram Experience","shortdescr":"A unique and original experience through Brussels : book your table for 2 persons !","longdescr":"After a well-deserved rest, the completely redesigned Tram Experience offers you a brand-new contemporary adventure through Belgian gastronomy.\r\n\r\nOriginality, heritage and tingling taste buds are on the menu!\r\n\r\nThis new season, Belgian cuisine is being reinvented by great chefs from all three of the country's regions. Come and (re)discover Belgian gastronomy in the unique and warm atmosphere of a tram as it travels through Brussels.\r\n\r\nChef Lionel Rigolet** is once again doing us the honour of being the Tram Experience's patron! His rigour and his expertise as a chef, at the head of the prestigious Comme chez Soi, enable us to propose menus with perfect execution.\r\n\r\nOur chef caterer Thibault Granville (Taste Great) prepares and finishes the recipes on board.\r\n\r\nAll aboard!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/531124.html"},"de":{"name":"Tram Experience","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/531124.html"},"it":{"name":"Tram Experience","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/531124.html"},"sp":{"name":"Tram Experience","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/531124.html"},"pt":{"name":"Tram Experience","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/531124.html"},"cn":{"name":"Tram Experience","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/531124.html"}},"place":{"id":238555,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Entre les Marolles tr\u00e8s populaires, et l'\u00e9l\u00e9gant quartier Louise, se trouve la place Poelaert. C'est le meilleur spot pour avoir une vue panoramique \u00e0 couper le souffle sur la ville. \u00c0 l'horizon se profilent des joyaux du patrimoine bruxellois comme la basilique de Koekelberg et l'Atomium ; \u00e0 admirer sans mod\u00e9ration, et particuli\u00e8rement au coucher du soleil. Vous n'avez pas le vertige ? Depuis 2019, la grande roue \" The View \" vous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 cent m\u00e8tres de haut pour admirer la capitale belge, tandis que l'ascenseur (gratuit), tout en verre, vous fait plonger dans les Marolles pour encore plus de plaisir en ville.\r\n\r\nAvec ses 750 m2, la place Poelaert est \u00e9galement la plus grande place de la capitale. Elle doit son nom \u00e0 Joseph Poelaert, l'architecte du monumental palais de justice, construit au 19\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, qui tr\u00f4ne sur cette place ; et l\u2019\u00e9chafaudage qui le soutient depuis des ann\u00e9es fait d\u00e9sormais partie de la m\u00e9moire collective.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Poelaertplein","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Poelaertplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Tussen de volkse Marollen en de elegante Louizawijk ligt het Poelaertplein. Hier moet je zijn voor een prachtig panoramisch uitzicht over de (beneden)stad. Aan de horizon prijken architecturale erfgoedparels zoals de Basiliek van Koekelberg en het Atomium. Vooral bij zonsondergang is het hier volop genieten van een eindeloze hemel. Geen hoogtevrees? Sinds 2019 staat hier het reuzenrad \u2018The View\u2019 en kan je de Belgische hoofdstad bewonderen vanop maar liefst honderd meter hoogte! Nadien kan je gratis de glazen lift nemen en de Marollen induiken voor meer stadsplezier.\r\n\r\nHet Poelaertplein is met een oppervlakte van 750 m\u00b2 ook het grootste plein van de hoofdstad. Het werd vernoemd naar Joseph Poelaert, de architect van het justitiepaleis. Dat is het monumentale gerechtsgebouw dat je op dit plein ziet, een mastodont uit de 19de eeuw. De steigers waarin het justitiepaleis sinds jaar en dag verpakt is, maken ondertussen deel uit van het collectieve geheugen.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Between the popular Marolles district and the elegant Louise neighbourhood lies the place Poelaert. This is the place to go for a superb panoramic view of the lower part of the city. On the horizon are architectural heritage gems such as the Basilica of Koekelberg and the Atomium. Sunset in particular is a great time to enjoy the seemingly endless sky. Not afraid of heights? Since 2019, the giant Ferris wheel 'The View' has taken up residence here and you can admire the Belgian capital from a height of no less than one hundred metres! Afterwards, take the free glass lift and dive into the Marolles for more urban fun.\r\n\r\nPlace Poelaert, with its 750m\u00b2 surface area, is also the largest square in the capital. It was named after Joseph Poelaert, the architect of the Palace of Justice, which is the monumental courthouse you see on this square, a mastodon from the 19th century. The scaffolding surrounding the courthouse has become part of the public's collective memory.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Bei dem Place Poelaert, der sich 63 Meter \u00fcber der Br\u00fcsseler Unterstadt befindet, handelt es sich um den Vorplatz des beeindruckenden Br\u00fcsseler Justizpalasts. Ein Fahrstuhl ist die schnellste Verbindung zwischen Ober- und Unterstadt. Der Platz misst 155 m x 50 m, d. h. knapp 8 hat - damit ist der Place Poelaert der gr\u00f6\u00dfte Platz Br\u00fcssels.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contac