:["monday: closed","tuesday, wednesday, thursday, friday, saturday and sunday: from 10:00 to 18:00"]},"date_start":"2022-05-10","date_end":"2022-09-04","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":12},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"}},"value":5},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"},"en":{"name":"Young"}},"value":9},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Senior"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Senior"}},"value":9},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"},"nl":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"},"en":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"}},"value":0},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[321],"translations":{"fr":["Bande Dessin\u00e9e"],"nl":["Stripverhaal"],"en":["Comic Strip"]}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[252,255,256,257,259,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux personnes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour les personnes aveugles et malvoyantes","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T01:07:09+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-17T12:56:44+02:00","backoffice_id":253838,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.40775815911254},{"id":526256,"date_start":"2022-04-01","date_end":"2022-08-07","date_next":"2022-05-18","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,42],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Peinture"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Schilderkunst"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Painting"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Tanya Goel","shortdescr":"Le travail de Tanya Goel (1985, New Delhi, Inde) r\u00e9side dans une m\u00e9thode caract\u00e9ris\u00e9e par la pr\u00e9sence simultan\u00e9e de la spontan\u00e9it\u00e9 et d\u2019un ordre m\u00e9thodiquement calcul\u00e9.","longdescr":"Ses \u0153uvres, denses et complexes, et de formats ambitieux, \u00e9voquent l\u2019exploration rigoureuse de l\u2019abstraction et la mise en \u0153uvre d\u2019un processus de cr\u00e9ation math\u00e9matique, en jouant de l\u2019ambigu\u00eft\u00e9 cr\u00e9\u00e9e par l\u2019\u00e9quilibre fragile entre structure et chaos.\r\n\r\nLa couleur est un th\u00e8me central dans le travail de Goel qui y r\u00e9f\u00e8re en tant que \u00ab lumi\u00e8re, mat\u00e9riau et surface \u00bb.  L\u2019artiste fabrique ses propres pigments au d\u00e9part de mat\u00e9riaux divers (verre, b\u00e9ton, mica, graphite, feuilles, \u2026), pr\u00e9lev\u00e9s pour la plupart sur des sites de d\u00e9molition \u00e0 New Delhi. Elle inscrit ainsi sa d\u00e9marche dans une r\u00e9flexion sur les mutations urbaines, au travers d\u2019une esth\u00e9tique qui n\u2019est pas sans rappeler les exp\u00e9rimentations modernistes auxquelles la sc\u00e8ne artistique belge est \u00e9troitement associ\u00e9e, que ce soit Joseph Albers pour la couleur, ou Agn\u00e8s Martin pour la s\u00e9rialit\u00e9.\r\n\r\nContr\u00f4le et intuition, rigueur et libert\u00e9, structure et chaos se rencontrent dans un univers cr\u00e9atif qui lui est enti\u00e8rement propre, et qui est \u00e9troitement li\u00e9 aux antagonismes entre corps et esprit, science et spiritualit\u00e9. La s\u00e9lection expos\u00e9e ce printemps aux Mus\u00e9es royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique t\u00e9moigne de l\u2019int\u00e9r\u00eat de l\u2019artiste pour la couleur et la mat\u00e9rialit\u00e9, sans oublier le paysage urbain, et comprend des toiles de grands formats datant de 2014 \u00e0 ce jour, ainsi qu\u2019une s\u00e9rie d\u2019une vingtaine d\u2019aquarelles issue de la s\u00e9rie \u00ab Botanical studies \u00bb, n\u00e9e durant la p\u00e9riode de confinement.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/526256.html"},"nl":{"name":"Tanya Goel","shortdescr":"Het werk van Tanya Goel (1985, New Delhi, India) wordt gekenmerkt door een methodische aanpak waarin spontaniteit en methodisch berekende orde gelijktijdig aanwezig zijn.","longdescr":"Haar dichte, complexe en ambitieus geschaalde werken doen denken aan de rigoureuze verkenning van abstractie en de uitvoering van een mathematisch creatieproces, spelend met de ambigu\u00efteit die ontstaat door het delicate evenwicht tussen structuur en chaos.  \r\n\r\nKleur is een centraal thema in het werk van Goel, die ernaar verwijst als 'licht, materiaal en oppervlak'.  De kunstenares maakt haar eigen pigmenten uit verschillende materialen (glas, beton, mica, grafiet, bladeren, enz.), die meestal afkomstig zijn van sloopplaatsen in New Delhi. Zo beschrijft zij haar benadering in een reflectie over stedelijke mutaties, via een esthetiek die doet denken aan de modernistische experimenten waarmee de Belgische kunstsc\u00e8ne nauw verbonden is, of het nu gaat om Joseph Albers voor de kleur, of Agn\u00e8s Martin voor het serialisme. \r\n\r\nControle en intu\u00eftie, strengheid en vrijheid, structuur en chaos ontmoeten elkaar in een creatief universum dat  geheel eigen is en dat nauw verbonden is met de tegenstellingen tussen lichaam en geest, wetenschap en spiritualiteit. De selectie die dit voorjaar in de Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb wordt tentoongesteld, getuigt van de belangstelling van de kunstenaar voor kleur en materialiteit, zonder het stedelijke landschap te vergeten, en omvat grote doeken die dateren van 2014 tot vandaag, evenals een twintigtal aquarellen uit de reeks 'Botanische studies', die tijdens de periode van opsluiting zijn ontstaan.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/526256.html"},"en":{"name":"Tanya Goel","shortdescr":"Tanya Goel's (1985, New Delhi, India) work is characterised by a methodical approach in which spontaneity and methodically calculated order are simultaneously present.","longdescr":"Her dense, complex and ambitiously scaled works evoke the rigorous exploration of abstraction and the implementation of a mathematical creative process; playing with the ambiguity created by the delicate balance between structure and chaos. \r\n\r\nColour is a central theme in Goel's work, who refers to it as 'light, material and surface'.  The artist makes her own pigments from various materials (glass, concrete, mica, graphite, leaves, etc.), most of which are taken from demolition sites in New Delhi. She thus inscribes her approach in a reflection on urban mutations, through an aesthetic that is reminiscent of the modernist experiments with which the Belgian art scene is closely associated, whether it be Joseph Albers for colour, or Agn\u00e8s Martin for serialism. \r\n\r\nControl and intuition, rigour and freedom, structure and chaos meet in a creative universe that is entirely her own, and which is closely linked to the antagonisms between body and mind, science and spirituality. The selection exhibited this spring at the Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium bears witness to the artist's interest in colour and materiality, without forgetting the urban landscape, and includes large-scale canvases dating from 2014 to the present day, as well as a series of some twenty watercolours from the 'Botanical studies' series, which were born during the period of confinement.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/526256.html"},"de":{"name":"Tanya Goel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/526256.html"},"it":{"name":"Tanya Goel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/526256.html"},"sp":{"name":"Tanya Goel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/526256.html"},"pt":{"name":"Tanya Goel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/526256.html"},"cn":{"name":"Tanya Goel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/526256.html"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Les Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique sont constitu\u00e9s de six mus\u00e9es bruxellois: le Mus\u00e9e Oldmasters Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Modern Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Meunier Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Wiertz Museum, le Magritte Museum et le Mus\u00e9e fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Onder de hoede van de Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb staan zes afzonderlijke musea: het Mus\u00e9e Oldmasters Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Modern Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Meunier Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Wiertz Museum, het Magritte Museum en het Mus\u00e9e fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Reale delle Belle Arti del Belgio","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"I Musei Reali delle Belle Arti del Belgio sono sei musei di Bruxelles: l'Oldmasters Museum, il Mus\u00e9e Modern, il Meunier Museum, il Wiertz Museum, il Magritte Museum ed il Fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Los Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica son seis museos situados en Bruselas: el Museo de Arte Antiguo, el Museo de Arte Moderno, el Museo Meunier, el Museo Wiertz, el Museo Magritte y el Museo de Fin de Siglo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":