l\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T01:07:22+02:00","published_at":"2022-03-08T17:28:23+01:00","backoffice_id":249256,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.244401092453},{"id":526257,"date_start":"2022-04-28","date_end":"2022-08-07","date_next":"2022-05-18","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,42],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Peinture"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Schilderkunst"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Painting"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Christian Dotremont - Peintre de l'\u00e9criture","shortdescr":"\u00c0 l\u2019occasion du centenaire de la naissance du po\u00e8te et peintre belge Christian Dotremont, les Mus\u00e9es royaux des Beaux-Arts et les Archives & Mus\u00e9e de la Litt\u00e9rature lui consacrent une exposition exceptionnelle. Plus de 120 \u0153uvres sur papier mettent en lumi\u00e8re sa saisissante cr\u00e9ation graphique, oscillant entre \u00e9criture et peinture.","longdescr":"Artiste majeur de la seconde moiti\u00e9 du XXe si\u00e8cle, cofondateur du mouvement CoBrA, le belge Christian Dotremont (1922-1979)  fut l\u2019un des premiers \u00e0 \u00e9lever l\u2019\u00e9criture au rang d\u2019art plastique. Novateur, il invente les \u00ab logogrammes \u00bb, v\u00e9ritables po\u00e8mes visuels, trac\u00e9s au pinceau avec une fabuleuse spontan\u00e9it\u00e9. Les mots qu\u2019il couche impulsivement sur papier s\u2019allongent, se distordent jusqu\u2019\u00e0 cr\u00e9er une composition d\u2019une grande expressivit\u00e9. \u00c9criture et peinture fusionnent et se voient ainsi sans cesse r\u00e9invent\u00e9es.\r\n\r\nL\u2019exposition met en lumi\u00e8re cette grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de logogrammes r\u00e9alis\u00e9s par Dotremont \u00e0 travers plus de 120 \u0153uvres sur papier, photographies, films et certaines pi\u00e8ces d'archives pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es pour la toute premi\u00e8re fois au public.\r\n\r\nGlissez-vous dans la valise de l\u2019artiste pour d\u00e9couvrir son cheminement cr\u00e9atif vagabond. Outre les logogrammes, le parcours pr\u00e9sente une s\u00e9lection de \u00ab dessins-mots\u00bb et d\u2019autres \u0153uvres \u00e0 quatre mains r\u00e9alis\u00e9es avec Pierre Alechinsky, Asger Jorn, Serge Vandercam, Hugo Claus, etc. D\u2019autres plasticiens de l\u2019\u00e9criture comme Henri Michaux, Ren\u00e9 Guiette, Jean Raine, Jules Lismonde, Jacques Calonne dialoguent avec le travail de Dotremont.\r\n \r\nL\u2019exposition a b\u00e9n\u00e9fici\u00e9 de pr\u00eats exceptionnels de la Fondation Roi Baudouin, \u00e0 travers le Fonds Dotremont. Pierre Alechinsky a \u00e9galement contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 cette exposition-hommage en pr\u00eatant des \u0153uvres in\u00e9dites de Dotremont provenant de sa collection personnelle.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/526257.html"},"nl":{"name":"Christian Dotremont - Schilder-schrijver","shortdescr":"Naar aanleiding van het honderdste geboortejaar van de dichter en schilder Christian Dotremont wijden de Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten en het Archief & Museum voor Literatuur een uitzonderlijke tentoonstelling aan deze Belgische kunstenaar. Meer dan 120 werken op papier getuigen van zijn grafisch laveren tussen schrijven en schilderen.","longdescr":"Christian Dotremont (1922-1979), een vooraanstaande naoorlogse Belgische kunstenaar en medeoprichter van de CoBrA-beweging, is een van de eersten die met schriftuur plastische kunst maakt. Zijn \u2018logogrammen\u2019,  of visuele gedichten ontstaan spontaan uit het meanderende penseel en vormen iets nieuws in de kunst. De woorden die hij impulsief op papier zet, zoeken een eigenzinnig trac\u00e9 dat resulteert in expressieve composities. Schrijven en schilderen vloeien in elkaar over en openen de weg naar eindeloze experimenten.\r\n\r\nDe tentoonstelling belicht de grote verscheidenheid van Dotremonts logogrammen aan de hand van meer dan 120 werken op papier, foto's, films en archiefstukken die voor het eerst aan het publiek worden voorgesteld.\r\n\r\nReis mee in het kielzog van de kunstenaar en ontdek zijn slingerende sluipwegen. Naast de logogrammen omvat de tentoonstelling ook een selectie \u2018woord-tekeningen\u2019 en \u2018vierhandige werken\u2019 gecre\u00eberd met o.a. Pierre Alechinsky, Asger Jorn, Serge Vandercam en Hugo Claus. Ook kunstenaars zoals Henri Michaux, Ren\u00e9 Guiette, Jean Raine, Jules Lismonde en Jacques Calonne interageren met het werk van Dotremont.\r\n\r\nDe tentoonstelling kon rekenen op uitzonderlijke bruiklenen van de Koning Boudewijnstichting, via het Dotremontfonds. Ook Pierre Alechinsky droeg bij tot deze hommagetentoonstelling en gaf nooit eerder getoonde werken van Dotremont uit zijn persoonlijke collectie in bruikleen aan het museum.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/526257.html"},"en":{"name":"Christian Dotremont - Painter-Poet","shortdescr":"On the occasion of the centenary of the birth of the poet and painter Christian Dotremont, the Royal Museums of Fine Arts and the Archives & Museum of Literature are devoting an exceptional exhibition to this Belgian artist. More than 120 works on paper bear witness to his graphic oscillation between writing and painting.","longdescr":"Christian Dotremont (1922-1979), a prominent post-war Belgian artist and co-founder of the CoBrA movement, was one of the first to use writing to create plastic art. His 'logograms', or visual poems, emerge spontaneously from the meandering brush to produce an unprecedented form of artistic expression. The words that he impulsively lays down on paper seem to be animated by a spirit of their own and end up creating expressive compositions. Writing and painting truly merge and open a path to endless experimentations.\r\n\r\nThe exhibition, showing more than 120 works on paper, photographs, films and never-exhibited-before archive documents, sheds light on the great diversity of Dotremont's logograms.\r\n\r\nSet foot in the artist's path and discover his wandering creative journey. Besides the logograms, the exhibition also includes a selection of 'word drawings' and 'four-handed works' created with artists such as Pierre Alechinsky, Asger Jorn, Serge Vandercam and Hugo Claus. Artworks by Henri Michaux, Ren\u00e9 Guiette, Jean Raine, Jules Lismonde and Jacques Calonne also interact with Dotremont's oeuvre.\r\n\r\nThe exhibition has benefited from exceptional loans from the King Baudouin Foundation, via the Dotremont Fund. Pierre Alechinsky also contributed to this tribute exhibition, lending the museum never-before-seen works by Dotremont from his personal collection.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/526257.html"},"de":{"name":"Christian Dotremont - Peintre de l'\u00e9criture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/526257.html"},"it":{"name":"Christian Dotremont - Peintre de l'\u00e9criture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/526257.html"},"sp":{"name":"Christian Dotremont - Peintre de l'\u00e9criture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/526257.html"},"pt":{"name":"Christian Dotremont - Peintre de l'\u00e9criture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/526257.html"},"cn":{"name":"Christian Dotremont - Peintre de l'\u00e9criture","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/526257.html"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Les Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique sont constitu\u00e9s de six mus\u00e9es bruxellois: le Mus\u00e9e Oldmasters Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Modern Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Meunier Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Wiertz Museum, le Magritte Museum et le Mus\u00e9e fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Onder de hoede van de Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb staan zes afzonderlijke musea: het Mus\u00e9e Oldmasters Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Modern Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Meunier Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Wiertz Museum, het Magritte Museum en het Mus\u00e9e fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Reale delle Belle Arti del Belgio","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"I Musei Reali delle Belle Arti del Belgio sono sei musei di Bruxelles: l'Oldmasters Museum, il Mus\u00e9e Modern, il Meunier Museum, il Wiertz Museum, il Magritte Museum ed il Fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Los Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica son seis museos situados en Bruselas: el Museo de Arte Antiguo, el Museo de Arte Moderno, el Museo Meunier, el Museo Wiertz, el Museo Magritte y el Museo de Fin de Siglo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-art