us invitent \u00e0 une exposition collective avec 10 autres artistes pour rendre. hommage \u00e0 la Reine Elisabeth d'Angleterre, qui sera sur le tr\u00f4ne pour 70 ans cette ann\u00e9e.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/532969.html"},"nl":{"name":"The Queen","shortdescr":"Inhuldiging van het portret van Queen Elisabeth , geschilderd door Paula Raiglot","longdescr":"Twaalf kunstenaars brengen hulde aan Koningin Elisabeth van England, die in 2022  gedurende al 70 jaar op de troon zit.\r\nDe artiesten die meewerken zijn: Ameye Olivier, Artimo, Catherine Ailesse, Dominique Degueldere, Jean-Paul Masse de Rouch, Jimmy Bollaerts, Michael Lewis-Anderson, Mr Donka, Peter Engels, Paula Raiglot, Sophie Raskopf, Yorgo.","performers":"Paula Raiglot en Michael Lewis - Anderson nodigen jullie samen met nog 10 andere kunstenaars uit voor een tentoonstelling om hulde te brengen aan Koningin Elisabeth van England, die dit jaar 70 jaar op de troon zal zitten.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.srgallery.be","email":"info@srgallery.be","phone_contact":"+32 477 80 98 99","phone_booking":"+32 477 80 98 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/532969.html"},"en":{"name":"The Queen","shortdescr":"Inaugural of The Queen's portrait, painted by Paula Raiglot.","longdescr":"Twelve artists pay tribute to Queen Elisabeth, who has been on the throne in England for 70 years in 2022.\r\nThe artists participating in this exhibition are: Ameye Olivier, Artimo, Catherine Ailesse, Dominique Degueldere, Jean-Paul Masse de Rouch, Jimmy Bollaerts, Michael Lewis-Anderson, Mr Donka, Peter Engels, Paula Raiglot, Sophie Raskopf, Yorgo.","performers":"Paula Raiglot & Michael Lewis-Anderson invite you to a group exhibition with 10 other artists to pay tribute to Queen Elisabeth of England who will be on the throne for  70 years this year.","boxoffice_url":null,"websi