00e9couvrir quelques perles cach\u00e9es de son programme.Bruxelles Paysan : Champs et agriculture urbaine vous donneront peut-\u00eatre l\u2019envie d\u2019un retour \u00e0 la terre ?\nCette balade gratuite vous est offerte par le CIVA et Bruxelles Environnement.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/531670.html"},"nl":{"name":"Brusselse ontmoetingen - Boeren Brussel","shortdescr":"Spring op de fiets en ga op ontdekkingsreis door Brussel. Maak kennis met de mensen en organisaties die zich elke dag opnieuw inzetten voor het behoud van ons milieu. Het concept van \"Brusselse Ontmoetingen\" staat helemaal in het teken van duurzaamheid!","longdescr":"Biologische en duurzame voeding telen in het Brussels Gewest? Dit is precies wat de \"vzw Boeren Bruxsel Paysan\u201d doet. Ontdek de initiatieven rond akkers en stadslandbouw in de gemeente Anderlecht! En wie weet... misschien krijg je er zin van om terug te gaan naar waar het allemaal begint.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","email":"info@provelo.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/531670.html"},"en":{"name":"Bruxelles paysan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/531670.html"},"de":{"name":"Bruxelles paysan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/531670.html"},"it":{"name":"Bruxelles paysan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":n