es","en":"Animations"}},"others":{"list":[101],"translations":{"fr":["Folklore"],"nl":["Folklore"],"en":["Folklore"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Wol\/Laine","shortdescr":"Tonte annuelle des moutons","longdescr":"Les services culture fran\u00e7aise et n\u00e9erlandaise de Ganshoren vous invitent, dans l\u2019espace culturel Bij\/Chez Theo & Jeanine, \u00e0 une journ\u00e9e plac\u00e9e sous le signe de la laine.\r\nL\u2019occasion de rencontrer des personnes inspirantes qui ont l\u2019habitude de travailler avec les brebis et de transformer cette magnifique mati\u00e8re naturelle.\r\nVenez \u00e0 la rencontre des Moutons Bruxellois de race \u2018zwartbles\u2019 de David D'Hondt. Ils s\u00e9journent toute l'ann\u00e9e dans les prairies du Zavelenberg, mais seront les stars de la journ\u00e9e \u00e0 la ferme !\r\n\r\n09:00 > 13:00\r\nTonte annuelle des moutons\r\nTri des toisons\r\n\r\n12:00 > 14:00\r\nRestauration champ\u00eatre dans la buvette\r\n\r\n14:00 > 18:00\r\nInitiations teinture, tissage,\r\nfilage au fuseau et tricot\r\nContes pour tous les \u00e2ges\r\n\r\nExpo Denis Cliclick. Peau sur peau\r\nStudio photo en tenue de berger \r\n\r\nLa buvette est ouverte en permanence !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ganshoren.be\/bij-chez-theo-jeanine\/","email":"culture.francaise@ganshoren.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 464 05 39","phone_booking":"+32 2 464 05 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533070.html"},"nl":{"name":"Wol\/Laine","shortdescr":"Jaarlijkse scheerbeurt van de schapen","longdescr":"De diensten Nederlandse en Franse Cultuur van Ganshoren nodigen je in de culturele ruimte Bij\/Chez Theo & Jeanine uit voor een boeiende dag gewijd aan wol.\r\nJe ontmoet er inspirerende mensen die met schapen werken en dit geweldig natuurlijke materiaal verwerken.\r\nKom kennismaken met de 'zwartbles' schapen van David D'Hondt. Ze grazen het hele jaar door in de weiden van de Zavelenberg, maar tekenen de hele dag present op de boerderij!\r\n\r\n09:00 > 13:00\r\nJaarlijkse scheerbeurt van de schapen\r\nSorteren van de vachten\r\n\r\n12:00 > 14:00\r\nBoerenkost in de buvette\r\n\r\n14:00 > 18:00\r\nInitiaties verven, weven,\r\nspinnen en breien\r\nVerhalen voor alle leeftijden\r\n\r\nExpo Denis Cliclick. Huid op huid\r\nFotostudio in herderskledij\r\n\r\nDe buvette is doorlopend open!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"pdebroe@ganshoren.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 464 95 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 464 95 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533070.html"},"en":{"name":"Wol\/Laine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533070.html"},"de":{"name":"Wol\/Laine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533070.html"},"it":{"name":"Wol\/Laine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533070.html"},"sp":{"name":"Wol\/Laine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533070.html"},"pt":{"name":"Wol\/Laine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533070.html"},"cn":{"name":"Wol\/Laine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phon