":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA est un muse\u0301e, un centre d'archives, une bibliothe\u0300que et un lieu de rencontre pour les amateurs d'architecture, d'architecture paysage\u0300re, d'e\u0301cosyste\u0300mes urbains et d'histoire a\u0300 Bruxelles. Tout au long de l'anne\u0301e, vous pouvez vous y rendre pour des expositions temporaires, des confe\u0301rences, des de\u0301bats, des visites guide\u0301es, des lancements de livres et des activite\u0301s pour les enfants. Les activite\u0301s se trouvent a\u0300 Ixelles, pre\u0300s de la Place Flagey et au centre de Bruxelles, a\u0300 KANAL - Centre Pompidou.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Kluisstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kluisstraat","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"CIVA is een museum, een archiefcentrum, een bibliotheek en een ontmoetingsplek voor liefhebbers van architectuur, landschapsarchitectuur, stadsecosystemen en geschiedenis in Brussel. Het hele jaar door kan je er terecht voor tijdelijke tentoonstellingen, lezingen, debatten, rondleidingen, book launches en kinderactiviteiten. De activiteiten vind je in Elsene, vlakbij het Flageyplein en in Brussel-centrum, in KANAL \u2013 Centre Pompidou.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA is a museum, an archive center, a library and a meeting place for lovers of architecture, landscape architecture, urban ecosystems and history in Brussels. Throughout the year, CIVA organizes temporary exhibitions, lectures, debates, guided tours, book launches and activities for children. The activities are organized in Ixelles, near Place Flagey and in the center of Brussels, in KANAL - Centre Pompidou.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Architekturzentrum CIVA, das 2016 auf Betreiben der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt ins Leben gerufen wurde, vereint in einer einzigen Struktur Ressourcen, Wissen und Know-how verschiedener Br\u00fcsseler Vereine aus dem Bereich Kultur, Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Landschaftsarchitektur und Forschungen zum \u00d6kosystem: die Archive f\u00fcr moderne Architektur, die Bibliothek Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, der Architekturfonds und das Centre Paul Duvigneaud.\r\nMit ihrem kulturellen Projekt tr\u00e4gt die Fondation CIA zur Entwicklung einer architektonischen, landschaftsarchitektonischen und st\u00e4dteplanerischen Kultur bei, die sich mit den Herausforderungen der Gegenwart auseinandersetzt. Schwerpunkt ist Br\u00fcssel. \r\n\r\nDie Fondation CIVA bietet eine ganze Reihe von Aktivit\u00e4ten und Angeboten: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Orte des Austauschs und der Debatten, p\u00e4dagogische Aktivit\u00e4ten, Archiveinblicke und Bibliotheken mit knapp 40.000 Werken und Zeitschriften zu den Themen Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Stadtgeschichte, Landschaften, G\u00e4rten und urbane \u00d6kosysteme.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Creado en 2016 por iniciativa de la Regi\u00f3n Bruselas-Capital, el CIVA re\u00fane una \u00fanica estructura de recursos, conocimiento y aprendizaje de varias asociaciones culturales activas en Bruselas en los campos de la arquitectura, urbanismo, paisajes y el estudio de ecosistemas: los Archivos de Arquitectura Moderna, la Biblioteca Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, los Fondos para la arquitectura, el Centro Paul Duvigneaud y el CIVA asbl, ahora disuelto.\r\nA trav\u00e9s de este proyecto cultural, la Fundaci\u00f3n CIVA contribuye al desarrollo del paisaje arquitect\u00f3nico y la cultura urbana como base para afrontar desaf\u00edos contempor\u00e1neos, poniendo especial \u00e9nfasis en Bruselas.\r\nSiempre tiene \u00e9xito a la hora de cumplir sus objetivos y tratar con un p\u00fablico amplio (adultos y ni\u00f1os, estudiantes, investigadores, arquitectos, paisajistas, amantes de la naturaleza, pol\u00edticos, etc), la fundaci\u00f3n CIVA organiza numerosos eventos y actividades en diferentes lugares, incluyendo exhibiciones permanentes y temporales, conferencias, debates y actividades educativas. Tambi\u00e9n dispone archivos excepcionales abiertos para todos los p\u00fablicos (documentos de arquitectos y paisajistas: planos, bocetos, modelos, muebles, etc.) y librer\u00edas que contienen casi 40.000 obras y peri\u00f3dicos de arquitectura, urbanismo, la historia de los pueblos y ciudades, paisajes, jardines y ecolog\u00eda urbana.\r\nEstas actividades y materiales est\u00e1n dise\u00f1ados para despertar la curiosidad y el inter\u00e9s de todo nuestro entorno, ya sea un hecho hist\u00f3rico o una construcci\u00f3n.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1436,"location":{"lat":50.82873218,"lon":4.36569034},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T03:35:48+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:20+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/738a65158bbef8b52dfe80cc73c553274b50b204.jpg","width":1160,"height":773,"ratio":1.5,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Garden Tales \u2013 FleurAkker","copyright":"Julien Rensonnet (L\u2019Avenir)"},"nl":{"title":"Garden Tales \u2013 FleurAkker","copyright":"Julien Rensonnet (L\u2019Avenir)"},"en":{"title":"Garden Tales \u2013 FleurAkker","copyright":"Julien Rensonnet (L\u2019Avenir)"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-05-21","doors":null,"start":"14:00:00","end":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[328],"translations":{"fr":["Vert & Durable"],"nl":["Groen"],"en":["Green"]}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-18T03:35:48+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-17T21:06:41+02:00","backoffice_id":253912,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":531072,"date_start":"2022-05-21","date_end":"2022-05-21","date_next":"2022-05-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"fr":["Classique"],"nl":["Klassiek"],"en":["Classical"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Paloma Kouider (Piano)","shortdescr":"Nous sommes heureux de recevoir Pamela Kouider dans notre Salon pour un authentique r\u00e9cital de piano.","longdescr":"R\u00e9v\u00e9lation classique de l\u2019Adami (https:\/\/www.adami.fr\/ l'\u00e9quivalent fran\u00e7ais de la SABAM en Belgique), Paloma est \u00e9galement laur\u00e9ate de la Fondation Banque Populaire en France. Elle a d\u00e9j\u00e0 r\u00e9alis\u00e9 plus d\u2019une dizaine d\u2019enregistrements, tous unanimement salu\u00e9s par la critique.\r\nLa plus belle description de son jeu vient peut-\u00eatre de G\u00e9rard Mannoni pour Classica : \u00ab C\u2019est splendide d\u2019intelligence, de sens musical, de personnalit\u00e9. Une vraie d\u00e9couverte. \u00bb\r\nNous sommes heureux de la recevoir dans notre Salon pour un authentique r\u00e9cital de piano.","performers":"Paloma Kouider (Piano)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.jardinmusical.org\/","email":"info@jardinmusical.org","phone_contact":"+32 456 04 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 456 04 35 05","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/531072.html"},"nl":{"name":"Paloma Kouider (Piano)","shortdescr":"We verheugen ons om Pamela Kouider in ons midden te verwelkomen voor een autentiek piano recital.","longdescr":"Klassieke ontdekking van Adami (franse tegenhanger van onze SABAM - https:\/\/www.adami.fr\/) , Paloma is eveneens winnares van de franse \"Fondation Banque Populaire\". Ze heeft al een tiental opnames gerealiseerd, allen zeer warm en unaniem aanbevolen.\r\nDe mooiste omschrijving van haar werk komt wellicht van G\u00e9rard Mannoni (voor Classica): \"het schittert van intelligentie, van muziekale zingeving, van persoonlijkheid. Een ware ontdekking.\"\r\nWe zijn zeer blij haar te mogen ontvangen in ons midden voor een autentiek piano recital.","performers":"Paloma Kouider (Piano)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@jardinmusical.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/531072.html"},"en":{"name":"Paloma Kouider (Piano)","shortdescr":"We are delighted to welcome Pamela Kouider in our Salon for an authentic piano concert.","longdescr":"Classical revelation according to the French artist and interpreters \"Adami\" (https:\/\/www.adami.fr\/  equivalent of the Belgian \"SABAM\"), Paloma is also winner of the French financial foundation \"Fondation Banque Populaire\". She has registred a few dozen albums, all greatly praised by music critics.\r\nHer performance has been portrayed beautifully, by G\u00e9rard Mannoni (Classica) as: \"brightly intelligent, with profound musical sense and personality. A real discovery.\"\r\nWe are delighted to welcome Pamela Kouider in our Salon for an authentic piano concert.","performers":"Paloma Kouider (Piano)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@jardinmusical.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/531072.html"},"de":{"name":"Concert de Paloma Kouider (Piano)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/531072.html"},"it":{"name":"Concert de Paloma Kouider (Piano)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/531072.html"},"sp":{"name":"Concert de Paloma Kouider (Piano)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/531072.html"},"pt":{"name":"Concert de Paloma Kouider (Piano)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/531072.html"},"cn":{"name":"Concert de Paloma Kouider (Piano)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/531072.html"}},"place