mal"}},"value":16}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-04-13T04:05:20+02:00","published_at":"2022-04-13T03:30:15+02:00","backoffice_id":251784,"import_origin":"explore","sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.28011059397367},{"id":532624,"date_start":"2022-05-22","date_end":"2022-05-22","date_next":"2022-05-22","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"fr":["Classique"],"nl":["Klassiek"],"en":["Classical"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"ANNULE  Avguste Antonov, piano \u2013 oeuvres de Richard Addinsell, Matthew Lewis, George Gershwin","shortdescr":"Au programme :\r\n\r\nRichard Addinsell     \u2013     Warsaw Concerto (version piano solo)\r\nMatthew Lewis          \u2013     Sonata Fantasia\r\nGeorge Gershwin      \u2013     Rhapsody in Blue (version piano solo)","longdescr":"N\u00e9 en Bulgarie,  Avguste Antonov a \u00e9tudi\u00e9 le piano en Bulgarie (Dobrich), en France (\u00c9cole normale de Paris, Conservatoire de Bordeaux Jacques Thibaud) et aux \u00c9tats-Unis (2000: Universit\u00e9 du Missouri-Kansas City; 2001-2004: Universit\u00e9 du Kansas; 2006-2008: Texas Christian University).\r\n\r\nAvguste Antonov est un interpr\u00e8te d\u00e9vou\u00e9 des compositeurs du XXe et du XXIe si\u00e8cle, avec un accent sur les compositeurs am\u00e9ricains vivants, et il a donn\u00e9 des premi\u00e8res mondiales et am\u00e9ricaines \u00e0 travers l\u2019Am\u00e9rique du Nord. Au fil des ans, il a travaill\u00e9 avec les compositeurs Carter Pann, Raina Murnak, Matthew Lewis, Till Meyn, Matthew Saunders, Robert Rollin, William Vollinger et d\u2019autres. \r\n\r\nAvguste Antonov a pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 des r\u00e9citals \u00e0 travers les \u00c9tats-Unis, y compris dans les \u00e9tats du Colorado, Kansas, Iowa, Missouri, Floride, Pennsylvanie, Texas, Ohio, Caroline du Sud et Tennessee. Il a \u00e9t\u00e9 soliste avec de nombreux ensembles, dont le San Jose State University Wind Symphony, le San Jose Wind Symphony, l\u2019University City Symphony, l\u2019Alton Symphony Orchestra, le Tulsa Camerata, le Lakeland Community Orchestra, le Jewish Community Orchestra-Portland et le South Kansas Symphony.  Les concertos jou\u00e9s incluent Schumann concerto pour piano, Rachmaninoff 2\u00e8me, McDowell 2\u00e8me, Liszt 2\u00e8me, Ravel en sol, Gershwin en fa,  Gershwin \u00ab Rhapsody in Blue \u00bb, Carter Pann \u00ab Concerto Logic \u00bb et  Matthew Saunders \u00ab Piano Concerto \u00bb.\r\n\r\nEn plus de faire des concerts, Avguste Antonov est actif en tant que conf\u00e9rencier et juge. Il est membre de l\u2019Acad\u00e9mie internationale des arts de la sc\u00e8ne et des sciences et juge les concours de piano et de musique de chambre ENKOR. Il a pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 des conf\u00e9rences et\/ou a jug\u00e9 pour la Carrollton Music Teachers Association, la Frisco Music Teachers Association, la Kansas Music Teachers Association, la Oklahoma Music Teachers Association et la Wisconsin Music Teachers Association. \r\n\r\nParmi les temps forts des saisons pr\u00e9c\u00e9dentes, citons un r\u00e9cital dans la r\u00e9sidence de l\u2019Ambassadeur Bulgare \u00e0 Washington, la performance de Carter Pann \u00ab Concerto Logic \u00bb avec le San Jos\u00e9 State University Wind Ensemble, un concert \u00ab live \u00bb pour la Radio Publique de l\u2019Etat de Kansas, la premi\u00e8re mondiale et am\u00e9ricaine de Matthew Saunders \u00ab Piano Concerto \u00bb avec l\u2019University City Symphony (University City, MO) et le Lakeland Community Orchestra (Kirtland, OH).\r\n\r\nDepuis avril 2019 Avguste Antonov r\u00e9side \u00e0 Bordeaux (France) et en septembre 2019, il est devenu professeur de piano a l\u2019\u00e9cole de musique  \u00ab Couleur Musique \u00bb .","performers":"Avguste Antonov (piano)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/532624.html"},"nl":{"name":"GEANNULEERD  Avguste  Antonov, piano - werken van Richard Addinsell, Matthew Lewis, George Gershwin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Avguste Antonov is geboren in Bulgarije en studeerde piano in Bulgarije (Dobrich), Frankrijk (\u00c9cole Normale de Paris, Conservatoire de Bordeaux Jacques Thibaud) en de Verenigde Staten (2000: University of Missouri-Kansas City; 2001-2004: University of Kansas; 2006-2008: Texas Christian University).\r\n\r\nAvguste Antonov is een toegewijde vertolker van 20e en 21e eeuwse componisten, met de nadruk op levende Amerikaanse componisten, en heeft wereld- en Amerikaanse premi\u00e8res gegeven in heel Noord-Amerika. In de loop der jaren heeft hij gewerkt met componisten Carter Pann, Raina Murnak, Matthew Lewis, Till Meyn, Matthew Saunders, Robert Rollin, William Vollinger en anderen. \r\n\r\nAvguste Antonov heeft recitals gegeven in de Verenigde Staten, waaronder Colorado, Kansas, Iowa, Missouri, Florida, Pennsylvania, Texas, Ohio, South Carolina en Tennessee. Hij was solist bij talrijke ensembles waaronder het San Jose State University Wind Symphony, San Jose Wind Symphony, University City Symphony, Alton Symphony Orchestra, Tulsa Camerata, Lakeland Community Orchestra, Jewish Community Orchestra-Portland, en South Kansas Symphony.  Uitgevoerde concerten zijn o.a. Schumann Piano Concerto, Rachmaninoff 2e, McDowell 2e, Liszt 2e, Ravel in G, Gershwin in F, Gershwin \"Rhapsody in Blue\", Carter Pann \"Concerto Logic\" en Matthew Saunders \"Piano Concerto\".\r\n\r\nNaast optreden is Avguste Antonov actief als docent en jurylid. Hij is lid van de International Academy of Performing Arts and Sciences en is jurylid bij de ENKOR piano- en kamermuziekconcoursen. Hij heeft lezingen gegeven en\/of gejureerd voor de Carrollton Music Teachers Association, Frisco Music Teachers Association, Kansas Music Teachers Association, Oklahoma Music Teachers Association en Wisconsin Music Teachers Association. \r\n\r\nHoogtepunten uit vorige seizoenen zijn een recital in de residentie van de Bulgaarse ambassadeur in Washington, D.C., Carter Pann's uitvoering van \"Concerto Logic\" met het San Jose State University Wind Ensemble, een live concert voor Kansas State Public Radio, de wereld- en Amerikaanse premi\u00e8re van Matthew Saunders' \"Piano Concerto\" met de University City Symphony (University City, MO) en het Lakeland Community Orchestra (Kirtland, OH).\r\n\r\nSinds april 2019 woont Avguste Antonov in Bordeaux (Frankrijk) en in september 2019 is hij pianoleraar geworden aan de muziekschool \"Couleur Musique\".","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/532624.html"},"en":{"name":"CANCELED  Avguste Antonov, piano - compositions by Richard Addinsell, Matthew Lewis, George Gershwin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Born in Bulgaria,  Avguste Antonov has studied piano performance in Bulgaria (Dobrich), France (Ecole Normale de Paris, Conservatoire de Bordeaux Jacques Thibaud) and the United States (2000: University of Missouri-Kansas City; 2001-2004: University of Kansas; 2006-2008: Texas Christian University).\r\n\r\nPianist Avguste Antonov is a dedicated performer of 20th and 21st century music, especially American living composers, and has performed World and USA premieres at venues across North America. Over the years, he has worked with composers Carter Pann, Raina Murnak, Matthew Lewis, Till Meyn, Matthew Saunders, Robert Rollin, William Vollinger and others. \r\n\r\nAvguste Antonov has performed recitals all over the  United States, including in Colorado, Kansas, Iowa, Missouri, Florida, Pennsylvania, Texas, Ohio, South Carolina, Tennessee . He has been featured as soloist with many ensembles including the San Jose State University Wind Symphony, the San Jose Wind Symphony, the University City Symphony, the Alton Symphony Orchestra, the Tulsa Camerata, the Lakeland Community Orchestra, the Jewish Community Orchestra-Portland and the South Kansas Symphony.  Concertos performed include Schumann Piano Concerto, Rachmaninoff 2nd, McDowell 2nd, Liszt 2nd, Ravel in G, Gershwin in F,  Gershwin \u00ab Rhapsody in Blue \u00bb, Carter Pann \u00ab Concerto Logic \u00bb and Matthew Saunders \u00ab Piano Concerto \u00bb.\r\n\r\nIn addition to performing, Avguste Antonov is active as lecturer and adjudicator. He is a member of the International Academy of Performing Arts and Sciences and adjudicates the ENKOR Piano Competition. He has presented lectures and\/or adjudicated for Carrollton Music Teachers Association, Frisco Music Teachers Association, Kansas Music Teachers Association, Oklahoma Music Teachers Association and Wisconsin Music Teachers Association. \r\n\r\nPrevious seasons highlights include a recital at the Bulgarian Ambassador Residence in Washington, DC, the performance of Carter Pann \u00ab Concerto Logic \u00bb with the San Jose State University Wind Ensemble, a live performance for the Kansas Public Radio, the World and US Premiere of Matthew Saunders \u00ab Piano Concerto \u00bb with the University City Symphony (University City, MO) and the Lakeland Community Orchestra (Kirtland, OH). \r\n\r\nSince April 2019 Avguste Antonov resides in Bordeaux (France) and in Septembre 2019 he became piano professor at the school of music  \u00ab Couleur Musique \u00bb .","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/532624.html"},"de":{"name":"Avguste Antonov, piano \u2013 oeuvres de Richard Addinsell, Matthew Lewis, George Gershwin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/532624.html"},"it":{"name":"Avguste Antonov, piano \u2013 oeuvres de Richard Addinsell, Matthew Lewis, George Gershwin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/532624.html"},"sp":{"name":"Avguste Antonov, piano \u2013 oeuvres de Richard Addinsell, Matthew Lewis, George Gershwin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/532624.html"},"pt":{"name":"Avguste Antonov, piano \u2013 oeuvres de Richard Addinsell, Matthew Lewis, George Gershwin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/532624.html"},"cn":{"name":"Avguste Antonov, piano \u2013 oeuvres de Richard Addinsell, Matthew Lewis, George Gershwin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/532624.html"}},"place":{"id":242272,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le nom Marcel Hastir vous dit quelque chose ?  Ce peintre, th\u00e9osophe et r\u00e9sistant belge a v\u00e9cu durant 76 ans (de 1935 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 sa mort) dans la rue du Commerce situ\u00e9e dans le quartier L\u00e9opold \u00e0 Bruxelles. Vous pouvez toujours y admirer ses toiles tout en appr\u00e9ciant de la musique classique ou du th\u00e9\u00e2tre. De grands noms du monde de la musique viennent dans ce lieu sp\u00e9cial depuis des d\u00e9cennies. L'atmosph\u00e8re intime et magique ne vous laissera pas indiff\u00e9rent.    \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Handelsstraat","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Handelsstraat, 51","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Zegt de naam Marcel Hastir je wat? Hij was een Belgisch kunstschilder, theosoof en verzetsstrijder. Van 1935 tot aan zijn dood 76 jaar later woonde hij in de Handelsstraat in de Brusselse Leopoldwijk. Je kan er zijn doeken nog steeds bewonderen terwijl je geniet van klassieke muziek of theater. Al decennialang komen op deze bijzondere plek grote namen uit de muziekwereld over de vloer. De intieme en magische sfeer zal je niet onberoerd laten.  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Atelier Marcel Hastir is a magical place where culture lovers and artists meet in the midst of Marcel Hastir's paintings, in the intimate setting of what has been his place of work since 1935.\r\nMarcel Hastir was a Belgian painter, theosofist and resistance fighter. His studio in the Leopold district served also as a concert hall for young musicians, and during the Second World War this \"painters school\" actually served as a relatively safe meeting place for young artists, students and resistance fighters. A team of passionate volunteers work for the preservation of his work and home organising concerts with both young and confirmed talent from Belgium and abroad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Atelier Marcel Hastir ist ein Ort der Kunst, der kulturellen und k\u00fcnstlerischen Begegnungen, der 1935 von dem Maler Marcel Hastir in seinem K\u00fcnstleratelier in der Rue du Commerce 51 eingerichtet wurde. Das ungew\u00f6hnliche Haus hei\u00dft seit Jahrzehnten inmitten der Kunstwerke sowohl junge K\u00fcnstler als auch gro\u00dfe Namen der belgischen und internationalen Musik- und Theaterszene willkommen - ein Ort, der mit seiner ganz besonderen Atmosph\u00e4re verzaubert.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"nl":["Europese wijk"],"en":["European Quarter"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"fr":["Est"],"nl":["Oost"],"en":["East"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"AtelierMarcelHastir","backoffice_id":4704,"location":{"lat":50.84199339,"lon":4.36864525},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-04-27T16:05:05+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:17:42+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":242272,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le nom Marcel Hastir vous dit quelque chose ?  Ce peintre, th\u00e9osophe et r\u00e9sistant belge a v\u00e9cu durant 76 ans (de 1935 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 sa mort) dans la rue du Commerce situ\u00e9e dans le quartier L\u00e9opold \u00e0 Bruxelles. Vous pouvez toujours y admirer ses toiles tout en appr\u00e9ciant de la musique classique ou du th\u00e9\u00e2tre. De grands noms du monde de la musique viennent dans ce lieu sp\u00e9cial depuis des d\u00e9cennies. L'atmosph\u00e8re intime et magique ne vous laissera pas indiff\u00e9rent.    \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Handelsstraat","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Handelsstraat, 51","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Zegt de naam Marcel Hastir je wat? Hij was een Belgisch kunstschilder, theosoof en verzetsstrijder. Van 1935 tot aan zijn dood 76 jaar later woonde hij in de Handelsstraat in de Brusselse Leopoldwijk. Je kan er zijn doeken nog steeds bewonderen terwijl je geniet van klassieke muziek of theater. Al decennialang komen op deze bijzondere plek grote namen uit de muziekwereld over de vloer. De intieme en magische sfeer zal je niet onberoerd laten.  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Atelier Marcel Hastir is a magical place where culture lovers and artists meet in the midst of Marcel Hastir's paintings, in the intimate setting of what has been his place of work since 1935.\r\nMarcel Hastir was a Belgian painter, theosofist and resistance fighter. His studio in the Leopold district served also as a concert hall for young musicians, and during the Second World War this \"painters school\" actually served as a relatively safe meeting place for young artists, students and resistance fighters. A team of passionate volunteers work for the preservation of his work and home organising concerts with both young and confirmed talent from Belgium and abroad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":"+32 479 41 91 35","phone_booking":nul