5228413","oEmbed_is_plus":"1","oEmbed_account_type":"plus","oEmbed_html":"<iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/334176089?h=8eb9f00e62&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen title=\"Dans la peau de Cyrano - mai 2022 - Centre Culturel d&amp;#039;Uccle\"><\/iframe>","oEmbed_width":700,"oEmbed_height":394,"oEmbed_duration":94,"oEmbed_description":"Colin fait sa rentr\u00e9e en premi\u00e8re secondaire. Pas facile de passer du monde de l\u2019enfance \u00e0 celui des grands, surtout quand on est \u00abdiff\u00e9rent\u00bb. La route est sem\u00e9e d\u2019emb\u00fbches. Mais une rencontre d\u00e9terminante avec son professeur de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, figure paternelle et bienveillante, guidera ses pas vers un nouvel essor, comme une nouvelle naissance.\n\nUn spectacle dr\u00f4le et po\u00e9tique o\u00f9 un com\u00e9dien seul en sc\u00e8ne interpr\u00e8te une galerie de personnages hauts en couleur.","oEmbed_thumbnail_url":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/1338241672-e7a9074c03e449b60967ec5b09d4584bd61dbc7c5b9455eba5bc4043908bfd63-d_640","oEmbed_thumbnail_width":640,"oEmbed_thumbnail_height":360,"oEmbed_thumbnail_url_with_play_button":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/filter\/overlay?src0=https%3A%2F%2Fi.vimeocdn.com%2Fvideo%2F1338241672-e7a9074c03e449b60967ec5b09d4584bd61dbc7c5b9455eba5bc4043908bfd63-d_640&src1=http%3A%2F%2Ff.vimeocdn.com%2Fp%2Fimages%2Fcrawler_play.png","oEmbed_upload_date":"2019-05-04 13:48:47","oEmbed_video_id":334176089,"oEmbed_uri":"\/videos\/334176089","translations":{"fr":{"title":"Dans la peau de Cyrano - mai 2022 - Centre Culturel d'Uccle"},"nl":{"title":"Dans la peau de Cyrano - mai 2022 - Centre Culturel d'Uccle"},"en":{"title":"Dans la peau de Cyrano - mai 2022 - Centre Culturel d'Uccle"}}},{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/0af505f9c5a0227cd14692f82efd8d263c211964.png","width":500,"height":700,"ratio":0.71,"translations":{