"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-03-02","doors":null,"start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-04-06","doors":null,"start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-05-25","doors":null,"start":"21:00:00","end":"22:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":10.8},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Demandeurs d'emploi"},"nl":{"name":"Werkzoekenden"},"en":{"name":"Jobseekers"}},"value":8.7},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"},"en":{"name":"Young"}},"value":8.7},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"}},"value":8.7},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,265,266],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","WC adapt\u00e9","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Aangepast toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible","Adapted toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-04-07T01:35:43+02:00","published_at":"2021-11-25T09:18:13+01:00","backoffice_id":243479,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.23872847309355},{"id":529794,"date_start":"2022-05-25","date_end":"2022-05-28","date_next":"2022-05-25","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Una imagen interior -  El Conde de Torrefiel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Tel un sympt\u00f4me de l\u2019incertitude que nous vivons actuellement, les discussions sur l\u2019avenir sont au centre de nos conversations. Comment habiter le vide que creuse l\u2019absence de futur\u2009? Par quels moyens pouvons-nous le mat\u00e9rialiser dans les arts de la sc\u00e8ne\u2009? El Conde de Torrefiel est de retour au Kunstenfestivaldesarts apr\u00e8s l\u2019immense succ\u00e8s de leurs performances pr\u00e9c\u00e9dentes qui ont enchant\u00e9 le public bruxellois et le monde entier avec des dramaturgies innovantes\u2009: une s\u00e9rie d\u2019actions pr\u00e9cises et un texte qui s\u2019y superpose, emportant chacun\u00b7e de nous gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 notre capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 imaginer des histoires ensemble. Aujourd\u2019hui, El Conde de Torrefiel expose le pouvoir de l\u2019imagination. Le terme hyperstition est g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement attribu\u00e9 aux fictions (politiques) qui cr\u00e9ent le futur qu\u2019elles pr\u00e9disent. Mais si la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 est constitu\u00e9e de fiction, peut-\u00eatre ne peut-elle \u00eatre perturb\u00e9e que par des ultra-fictions. El Conde de Torrefiel imagine sept chapitres et une s\u00e9rie d\u2019images qui allient des r\u00e9f\u00e9rences au pass\u00e9 pr\u00e9historique et au futur. Dans le vide d\u2019un th\u00e9\u00e2tre, la plus grande machine jamais engendr\u00e9e pour l\u2019imagination, chaque action de Una imagen interior constitue un voyage m\u00e9tamorphique pr\u00eat \u00e0 nous surprendre et \u00e0 nous interroger. Un p\u00e9riple au c\u0153ur de notre imagination\u2009; une odyss\u00e9e dans le pr\u00e9sent pour nous exercer \u00e0 l\u2019imagination du futur.","performers":"El Conde de Torrefiel","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kfda.be\/","email":"info@kfda.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 219 07 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/529794.html"},"nl":{"name":"Una imagen interior -  El Conde de Torrefiel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Het zijn onzekere tijden, zoveel is zeker. En dus wordt er veel gepraat over het gebrek aan toekomst, want hoe kunnen we omgaan met de leegte die zo\u2019n afwezigheid veroorzaakt? Op welke manier kunnen we die gesprekken voeren binnen de podiumkunsten? Na het overweldigende succes van eerdere voorstellingen is El Conde de Torrefiel opnieuw te gast op Kunstenfestivaldesarts. In voorgaande voorstellingen werd het Brusselse publiek al ingepakt door hun verfrissende dramaturgie\u00ebn: een serie fascinerende, precieze acties die zich ontvouwen bovenop een meeslepende tekstlaag. Steeds is het El Conde de Torrefiel daarbij te doen om het aansporen van ons vermogen om samen verhalen te bedenken. Ook met Una imagen interior verkent het gezelschap de kracht van de verbeelding. De term hyperstitie duidt doorgaans op (politieke) ficties die de toekomst die ze voorspellen ook waar maken. Maar als de realiteit dan toch uit fictie bestaat, kan de werkelijkheid misschien alleen door \u2018ultraficties\u2019 worden verstoord? In de leegte van een theater, de grootste verbeeldingsmachine ooit, staat elke actie uit Una imagen interior voor een metaforische reis die ons verrast en bevraagt. Una imagen interior belooft een trip naar het hart van onze verbeelding, daar waar we, vertrekkend van het heden, nieuwe ficties voor de toekomst kunnen genereren.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/529794.html"},"en":{"name":"Una imagen interior -  El Conde de Torrefiel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Talking about the future is central in our conversations, a symptom of the uncertainty we are currently experiencing. How to inhabit the vacuum caused by the absence of a future? How to do this in the performing arts? El Conde de Torrefiel are back at Kunstenfestivaldesarts, following the overwhelming success of their previous performances \u2013 a.o. Guerrilla (2015), La Plaza (2018). They enchanted the Brussels audience and the world beyond with innovative dramaturgies: a series of precise actions with superimposed text, which transports each of us via our ability to imagine stories together. Now, they play with our daily relationship with fiction. Hyperstition is a term usually given to (political) fictions that create the future they predict. This phenomenon is explored by centering on the power of imagination; if reality consists of fiction, perhaps it can only be disrupted by ultra-fictions. El Conde de Torrefiel returns to Brussels with a new fascinating creation. In the emptiness of a theatre, the largest machine ever created for the imagination, every action of Una imagen interior is a metamorphic journey ready to surprise and question us. A journey to the centre of our imagination; a journey in the present to train our imagination for the future.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/529794.html"},"de":{"name":"Una imagen interior -  El Conde de Torrefiel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/529794.html"},"it":{"name":"Una imagen interior -  El Conde de Torrefiel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/529794.html"},"sp":{"name":"Una imagen interior -  El Conde de Torrefiel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/529794.html"},"pt":{"name":"Una imagen interior -  El Conde de Torrefiel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/529794.html"},"cn":{"name":"Una imagen interior -  El Conde de Torrefiel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/529794.html"}},"place":{"id":240987,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le r\u00e9cent et tr\u00e8s \u00e9pur\u00e9 b\u00e2timent du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National dispose de trois salles, certainement parmi les plus belles de Belgique, aux qualit\u00e9s techniques irr\u00e9prochables. C\u2019est un th\u00e9\u00e2tre qui veut aller \u00e0 la rencontre des artistes et du public tout comme des autres arts et des cultures d\u2019ici et d\u2019ailleurs. C\u2019est un lieu o\u00f9 les id\u00e9es se partagent et s\u2019entrechoquent \u00e0 foison. Orchestr\u00e9e par Fabrice Murgia, la programmation allie th\u00e9\u00e2tre et danse, pointures internationales et cr\u00e9ations belges francophones tout en cr\u00e9ant des ponts avec son homologue (et presque voisin) flamand, le KVS.  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Emile Jacqmainlaan","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Emile Jacqmainlaan, 111","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National beschikt over drie zalen van uitzonderlijke technische geluidskwaliteit. De programmering is bestemd voor een ruim publiek, waarbij er ruimte is voor intelligente en veeleisende voorstellingen, maar ook voor plezierige en emotionele stukken. Het theater wil een ontmoetingsplaats zijn voor zowel beroemde als bijzondere artiesten uit het Belgische en het Europese theaterlandschap. Artistiek leider Fabrice Murgia zet de nauwe samenwerking met zijn Vlaamse tegenhanger en bijna buur de KVS voort. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das moderne und schn\u00f6rkellose Geb\u00e4ude des Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber drei S\u00e4le, die zu den sch\u00f6nsten Belgiens z\u00e4hlen. Das Theater sucht die Begegnung mit den K\u00fcnstlern, dem Publikum und anderen Kunstformen und Kulturen. Ein Ort des Ideenaustauschs und der Konfrontation, unter der Leitung von Fabrice Murgia, dessen Programm auf belgisches und internationales Theater und Tanz setzt. Das Theater ist vor allem franz\u00f6sischsprachig, aber auch internationale Produktionen kommen teils in Originalsprache auf die B\u00fchne - oftmals gibt es sogar mehrsprachige Untertitel. Auch der Ausstausch mit seinem fl\u00e4mischen Pendant KVS ist ein wichtiger Eckpfeiler der Philosophie.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"na