:{"name":"Nocturnes @  the A Foundation","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":"Come and discover Thomas Boivin's exhibition Belleville during the Nocturnes 2022 and take part in our investigation workshop for children between 6 and 12 years old!\r\nFor more information: https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/528941\/nocturnes-2022","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"edith@fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/529577.html"},"de":{"name":"Nocturne \u00e0 la Fondation A","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/529577.html"},"it":{"name":"Nocturne \u00e0 la Fondation A","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/529577.html"},"sp":{"name":"Nocturne \u00e0 la Fondation A","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/529577.html"},"pt":{"name":"Nocturne \u00e0 la Fondation A","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/529577.html"},"cn":{"name":"Nocturne \u00e0 la Fondation A","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/529577.html"}},"place":{"id":251684,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Cr\u00e9\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019initiative d\u2019Astrid Ullens de Schooten, la Fondation A, reconnue d\u2019utilit\u00e9 publique, a ouvert ses portes au sud de Bruxelles, en octobre 2012. Elle a pour vocation de soutenir la cr\u00e9ation, la connaissance et la conservation de l\u2019image photographique. L\u2019objectif consiste \u00e0 explorer les enjeux et les contradictions de l\u2019image-document afin de questionner ce monde du tout visuel que nous habitons. Trois expositions temporaires sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e. Au c\u0153ur de la Fondation A, il y a une collection. Elle est compos\u00e9e de grands ensembles d\u2019\u0153uvres de photographes \u00e0 la sensibilit\u00e9 documentaire, reconnus mondialement pour bon nombre d\u2019entre eux. Depuis 2015, la Fondation A consacre \u00e9galement une exposition par saison \u00e0 un jeune cr\u00e9ateur. V\u00e9ritable plateforme consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019image photographique, elle est aussi le partenaire de projets d\u2019expositions et d\u2019\u00e9ditions, organis\u00e9s en collaboration avec d\u2019autres institutions culturelles. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"FONDATION A STICHTING","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Van Volxemlaan","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Van Volxemlaan, 304","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"Op initiatief van Astrid Ullens de Schooten opende A Stichting, een vereniging van openbaar nut, in het zuiden van Brussel in oktober 2012 haar deuren. Ze wil ondersteuning bieden aan de creatie, de kennis en de conservatie van het fotografische beeld. Het doel is de uitdagingen en de tegenstellingen die van het beelddocument uitgaan te onderzoeken, met de bedoeling de visuele wereld waarin we leven in vraag te stellen. Elk jaar worden drie tijdelijke tentoonstellingen georganiseerd. Het hart van A Stichting is een fotocollectie. Die bestaat uit grote gehelen van werk van fotografen met een documentaire insteek en van wie een groot aantal wereldwijd erkend is. Sinds 2015 besteedt A Stichting ook \u00e9\u00e9n tentoonstelling per seizoen aan een jonge fotograaf. Het is een echt platform gewijd aan de fotografie en is ook partner van tentoonstellings- en boekprojecten georganiseerd in samenwerking met andere culturele instellingen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"FONDATION A STICHTING","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Instigated by Astrid Ullens de Schooten, the state-approved A Foundation opened south of Brussels in October 2012. It aims to support the creation, awareness and conservation of photographic images. The purpose consists of exploring the challenges and contradictions surrounding document images in order to examine this very visual world that we inhabit. Three temporary exhibitions are organised each year. The collection is central to the A Foundation. It comprises great sets of works by photographers with a documentary tendency; many of them are highly regarded throughout the world. Since 2015, the A Foundation has also devoted one exhibition per season to a young creator. It is a real platform for photographic images, is also a partner for exhibition and publishing projects organised in conjunction with other cultural institutions. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"FONDATION A STICHTING","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Fundaci\u00f3n A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"En octubre de 2012, la Fundaci\u00f3n A stichting abri\u00f3 sus puertas en el sur de Bruselas en el lugar de la antigua f\u00e1brica Bata. Creada bajo la iniciativa de Astrid Ullens de Schooten, y reconocida por promover el inter\u00e9s p\u00fablico, tiene una vocaci\u00f3n para apoyar la creaci\u00f3n, el conocimiento y la preservaci\u00f3n de la imagen fotogr\u00e1fica. Ya no existe nada que no parezca haber sido atestiguado por la imagen. Sin embargo, la idea de dejar constancia sobre el uso real de la fotograf\u00eda no es necesaria. Lo que ocurre con nuestra capacidad de ver y percibir cuando en su abundancia y su inmediaci\u00f3n virtual, las im\u00e1genes que nos rodean se est\u00e1n convirtiendo r\u00e1pida y poderosamente m\u00e1s complicadas. El proyecto de la fundaci\u00f3n consiste en explorar las riesgos y contradicciones  de la imagen-documento, cuestionando un mundo en el que todo es visible. Organiza tres exhibiciones temporales cada a\u00f1o.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":13764,"location":{"lat":50.82266385,"lon":4.32563819},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-05-04T15:05:08+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:38:02+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":251684,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Cr\u00e9\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019initiative d\u2019Astrid Ullens de Schooten, la Fondation A, reconnue d\u2019utilit\u00e9 publique, a ouvert ses portes au sud de Bruxelles, en octobre 2012. Elle a pour vocation de soutenir la cr\u00e9ation, la connaissance et la conservation de l\u2019image photographique. L\u2019objectif consiste \u00e0 explorer les enjeux et les contradictions de l\u2019image-document afin de questionner ce monde du tout visuel que nous habitons. Trois expositions temporaires sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e. Au c\u0153ur de la Fondation A, il y a une collection. Elle est compos\u00e9e de grands ensembles d\u2019\u0153uvres de photographes \u00e0 la sensibilit\u00e9 documentaire, reconnus mondialement pour bon nombre d\u2019entre eux. Depuis 2015, la Fondation A consacre \u00e9galement une exposition par saison \u00e0 un jeune cr\u00e9ateur. V\u00e9ritable plateforme consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019image photographique, elle est aussi le partenaire de projets d\u2019expositions et d\u2019\u00e9ditions, organis\u00e9s en collaboration avec d\u2019autres institutions culturelles. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"FONDATION A STICHTING","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Van Volxemlaan","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Van Volxemlaan, 304","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"Op initiatief van Astrid Ullens de Schooten opende A Stichting, een vereniging van openbaar nut, in het zuiden van Brussel in oktober 2012 haar deuren. Ze wil ondersteuning bieden aan de creatie, de kennis en de conservatie van het fotografische beeld. Het doel is de uitdagingen en de tegenstellingen die van het beelddocument uitgaan te onderzoeken, met de bedoeling de visuele wereld waarin we leven in vraag te stellen. Elk jaar worden drie tijdelijke tentoonstellingen georganiseerd. Het hart van A Stichting is een fotocollectie. Die bestaat uit grote gehelen van werk van fotografen met een documentaire insteek en van wie een groot aantal wereldwijd erkend is. Sinds 2015 besteedt A Stichting ook \u00e9\u00e9n tentoonstelling per seizoen aan een jonge fotograaf. Het is een echt platform gewijd aan de fotografie en is ook partner van tentoonstellings- en boekprojecten georganiseerd in samenwerking met andere culturele instellingen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"FONDATION A STICHTING","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Instigated by Astrid Ullens de Schooten, the state-approved A Foundation opened south of Brussels in October 2012. It aims to support the creation, awareness and conservation of photographic images. The purpose consists of exploring the challenges and contradictions surrounding document images in order to examine this very visual world that we inhabit. Three temporary exhibitions are organised each year. The collection is central to the A Foundation. It comprises great sets of works by photographers with a documentary tendency; many of them are highly regarded throughout the world. Since 2015, the A Foundation has also devoted one exhibition per season to a young creator. It is a real platform for photographic images, is also a partner for exhibition and publishing projects organised in conjunction with other cultural institutions. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"FONDATION A STICHTING","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Fundaci\u00f3n A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"En octubre de 2012, la Fundaci\u00f3n A stichting abri\u00f3 sus puertas en el sur de Bruselas en el lugar de la antigua f\u00e1brica Bata. Creada bajo la iniciativa de Astrid Ullens de Schooten, y reconocida por promover el inter\u00e9s p\u00fablico, tiene una vocaci\u00f3n para apoyar la creaci\u00f3n, el conocimiento y la preservaci\u00f3n de la imagen fotogr\u00e1fica. Ya no existe nada que no parezca haber sido atestiguado por la imagen. Sin embargo, la idea de dejar constancia sobre el uso real de la fotograf\u00eda no es necesaria. Lo que ocurre con nuestra capacidad de ver y percibir cuando en su abundancia y su inmediaci\u00f3n virtual, las im\u00e1genes que nos rodean se est\u00e1n convirtiendo r\u00e1pida y poderosamente m\u00e1s complicadas. El proyecto de la fundaci\u00f3n consiste en explorar las riesgos y contradicciones  de la imagen-documento, cuestionando un mundo en el que todo es visible. Organiza tres exhibiciones temporales cada a\u00f1o.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Fondation A Stichting","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"304","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fondationastichting.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fondationastichting.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 38 78","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 304","address_line2":"1190