d people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-17T13:05:10+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-17T12:21:04+02:00","backoffice_id":253834,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.30462661910109},{"id":493097,"date_start":"2022-05-27","date_end":"2022-05-27","date_next":"2022-05-27","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,7],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Donny Ben\u00e9t - Greatest Hits - SOLD OUT","shortdescr":"Une musique disco, r\u00e9tro, d\u00e9cal\u00e9e et terriblement groovy","longdescr":"Donny Ben\u00e9t, chanteur de disco australien, arbore avec fiert\u00e9, moustache, silhouette repl\u00e8te, chevelure d\u00e9garnie et clips bidonnants. Celui qui a l\u2019apparence d\u2019un crooner italien ou d\u2019un r\u00e9alisateur de films pour adulte au milieu des ann\u00e9es 70, excelle dans son art. Vous l\u2019aurez compris, Donny ma\u00eetrise le second degr\u00e9 mais cela ne nous fait pas oublier le plus important, sa musique. Elle groove avec une facilit\u00e9 et une aisance d\u00e9concertantes. The Don arrive \u00e0 nous entra\u00eener dans son univers disco r\u00e9tro gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ses synth\u00e9s volubiles et vaporeux, l\u2019incorporation de saxophones et de sa voix languissante.\r\n\r\nGREATEST HITS\r\nGreatest Hits est un groupe australo-britanique dont la musique oscille entre sunshine pop, groove des ann\u00e9es 70 et neo-psych. Apr\u00e8s \u00eatre parti en tourn\u00e9e avec Hollow Cove et Halfnoise (Zac Farro de Paramore), l\u2019auteur-compositeur Ryan Cooper s\u2019est lanc\u00e9 dans une aventure musicale aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de Henry Chatham \u00e0 la basse et de Chelsea Foley au chant et aux percussions. Le r\u00e9sultat est un groove ensoleill\u00e9 sur lequel on a envie de se dandiner en patte d\u2019eph et chemises \u00e0 motifs color\u00e9s !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","email":"info@botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 37 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/493097.html"},"nl":{"name":"Donny Ben\u00e9t - Greatest Hits - SOLD OUT","shortdescr":"Iconische disco-pop-daddy brengt italo met een vleugje ironie","longdescr":"De Australische discogod Donny Ben\u00e9t heeft met z'n moustache, kale koppie en bijzondere videoclips de voorbije jaren een stevige cultstatus opgebouwd. Natuurlijk komt dat niet alleen door z'n look (die het midden houdt tussen Italiaanse crooner en pornoregisseur uit de jaren 70), maar vooral door z'n steamy post-ironische grooves, geschikt voor fans van Down Under-humoristen als Alex Cameron en Kirin J Callinan en liefhebbers van italo-klanken. Hoewel The Don zichzelf niet serieus neemt, is zijn muziek allerminst een grap: probeer maar eens niet in zwijm te vallen voor de retro-synthpopjams die Ben\u00e9t o zo makkelijk uit zijn mouw weet te schudden.\r\n\r\nGREATEST HITS\r\nGreatest Hits is een Australisch-Britse groep die zich laat inspireren door sunshine pop, 70's grooves en neo-psychedelica. Na tourn\u00e9es met Hollow Cove en Halfnoise (Zac Farro van Paramore), besliste de singer-songwriter Ryan Cooper om een eigen band te starten met bassist Henry Chatham en zangeres\/percussionist Chelsea Foley. Trek voor dit voorprogramme je fleurigste hemdje aan: de muziek van Greatest Hits klinkt immers als een overdosis vitamine D.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/493097.html"},"en":{"name":"Donny Ben\u00e9t - Greatest Hits - SOLD OUT","shortdescr":"Iconic funky synth-pop and post-disco blend from a funk master and timeless entertainer","longdescr":"Residing in Sydney, Australia, Ben\u00e9t burst onto the scene in 2011 with his breakthrough album \"Don't Hold Back\u201d, establishing himself as a cult figure in the Australian music scene.\r\n\r\nSeveral albums later, Ben\u00e9t's piece de resistance came in the form of the 2018 album The Don. Constant international touring throughout 2018\/19 allowed Donny to build new audiences throughout Europe and the US, with fan clubs based in Slovakia, Belgium and The Netherlands.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019s latest single Second Dinner provides a small taste of his upcoming album, to be released in 2020.\r\n\r\nBen\u00e9t works out of Donnyland Studios, utilising vintage synthesisers and drum machines to present his views on life, love, relationships and life coaching through the power of music. A perfectionist, Donny writes, performs and records his music entirely by himself.\r\n\r\nAn accomplished bassist, Don straps on the 4 string when on stage with his band of professionals, The Donny Ben\u00e9t Show band. Regularly selling out shows on home soil, they recently returned from a triumphant premiere tour of Europe playing to enraptured crowds at festivals including Rock Werchter, Down the Rabbit Hole, Pohoda Festival, Valkhof Festival, Plissken Festival, as well selling out club shows in London, Berlin & Amsterdam.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/493097.html"},"de":{"name":"Donny Ben\u00e9t","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/493097.html"},"it":{"name":"Donny Ben\u00e9t","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/493097.html"},"sp":{"name":"Donny Ben\u00e9t","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/493097.html"},"pt":{"name":"Donny Ben\u00e9t","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/493097.html"},"cn":{"name":"Donny Ben\u00e9t","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/493097.html"}},"place":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort.\r\n\r\nInmitten des botanischen Gartens von Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, einer der 19 Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinden, w\u00e4chst und gedeiht heute ein quicklebendiger Ort der Kultur, der vor allem f\u00fcr Musikveranstaltungen, als Galerie und Caf\u00e9 genutzt wird. H\u00f6hepunkt des Jahres bildet im Fr\u00fchling das Musikfestival \u201eLes Nuits Botaniques\".","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Questo grande edificio, che doveva ospitare le collezioni di un precedente giardino botanico, \u00e8 stato costruito fra il 1826 ed il 1829. L'artista-arredatore Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste diresse i lavori secondo progetto dell'architetto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Rispettando la struttura tradizionale degli aranceti, ha immaginato un'imponente cupola rotonda centrale, affiancata da due ali ciascuna delle quali terminante in un padiglione leggermente sporgente. Grazie alla sua regolarit\u00e0 e semplicit\u00e0, la costruzione illustra perfettamente i principi dello stile neoclassico. Alle vetrate che riempiono gli spazi tra le colonne della sala circolare e che coprono il portico delimitato dal colonnato stesso, si aggiungono le serre adiacenti alle ali laterali. Inizialmente si era pensato di organizzare feste all'interno di questo ambiente magico, e a questo scopo venne allestita una grande sala fra l'aranceto orientale e la sala rotonda, ma questa diventer\u00e0 poi la sala degli erbari dal 1870. Fino al 1939, l'edificio verr\u00e0 utilizzato per il suo scopo originale. Riacquistato dallo Stato nel 1970, il locale diventer\u00e0 il Centro Culturale della Federazione Vallonia-Bruxelles e verr\u00e0 inaugurato come tale nel 1984. Oggi ospita numerosi eventi culturali dedicati all'arte contemporanea e vi si svolgono festival, tra i quali il famoso Nuits du Botanique, che hanno contribuito ad affermare la sua reputazione. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Este enorme edificio, pensado para albergar las colecciones de un antiguo jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico, fue construido entre 1826 y 1829. El artista-decorador Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste dirigi\u00f3 las obras a partir de los planos del arquitecto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Respetando la estructura tradicional de los invernaderos de naranjas, imagin\u00f3 una imponente rotonda central con c\u00fapula flanqueada por dos pasillos que terminaban en un pabell\u00f3n ligeramente en relieve. Gracias a su regularidad y simplicidad, la elevaci\u00f3n ilustra a la perfecci\u00f3n los principios del estilo neocl\u00e1sico. Las vidrieras situadas en los intercolumnios de la rotonda y que cubren el p\u00f3rtico delimitado por esta misma columnata se suman a los invernaderos adosados a los pasillos laterales. Pronto se pens\u00f3 en organizar fiestas en este lugar m\u00e1gico, para lo cual se acondicion\u00f3 una sala entre el invernadero de naranjas oriental y la rotonda, pero a partir de 1870 se convirti\u00f3 en la sala de los herbarios. Hasta 1939 cumpli\u00f3 las funciones teniendo en cuenta su vocaci\u00f3n inicial. Recomprado por el Estado en 1970, el lugar se convirti\u00f3 en el centro cultural de la Federaci\u00f3n Valonia-Bruselas y se inaugur\u00f3 como tal en 1984. A d\u00eda de hoy este lugar alberga numerosas manifestaciones culturales dedicadas a la creaci\u00f3n contempor\u00e1nea y se ha vuelto prestigioso por los festivales que se celebran en \u00e9l, tales como las \u00abNoches del bot\u00e1nico\u00bb. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[15],"translations":{"fr":["Rogier"],"nl":["Rogier"],"en":["Rogier"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":5,"location":{"lat":50.8