"translations":{"fr":["Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-11T15:35:29+02:00","published_at":"2022-03-15T13:48:21+01:00","backoffice_id":249684,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":533793,"date_start":"2022-05-26","date_end":"2022-05-29","date_next":"2022-05-29","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":118,"translations":{"fr":"Festival","nl":"Festival","en":"Festival"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Afropolitan Festival","shortdescr":"L\u2019Afropolitan Festival aura lieu \u00e0 Bozar du 26 au 29 mai 2022. Plac\u00e9e sous le th\u00e8me de \u00ab Women Power \u00bb, cette 5e \u00e9dition c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la force cr\u00e9atrice des femmes artistes africaines et afro-descendantes.","longdescr":"L\u2019Afropolitan Festival aura lieu \u00e0 Bozar du 26 au 29 mai 2022. Plac\u00e9e sous le th\u00e8me de \u00ab Women Power \u00bb, cette 5e \u00e9dition c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la force cr\u00e9atrice des femmes artistes africaines et afro-descendantes. Le festival propose quatre jours d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements pluridisciplinaires : concerts, films, rencontre litt\u00e9raire, d\u00e9bats, performances, slam, fashion pop-up, masterclasses et workshops\u2026","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bozar.be\/fr\/calendrier\/afropolitan-festival-2022","email":"tickets@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533793.html"},"nl":{"name":"Afropolitan Festival","shortdescr":"Het Afropolitan Festival vindt plaats van 26 tot 29 mei 2022 in Bozar. Onder het thema \u2018Women Power\u2019 viert deze 5e editie de creatieve kracht van vrouwelijke Afrikaanse artiesten en artiesten van Afrikaanse afkomst.","longdescr":"Het Afropolitan Festival vindt plaats van 26 tot 29 mei 2022 in Bozar. Onder het thema \u2018Women Power\u2019 viert deze 5e editie de creatieve kracht van vrouwelijke Afrikaanse artiesten en artiesten van Afrikaanse afkomst. Het festival biedt vier dagen van multidisciplinaire evenementen: concerten, films, literaire ontmoetingen, debatten, performances, slam, fashion pop-up, masterclasses en workshops.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533793.html"},"en":{"name":"Afropolitan Festival","shortdescr":"The Afropolitan Festival will take place at Bozar from 26 to 29 May 2022. Under the theme of \u2018Women Power\u2019, this 5th edition celebrates the creative force of African and Afro-descendant women artists.","longdescr":"The Afropolitan Festival will take place at Bozar from 26 to 29 May 2022. Under the theme of \u2018Women Power\u2019, this 5th edition celebrates the creative force of African and Afro-descendant women artists. The festival offers four days of multidisciplinary events: concerts, films, literary meetings, debates, performances, slam, fashion pop-up, masterclasses and workshops...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533793.html"},"de":{"name":"Afropolitan Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533793.html"},"it":{"name":"Afropolitan Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533793.html"},"sp":{"name":"Afropolitan Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533793.html"},"pt":{"name":"Afropolitan Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533793.html"},"cn":{"name":"Afropolitan Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533793.html"}},"place":{"id":63,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Lorsqu\u2019on parle de la culture en Belgique, on pense forc\u00e9ment au Palais des Beaux-Arts de Bruxelles. Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse d\u2019expositions, de concerts, de th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou de cin\u00e9ma, de projets autour de la litt\u00e9rature et d\u2019architecture, BOZAR met toujours en avant l\u2019originalit\u00e9 et l\u2019innovation. Non seulement ils mettent un point d\u2019honneur \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation, la qualit\u00e9 et la richesse du programme artistique, mais se pr\u00e9occupent surtout d\u2019offrir une exp\u00e9rience totale \u00e0 ses visiteurs.","description_print":"Lorsqu\u2019on parle de la culture en Belgique, on pense forc\u00e9ment au Palais des Beaux-Arts de Bruxelles. Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse d\u2019expositions, de concerts, de th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou de cin\u00e9ma, de projets autour de la litt\u00e9rature et d\u2019architecture, BOZAR met toujours en avant l\u2019originalit\u00e9 et l\u2019innovation. Non seulement ils mettent un point d\u2019honneur \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation, la qualit\u00e9 et la richesse du programme artistique, mais se pr\u00e9occupent surtout d\u2019offrir une exp\u00e9rience totale \u00e0 ses visiteurs.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Paleis voor Schone Kunsten - Bozar","address_street_name":"Ravensteinstraat","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Ravensteinstraat, 23","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Als je in Belgi\u00eb over cultuur spreekt, dan kun je niet om het Paleis voor Schone Kunsten in Brussel heen. Of het nu gaat om tentoonstellingen, concerten, theater- en filmvoorstellingen, projecten rond literatuur en architectuur, steeds stelt Bozar originaliteit en vernieuwing voorop. Ze bewijzen dat ze de vinger aan de pols hebben met hun gevarieerd en uitgekiend programma. Niet alleen creatie, kwaliteit en een rijk artistiek aanbod draagt de zorg weg. Bij Bozar zijn ze bekommerd om de totaalervaring. Het imposante en tegelijk intieme gebouw - van de hand van Horta- heeft een bevreemdende schoonheid.","description_print":"Als je in Belgi\u00eb over cultuur spreekt, dan kun je niet om het Paleis voor Schone Kunsten in Brussel heen. Of het nu gaat om tentoonstellingen, concerten, theater- en filmvoorstellingen, projecten rond literatuur en architectuur, steeds stelt Bozar originaliteit en vernieuwing voorop. Ze bewijzen dat ze de vinger aan de pols hebben met hun gevarieerd en uitgekiend programma. Niet alleen creatie, kwaliteit en een rijk artistiek aanbod draagt de zorg weg. Bij Bozar zijn ze bekommerd om de totaalervaring. Het imposante en tegelijk intieme gebouw - van de hand van Horta- heeft een bevreemdende schoonheid.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre for Fine Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"It\u2019s impossible to talk about culture in Belgium without mentioning the Centre for Fine Arts located in Brussels. Whether it comes to exhibitions, concerts, theater performances, movies or projects concerning literature and architecture, BOZAR will always put originality and innovation first. They prove to keep a finger on the pulse with their varied and sophisticated programme. Besides emphasizing the importance of creation, quality and a rich artistic offering, BOZAR is especially concerned about the total experience of the visitors.","description_print":"It\u2019s impossible to talk about culture in Belgium without mentioning the Centre for Fine Arts located in Brussels. Whether it comes to exhibitions, concerts, theater performances, movies or projects concerning literature and architecture, BOZAR will always put originality and innovation first. They prove to keep a finger on the pulse with their varied and sophisticated programme. Besides emphasizing the importance of creation, quality and a rich artistic offering, BOZAR is especially concerned about the total experience of the visitors.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Br\u00fcsseler BOZAR z\u00e4hlt zu den dynamischsten und hochkar\u00e4tigsten Kultur- und Kunstzentren der belgischen Kulturlandschaft. Das Art D\u00e9co-Meisterwerk aus der Feder Victor Hortas ist zudem einer der gro\u00dfen architektonischen Sch\u00e4tze Br\u00fcssels.\r\nKultur, Kultur und noch mehr Kultur! Auf mehr als 4 000 Quadratmetern gibt es Konzerte, Ausstellungen, Theater, Tanz, Literatur, Konferenzen und Filmvorf\u00fchrungen unter einem Dach zu sehen.\r\n\r\nF\u00fcr Musikinteressierte reicht das Angebot von Weltmusik \u00fcber Electronic DJs bis hin zum klassischen Symphonieorchester. Kunst- und Literaturliebhaber kommen mit zeitgen\u00f6ssischen, avantgardistischen und klassischen Kunst- und Gem\u00e4ldeausstellungen, der Fotobiennale Summer of Photography, mehrsprachigen Theaterinszenierungen, Brussels Short Film Festival, Book Clubs in franz\u00f6sischer und fl\u00e4mischer Version oder auch Architekturkonferenzen auf ihre Kosten.\r\n\r\nBOZAR-Brasserie:\r\nKulturinteressierte Genie\u00dfer k\u00f6nnen sich in der BOZAR-Brasserie von dem franz\u00f6sischen Chefkoch David Martin mit Men\u00fcs verw\u00f6hnen lassen, die dem kulturellen Angebot in nichts nachstehen. Die Brasserie ist Teil eines umfassenden Restaurierungs- und Renovierungsprogramms, sie wurde nach dem Vorbild der Original-Horta-Brasserie gestaltet. Von dem Gourmetf\u00fchrer Gault&Millau 2013 wurde sie \u00fcbrigens zur \u201eBrasserie des Jahres\" gew\u00e4hlt! \r\n\r\nBozar Caf\u00e9 Victor\r\nFr\u00fchst\u00fcck, Mittag- oder Abendessen vor oder nach dem Ausstellungs- oder Konzertbesuch k\u00f6nnen im Caf\u00e9 Victor eingenommen werden. Gro\u00dfe Fensterfronten, puristisches Design, edle Lederb\u00e4nke, spektakul\u00e4re Leuchten und feine Snacks und Speisen ergeben ein harmonisches Ensemble.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Palazzo delle Belle Arti - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"BOZAR il Palazzo delle Belle Arti, centro d'arte per eccellenza del panorama culturale belga, offre un programma internazionale nel cuore di Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nL'edificio \u00e8 un gioiello del patrimonio architettonico del Belgio. E' stato realizzato da Victor Horta in stile Art Nouveau nel 1920.\r\n\r\nIl Bozar \u00e8 un centro d'arte attivo e dinamico che accoglie ogni anno pi\u00f9 di un milione di visitatori: 4.000 m\u00b2 di spazi espositivi, una grandiosa sala concerti, una sala per musica da camera, due piccoli teatri, tre nuove sale multimediali, il BOZAR SHOP, la BOZAR BRASSERIE e la Cinemateca Reale, famosa in tutto il mondo per la sua collezione di grande valore.\r\n\r\n\r\nLa BOZAR BRASSERIE vi aspetta con il suo chef stellato David Martin. Prenotazioni, solo per telefono, al n\u00b0 +32 (0)2 503 00 00. Aperto 7 giorni su 7, dalle 12 alle 23.\r\n\r\nVisitate anche il BOZARSHOP: migliaia di libri d'arte, CD, DVD, idee regalo.\r\nSpazio giochi per i vostri bambini.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Palacio de las Bellas Artes - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El Bozar, el Palacio de las Bellas Artes, es el centro de arte por excelencia del paisaje cultural belga. \r\n\r\nEl Palacio de las Bellas Artes de Bruselas ofrece un programa cultural y art\u00edstico. Es uno de los n\u00facleos art\u00edsticos m\u00e1s din\u00e1micos de B\u00e9lgica, con 1 mill\u00f3n de visitas al a\u00f1o. \r\n\r\nEn el programa: exposiciones, m\u00fasica, danza, teatro, cine, literatura o arquitectura para peque\u00f1os y no tan peque\u00f1os. \r\n\r\nEl edificio constituye una de las obras maestras del patrimonio arquitect\u00f3nico de B\u00e9lgica. \r\n\r\nEste Palacio Art D\u00e9co lo ide\u00f3 el arquitecto Victor Horta en 1920 e incluye:\r\n\r\n- M\u00e1s de 4.000 m\u00b2 espacios de exposici\u00f3n\r\n- La Sala Henry le B\u0153uf, es decir, una magn\u00edfica sala de conciertos\r\n- 1 sala de m\u00fasica de c\u00e1mara\r\n- 2 peque\u00f1os teatros y 3 nuevas salas multimedia\r\n- La Bozar Brasserie y la cocina innovadora del chef galardonado David Martin\r\n- La Cinemateca Real y su indiscutible colecci\u00f3n internacionalmente conocida\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centro de Belas Artes \u2014 Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ao falar da cultura belga, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio mencionar o Pal\u00e1cio de Belas Artes de Bruxelas. Quer sejam exposi\u00e7\u00f5es, concertos, teatro, cinema ou projetos liter\u00e1rios e arquitet\u00f3nicos, BOZAR coloca sempre em primeira linha a originalidade e inova\u00e7\u00e3o. N\u00e3o s\u00f3 enfatiza a cria\u00e7\u00e3o, qualidade e riqueza do programa art\u00edstico, mas preocupa-se sobretudo em oferecer uma experi\u00eancia completa aos seus visitantes.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[16],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier Royal"],"nl":["Koninklijke wijk"],"en":["Royal"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":13,"location":{"lat":50.8442214,"lon":4.35950594},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-05-17T10:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":63,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Lorsqu\u2019on parle de la culture en Belgique, on pense forc\u00e9ment au Palais des Beaux-Arts de Bruxelles. Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse d\u2019expositions, de concerts, de th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou de cin\u00e9ma, de projets autour de la litt\u00e9rature et d\u2019architecture, BOZAR met toujours en avant l\u2019originalit\u00e9 et l\u2019innovation. Non seulement ils mettent un point d\u2019honneur \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation, la qualit\u00e9 et la richesse du programme artistique, mais se pr\u00e9occupent surtout d\u2019offrir une exp\u00e9rience totale \u00e0 ses visiteurs.","description_print":"Lorsqu\u2019on parle de la culture en Belgique, on pense forc\u00e9ment au Palais des Beaux-Arts de Bruxelles. Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse d\u2019expositions, de concerts, de th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou de cin\u00e9ma, de projets autour de la litt\u00e9rature et d\u2019architecture, BOZAR met toujours en avant l\u2019originalit\u00e9 et l\u2019innovation. Non seulement ils mettent un point d\u2019honneur \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation, la qualit\u00e9 et la richesse du programme artistique, mais se pr\u00e9occupent surtout d\u2019offrir une exp\u00e9rience totale \u00e0 ses visiteurs.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Paleis voor Schone Kunsten - Bozar","address_street_name":"Ravensteinstraat","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Ravensteinstraat, 23","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Als je in Belgi\u00eb over cultuur spreekt, dan kun je niet om het Paleis voor Schone Kunsten in Brussel heen. Of het nu gaat om tentoonstellingen, concerten, theater- en filmvoorstellingen, projecten rond literatuur en architectuur, steeds stelt Bozar originaliteit en vernieuwing voorop. Ze bewijzen dat ze de vinger aan de pols hebben met hun gevarieerd en uitgekiend programma. Niet alleen creatie, kwaliteit en een rijk artistiek aanbod draagt de zorg weg. Bij Bozar zijn ze bekommerd om de totaalervaring. Het imposante en tegelijk intieme gebouw - van de hand van Horta- heeft een bevreemdende schoonheid.","description_print":"Als je in Belgi\u00eb over cultuur spreekt, dan kun je niet om het Paleis voor Schone Kunsten in Brussel heen. Of het nu gaat om tentoonstellingen, concerten, theater- en filmvoorstellingen, projecten rond literatuur en architectuur, steeds stelt Bozar originaliteit en vernieuwing voorop. Ze bewijzen dat ze de vinger aan de pols hebben met hun gevarieerd en uitgekiend programma. Niet alleen creatie, kwaliteit en een rijk artistiek aanbod draagt de zorg weg. Bij Bozar zijn ze bekommerd om de totaalervaring. Het imposante en tegelijk intieme gebouw - van de hand van Horta- heeft een bevreemdende schoonheid.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre for Fine Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"It\u2019s impossible to talk about culture in Belgium without mentioning the Centre for Fine Arts located in Brussels. Whether it comes to exhibitions, concerts, theater performances, movies or projects concerning literature and architecture, BOZAR will always put originality and innovation first. They prove to keep a finger on the pulse with their varied and sophisticated programme. Besides emphasizing the importance of creation, quality and a rich artistic offering, BOZAR is especially concerned about the total experience of the visitors.","description_print":"It\u2019s impossible to talk about culture in Belgium without mentioning the Centre for Fine Arts located in Brussels. Whether it comes to exhibitions, concerts, theater performances, movies or projects concerning literature and architecture, BOZAR will always put originality and innovation first. They prove to keep a finger on the pulse with their varied and sophisticated programme. Besides emphasizing the importance of creation, quality and a rich artistic offering, BOZAR is especially concerned about the total experience of the visitors.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Br\u00fcsseler BOZAR z\u00e4hlt zu den dynamischsten und hochkar\u00e4tigsten Kultur- und Kunstzentren der belgischen Kulturlandschaft. Das Art D\u00e9co-Meisterwerk aus der Feder Victor Hortas ist zudem einer der gro\u00dfen architektonischen Sch\u00e4tze Br\u00fcssels.\r\nKultur, Kultur und noch mehr Kultur! Auf mehr als 4 000 Quadratmetern gibt es Konzerte, Ausstellungen, Theater, Tanz, Literatur, Konferenzen und Filmvorf\u00fchrungen unter einem Dach zu sehen.\r\n\r\nF\u00fcr Musikinteressierte reicht das Angebot von Weltmusik \u00fcber Electronic DJs bis hin zum klassischen Symphonieorchester. Kunst- und Literaturliebhaber kommen mit zeitgen\u00f6ssischen, avantgardistischen und klassischen Kunst- und Gem\u00e4ldeausstellungen, der Fotobiennale Summer of Photography, mehrsprachigen Theaterinszenierungen, Brussels Short Film Festival, Book Clubs in franz\u00f6sischer und fl\u00e4mischer Version oder auch Architekturkonferenzen auf ihre Kosten.\r\n\r\nBOZAR-Brasserie:\r\nKulturinteressierte Genie\u00dfer k\u00f6nnen sich in der BOZAR-Brasserie von dem franz\u00f6sischen Chefkoch David Martin mit Men\u00fcs verw\u00f6hnen lassen, die dem kulturellen Angebot in nichts nachstehen. Die Brasserie ist Teil eines umfassenden Restaurierungs- und Renovierungsprogramms, sie wurde nach dem Vorbild der Original-Horta-Brasserie gestaltet. Von dem Gourmetf\u00fchrer Gault&Millau 2013 wurde sie \u00fcbrigens zur \u201eBrasserie des Jahres\" gew\u00e4hlt! \r\n\r\nBozar Caf\u00e9 Victor\r\nFr\u00fchst\u00fcck, Mittag- oder Abendessen vor oder nach dem Ausstellungs- oder Konzertbesuch k\u00f6nnen im Caf\u00e9 Victor eingenommen werden. Gro\u00dfe Fensterfronten, puristisches Design, edle Lederb\u00e4nke, spektakul\u00e4re Leuchten und feine Snacks und Speisen ergeben ein harmonisches Ensemble.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Palazzo delle Belle Arti - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"BOZAR il Palazzo delle Belle Arti, centro d'arte per eccellenza del panorama culturale belga, offre un programma internazionale nel cuore di Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nL'edificio \u00e8 un gioiello del patrimonio architettonico del Belgio. E' stato realizzato da Victor Horta in stile Art Nouveau nel 1920.\r\n\r\nIl Bozar \u00e8 un centro d'arte attivo e dinamico che accoglie ogni anno pi\u00f9 di un milione di visitatori: 4.000 m\u00b2 di spazi espositivi, una grandiosa sala concerti, una sala per musica da camera, due piccoli teatri, tre nuove sale multimediali, il BOZAR SHOP, la BOZAR BRASSERIE e la Cinemateca Reale, famosa in tutto il mondo per la sua collezione di grande valore.\r\n\r\n\r\nLa BOZAR BRASSERIE vi aspetta con il suo chef stellato David Martin. Prenotazioni, solo per telefono, al n\u00b0 +32 (0)2 503 00 00. Aperto 7 giorni su 7, dalle 12 alle 23.\r\n\r\nVisitate anche il BOZARSHOP: migliaia di libri d'arte, CD, DVD, idee regalo.\r\nSpazio giochi per i vostri bambini.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Palacio de las Bellas Artes - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El Bozar, el Palacio de las Bellas Artes, es el centro de arte por excelencia del paisaje cultural belga. \r\n\r\nEl Palacio de las Bellas Artes de Bruselas ofrece un programa cultural y art\u00edstico. Es uno de los n\u00facleos art\u00edsticos m\u00e1s din\u00e1micos de B\u00e9lgica, con 1 mill\u00f3n de visitas al a\u00f1o. \r\n\r\nEn el programa: exposiciones, m\u00fasica, danza, teatro, cine, literatura o arquitectura para peque\u00f1os y no tan peque\u00f1os. \r\n\r\nEl edificio constituye una de las obras maestras del patrimonio arquitect\u00f3nico de B\u00e9lgica. \r\n\r\nEste Palacio Art D\u00e9co lo ide\u00f3 el arquitecto Victor Horta en 1920 e incluye:\r\n\r\n- M\u00e1s de 4.000 m\u00b2 espacios de exposici\u00f3n\r\n- La Sala Henry le B\u0153uf, es decir, una magn\u00edfica sala de conciertos\r\n- 1 sala de m\u00fasica de c\u00e1mara\r\n- 2 peque\u00f1os teatros y 3 nuevas salas multimedia\r\n- La Bozar Brasserie y la cocina innovadora del chef galardonado David Martin\r\n- La Cinemateca Real y su indiscutible colecci\u00f3n internacionalmente conocida\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centro de Belas Artes \u2014 Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ao falar da cultura belga, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio mencionar o Pal\u00e1cio de Belas Artes de Bruxelas. Quer sejam exposi\u00e7\u00f5es, concertos, teatro, cinema ou projetos liter\u00e1rios e arquitet\u00f3nicos, BOZAR coloca sempre em primeira linha a originalidade e inova\u00e7\u00e3o. N\u00e3o s\u00f3 enfatiza a cria\u00e7\u00e3o, qualidade e riqueza do programa art\u00edstico, mas preocupa-se sobretudo em oferecer uma experi\u00eancia completa aos seus visitantes.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":13,"location":{"lat":50.8442214,"lon":4.35950594},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-05-17T10:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/244c796dce7c67c55b9aa8b6ab286ec44814542c.jpg","width":2471,"height":3344,"ratio":0.74,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Afropolitan Festival","copyright":"Mandisa Dumezweni, framed photography by \u00a9Hassan Hajjaj, 2011\/1432"},"nl":{"title":"Afropolitan Festival","copyright":"Mandisa Dumezweni, framed photography by \u00a9Hassan Hajjaj, 2011\/1432"},"en":{"title":"Afropolitan Festival","copyright":"Mandisa Dumezweni, framed photography by \u00a9Hassan Hajjaj, 2011\/1432"}}},{"type":"video","link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=-MclGPrTOsw&t=1s","oEmbed_title":"Afropolitan 2022 | Teaser | Bozar","oEmbed_author_name":"Palais des beaux-arts de Bruxelles","oEmbed_author_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/c\/bozarbrussels1","oEmbed_type":"video","oEmbed_height":200,"oEmbed_width":356,"oEmbed_version":"1.0","oEmbed_provider_name":"YouTube","oEmbed_provider_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/","oEmbed_thumbnail_height":360,"oEmbed_thumbnail_width":480,"oEmbed_thumbnail_url":"https:\/\/i.ytimg.com\/vi\/-MclGPrTOsw\/hqdefault.jpg","oEmbed_html":"<iframe width=\"356\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-MclGPrTOsw?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>","translations":{"fr":{"title":"Afropolitan 2022 | Teaser | Bozar"},"nl":{"title":"Afropolitan 2022 | Teaser | Bozar"},"en":{"title":"Afropolitan 2022 | Teaser | Bozar"}}}],"dates":[],"prices":[],"child_events":[531880,531878,531879,530190,532854,530358,530359,531167,532700,533118,529540,530279,531168,532285,532094],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[4,5,11,7,12,8,10,19],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 6-9 ans","Enfants 9-12 ans","Famille","Jeunes 12-15 ans","LGTBQIA","Jeunes 15-18 ans","Seniors","Enseignants"],"nl":["Kinderen 6-9 j.","Kinderen 9-12 j.","Familie","Jongeren 12-15 j.","LGTBQIA","Jongeren 15-18 j.","Senioren","Leerkrachten"],"en":["Children 6-9 yr.","Children 9-12 yr.","Family","Youth 12-15  yr.","LGTBQIA","Youth 15-18  yr.","Seniors","Teachers"]}},"tags":["major_event","kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[252,255,256,257,259,261,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux personnes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour les personnes aveugles et malvoyantes","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-17T10:05:05+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-16T17:30:53+02:00","backoffice_id":253793,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"festival","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":533910,"date_start":"2022-05-29","date_end":"2022-05-29","date_next":"2022-05-29","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{"list":[103],"translations":{"fr":["Centre historique"],"nl":["Historisch centrum"],"en":["Historical Centre"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"De place en place","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Une balade du haut vers le bas de Bruxelles, \u00e0 la (re)d\u00e9couverte de places c\u00e9l\u00e8bres ou inconnues, bruyantes ou oubli\u00e9es, color\u00e9es ou calmes...\r\nIl y en a pour tous les go\u00fbts et dans tous les styles !\r\nAu fil du temps, la ville a cr\u00e9\u00e9 ou supprim\u00e9 des places. Chacune rappelle des histoires connues, cache ses secrets, d\u00e9voile ses charmes et ses faiblesses. Chacune vit la ville \u00e0 sa mani\u00e8re et offre au passant une pause pour go\u00fbter \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e2me bruxelloise.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/rdvculturels.be","email":"rdvculturelsbe@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 476 40 98 30","phone_booking":"+32 476 40 98 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533910.html"},"nl":{"name":"De place en place","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533910.html"},"en":{"name":"De place en place","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533910.html"},"de":{"name":"De place en place","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533910.html"},"it":{"name":"De place en place","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533910.html"},"sp":{"name":"De place en place","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533910.html"},"pt":{"name":"De place en place","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533910.html"},"cn":{"name":"De place en place","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533910.html"}},"place":{"id":478,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cath\u00e9drale Saints Michel et Gudule","address_street_name":"Parvis Sainte-Gudule","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"arsincathedrali@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 75 30","phone_booking":"+32 479 30 67 79","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parvis Sainte-Gudule","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Une v\u00e9ritable juxtaposition des styles du gothique braban\u00e7on nous plonge au 13e si\u00e8cle dans l'atmosph\u00e8re des grands b\u00e2tisseurs. Tr\u00e8s fran\u00e7aise gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ses deux tours, elle fut commenc\u00e9e en 1226, tandis que la fa\u00e7ade date du 15e si\u00e8cle. Les prodigieux vitraux du transept et de la chapelle du Saint-Sacrement furent ex\u00e9cut\u00e9s d'apr\u00e8s les cartons de Bernard Van Orley et offerts par Charles Quint et sa famille. Dans le ch\u0153ur reposent Jean II, duc de Brabant, son \u00e9pouse Marguerite d'York et l'archiduc Ernest. Les archiducs Albert et Isabelle et Charles de Lorraine reposent dans la Chapelle du Saint-Sacrement.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Sint-Michiel- en Sint-Goedelekathedraal","address_street_name":"Sinter-Goedelevoorplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"arsincathedrali@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 75 30","phone_booking":"+32 479 30 67 79","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Sinter-Goedelevoorplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Een combinatie van de diverse stijlen van de Brabantse gotiek voert ons terug naar de 13de eeuw, de tijd van de grote kathedralenbouwers. De werken aan het gebouw, dat door zijn twee torens erg Frans aandoet, gingen van start in 1226, maar de gevel dateert uit de 15de eeuw. De prachtige glas-in-loodramen van de kruisbeuk en van de kapel van het Heilig Sacrament zijn een ontwerp van Bernard Van Orley en werden aan de kerk geschonken door Keizer Karel en zijn familie. In het koor rusten Jan II, hertog van Brabant, zijn vrouw Margaretha van York en aartshertog Ernest van Oostenrijk. De aartshertogen Albrecht en Isabella en Karel van Lotharingen liggen in de kapel van het Heilig Sacrament.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cathedrale Saints Michel et Gudule","address_street_name":"Parvis Sainte Gudule","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"arsincathedrali@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 75 30","phone_booking":"+32 479 30 67 79","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parvis Sainte Gudule","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"A veritable juxtaposition of Brabant Gothic styles takes us back to the 13th century and the atmosphere of the great builders. Its two towers give it a very French appearance. Building of the cathedral started in 1226, whilst the facade dates from the 15th century. The prodigious stained-glass windows of the transept and of La Chapelle du Saint-Sacrement (Chapel of the Blessed Sacrament) were inspired by the drawings of Bernard Van Orley and donated by Charles V and his family. The chancel is the final resting place of Jean II, Duke of Brabant, his wife Margaret of York and the Archduke Ernest. The Archduke Albert and his wife Isabelle and Archduke Charles de Lorraine lie in the chapel of Saint-Sacrement.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Kathedrale Saints Michel et Gudule","address_street_name":"Parvis Sainte Gudule","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"arsincathedrali@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 75 30","phone_booking":"+32 479 30 67 79","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parvis Sainte Gudule","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die die auf einer Anh\u00f6he erbaute Br\u00fcsseler Kathedrale Saints-Michel-et-Gudule ragt nach den st\u00e4dtebaulichen Ver\u00e4nderungen des Br\u00fcsseler Nordens im 20. Jahrhunderts wie ein Monument aus der Br\u00fcsseler Skyline hervor.\r\n\r\nIhre heutige Gestalt veranschaulicht deutlich die drei aufeinanderfolgenden Bauphasen im gotischen Stil. In Angriff genommen wurde der Bau der Kathedrale bereits im 13. Jahrhundert, doch fertiggestellt wurde sie erst zwei Jahrhunderte sp\u00e4ter. Besonders eindrucksvoll sind die \u00dcberreste der romanischen Stiftskirche sowie die pr\u00e4chtigen Fenster aus dem 16. Jh., die Apostelstatuen im Schiff, die Kanzel im Barockstil, der Schatz und die gro\u00dfe Orgel.\r\n\r\nBei der Kathedrale handelt es sich um das wichtigste Gotteshaus der Stadt Br\u00fcssel, gleichzeitig dient sie als Sitz der Erzdi\u00f6zese Br\u00fcssel-Malines, der h\u00f6chstens Instanz der kirchlichen Hierarchie in Belgien. Desweiteren spielt sie eine wichtige Rolle im gesellschaftlichen, geistlichen und kulturellen Leben der Stadt und des Landes, denn hier finden auch die wichtigsten Zeremonien der K\u00f6nigsfamilie statt (Trauerfeiern, Hochzeiten, so auch die Hochzeit des derzeitigen K\u00f6nigs Philippe etc.).","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cattedrale St-Michel e Gudule a Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Parvis Sainte Gudule","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"arsincathedrali@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 75 30","phone_booking":"+32 479 30 67 79","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parvis Sainte Gudule","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Costruita in cima ad una collina, la cattedrale riflette le tre fasi dello stile gotico della sua costruzione.\u00a0...\r\n\"Costruita in cima ad una collina, la cattedrale riflette le tre fasi dello stile gotico della sua costruzione.\r\nDa notare i resti della collegiata romanica, le sue vetrate del XVI secolo, le statue degli apostoli della navata, il pulpito in stile barocco, il suo tesoro, il suo grande organo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"La Catedral de San Miguel y Santa G\u00fadula en Bruselas","address_street_name":"Parvis Sainte Gudule","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"arsincathedrali@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 75 30","phone_booking":"+32 479 30 67 79","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parvis Sainte Gudule","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Construida en la cima de una colina, esta catedral refleja las tres fases del estilo g\u00f3tico.\u00a0...\r\n\"Construida en la cima de una colina, esta catedral refleja las tres fases del estilo g\u00f3tico.\u00a0\r\n\r\nEn su interior destacan los vestigios de la antigua colegiata rom\u00e1nica, las vidrieras del s. XVI, las estatuas de los ap\u00f3stoles de la nave, el p\u00falpito de estilo barroco y su mayor tesoro, el \u00f3rgano.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cath\u00e9drale Saints Michel et Gudule","address_street_name":"Parvis Sainte-Gudule","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"arsincathedrali@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 75 30","phone_booking":"+32 479 30 67 79","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parvis Sainte-Gudule","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":